window.FWN_GODLY_EMPRESS_DOCTOR_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_GODLY_EMPRESS_DOCTOR_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":3301,"title":"Chapter 3301 Aircraft Manufacturing Plant (1)","paragraphs":["3301 Aircraft Manufacturing Plant (1)","Feng Wu used her strength in a clever way.","Therefore, the two men’s abdomens were in so much pain that they almost convulsed!","That wasn’t the only consequence.","When they were kicked away, they didn’t dare to land.","Because they would make a sound when they landed, they tried their best to deflect the force.","This time, it hurt even more.","However, what shocked them even more was...","How did this person know their names?!","At this moment, ten people were carrying a fighter jet toward them.","Feng Wu glared at them and lowered her voice. “If you want to die, don’t drag me down with you! Get over here!”","This tone of command was so decisive.","However, when Feng Wu gave the order, the two of them went over obediently.","Feng Wu dragged them over and hid them behind a rock.","“We can’t hide here. We’ll be discovered!” Zhui was anxious!","Feng Wu said, “Shut up!”","Zhui wanted to say something else, but Feng Wu glared at him. “Useless! If I’d known you were such a coward, I wouldn’t have let our captain send you here!”","Captain?","Zhui was about to say something, when Feng Wu glared at him, and he fell silent.","Feng Wu said, “Don’t worry. I used an illusion trick. They won’t notice us.”","However, how could Zhui and Meng believe her?","There were ten people on the other side. If they turned their heads slightly and looked over, they would discover the three of them!","Just then, someone really looked in their direction.","Ahhhhh —","Zhui and Meng panicked.","They stood ramrod straight. Their muscles were tense, and they were ready to go into battle.","However, those men acted as if they couldn’t see the three of them at all. Carrying the fighter jet, they left.","It wasn’t until they turned toward another black building complex that Meng realized what was going on. He looked at Feng Wu in shock. “You... How could you be so sure that he wouldn’t notice us?”","Feng Wu retorted impatiently, “Are you retarded? I told you I know how to use illusions!”","“Then why did you save us?” Zhui asked nervously.","If it wasn’t for this person in black, the two of them would have been discovered. The only thing that would have awaited them after that was death.","Feng Wu said, “You two are so stupid. Why would the captain let you come alone? I’ve been following you and protecting you all the way, but you didn’t notice me at all. You idiots!”","What?","Zhui and Meng looked at each other.","Didn’t the captain say this mission would only be assigned to them?","However, according to this teenager, “he” was here to secretly protect them... That was actually possible.","However, they were still a little suspicious.","Feng Wu glared at them. “I wonder what the second prince sees in you. You’re as stupid as pigs!”","The second prince?","There were very, very few people in this world who knew that the captain worked for the second prince.","“Are you really one of us? Did the captain really send you to protect us?” Zhui was already 80% convinced.","Feng Wu asked, “Do you know anything about Level 8 inscriptions?”","The two men shook their heads.","Feng Wu asked, “Can you get in?”","She pointed at the door to the building complex.","The two men shook their heads.","Feng Wu said, “Let’s go. I’ll get you in.”","Get in?","Meng and Zhui looked at each other and saw the excitement in each other’s eyes!","They had been stopped outside the door by the Level 8 inscription, and their hearts had burned with anxiety.","The others seemed to be able to just scan their faces and go in, but they couldn’t enter no matter what.","If they couldn’t find out what was going on inside, how could they make a contribution?"]},{"number":3302,"title":"Chapter 3302 Aircraft Manufacturing Plant (2)","paragraphs":["3302 Aircraft Manufacturing Plant (2)","If they could inquire about the situation inside and draw a map, they would be able to live a comfortable life when they returned.","At that thought, both Meng and Zhui nodded at Feng Wu.","They now believed that Feng Wu was one of the second prince’s men and was there to protect and help them.","Their captain was so considerate!","!!","However, they still had some doubts.","After Feng Wu broke the formation and led them into the building complex, all their suspicions were swept away.","“We’re in! We’re in!”","The two of them were extremely excited.","They quickly found a spot to hide.","Zhui took out a piece of parchment from his chest pocket and carefully opened it.","Feng Wu moved closer to take a look.","It was a map.","It used a simple composition method to depict some of the locations.","It was indeed very simple.","The only places marked on it were the inscription engraving area, the mechanical manufacturing area, the assembly area, and the inventory area.","There were no other notes.","The huge building complex in front of them was at least a million square meters, and there were people coming and going. It was a very difficult mission.","“Let’s split up,” Feng Wu said to the two men. “Be careful. Once you’re done, get back immediately!”","“What about you?” Zhui asked Feng Wu.","Feng Wu said, “I have another mission!”","After that, Feng Wu ran off.","Why had she stepped forward to greet the two men? That was an important part of Feng Wu’s plan.","Unfortunately, these two men didn’t know that and thought Feng Wu was the second prince’s subordinate like them. They just thought that Feng Wu had some other task to do.","“I forgot to ask his name.” Zhui felt a little regretful.","Meng said, “In our line of work, how can there be proper names? Most of us only have code names. We’ll know when we go back and ask the captain. Let’s get to work now.”","The main reason they came this time was to take the lead and probe for more information. They would draw a map and submit everything.","The second prince would naturally send very capable people to carry out this mission.","Meng and Zhui both knew the second prince was trying to destroy this underground fighter jet manufacturing plant and frame the crown prince. This would make His Majesty lose trust in the crown prince.","“Right now, we have a common interest with the Junwu Empire.” Zhui let out a long sigh.","Meng stared at him. “Don’t say that! The second prince will never cooperate with the Junwu Empire! Otherwise, he’ll be killed!”","At the same moment, Feng Wu was rushing towards the inscription section at her fastest speed!","The inscription propeller!","Feng Wu hadn’t forgotten how shabby the Magical Equipment Division was.","They couldn’t even make an inscription propeller!","When she finally got her hands on a propeller, she got halfway through taking notes, when someone made trouble for her, and the inscription propeller was gone again... Feng Wu was at a loss.","If she were given some time to study it, she might really be able to build one after a while.","Since Dongsang already had completed ones, and her time was so precious, why should she spend it on research?","Hence, Feng Wu went straight to the inscription section.","She wanted to steal the inscription code!","In the dark, Feng Wu moved as fast as a shooting star. When one took a closer look, they would think they were seeing things.","Within a few breaths, Feng Wu arrived at the inscription section.","However, before she could enter, she heard two people not far away.","The two of them were squatting and smoking while chatting.","Feng Wu didn’t pay much attention at first, but the first thing they said stunned her."]},{"number":3303,"title":"Chapter 3303 Second-Generation Jet","paragraphs":["3303 Second-Generation Jet","The two of them were smoking while chatting.","Feng Wu didn’t pay much attention at first, but the first thing they said stunned her.","“Are we really going to attack Nest Fortress?”","Hearing that, Feng Wu slipped and almost fell.","!!","Finally, she managed to stabilize herself and didn’t hit the wall with a bang.","Hiding in a dark corner, Feng Wu wasn’t in a hurry to leave. She stared at the two people in front of her.","The other person added, “From the looks of it, the war really is coming.”","“That’s great! We’ve been working in secret for so long, and we’re finally going to shine! The world will know how far-reaching His Royal Highness’s plan is!”","“I heard the Junwu Empire can’t even make their own fighter jet.”","“Isn’t that right? We have at least a hundred of them here, right?”","“A hundred? 300!”","“Oh my god, so many?”","“That’s right! We’ve accumulated so many of them over the years. We’ll fly them all into the air together and control the sky. We can dump inscription bombs on Nest. Wow... I feel so good just thinking about it!”","“By the way, were you involved in the bombing of Nest previously?”","“Of course! It’s a pity that we only attacked once before stopping.”","“This time, I’ll also apply to fly a fighter jet and attack Nest! It’ll definitely be very satisfying!”","“Of course. When you fly in the air and drop bombs at will, rumbling flames will soar into the sky. The enemy will be so frightened that they’ll scatter in all directions. Countless people will be killed or injured, and buildings will collapse with a bang. Hahaha...”","“I heard the girls of the Junwu Empire are especially beautiful.”","“I heard that too. We’ll snatch these girls and bring them back to become our maids!”","Feng Wu frowned.","She wanted to walk out and grab these two men. With a bang, she would smash their heads together and kill them.","But —","Now wasn’t the time.","Feng Wu gave them a deep look and didn’t linger for another second.","She still had very important things to do.","The inscription section was specially designed to carve inscription propellers.","The security was tight, but it wasn’t a problem for Feng Wu.","Feng Wu caught up with a capable-looking girl when she saw the latter coming out. A few moments later, the girl reached a secluded area, and Feng Wu knocked her out from behind.","After changing into the girl’s clothes, Feng Wu swaggered into the inscription room.","“Duri, weren’t you going to bed? Why are you back?”","The inscription area was brightly lit. There were still many people in their seats who were carving inscriptions.","Feng Wu cleared her throat.","A middle-aged man hurriedly walked over with a concerned expression. “Duri, what’s wrong? Are you coughing because the wind outside is too cold? Sit down and have some rest. You don’t have to work so hard.”","After that, the middle-aged man pushed Feng Wu back into the chair and said grumpily, “I know you’re in a hurry. You want to carve the upgraded inscription before the war and upgrade the inscription propeller to a second-generation model, but you have to take care of yourself.”","A second-generation model? Feng Wu was shocked!","The Junwu Empire didn’t even have a first-generation inscription propeller, but their enemy was already working on a second-generation one!","Feng Wu smiled. “It’s fine. I have to hurry up.”"]},{"number":3304,"title":"Chapter 3304 Hide (1)","paragraphs":["3304 Hide (1)","Feng Wu smiled. “It’s fine. I have to hurry up.”","Only then did the middle-aged man return to his seat worriedly.","He was a little unhappy.","Why was Duri treating him like an outsider?","!!","This middle-aged man’s name was Gosi. He was the highest-ranking person in charge of the inscription room. Everyone was in awe of him, but only Duri wasn’t like that.","Therefore, he and Duri became even closer over time.","Although he had a family, his ferocious wife wasn’t as sensible as Duri. Hence, Gosi liked being with Duri even more.","However, their relationship couldn’t be made public, so they were only dating in private.","What Gosi didn’t know was that Duri was only using him. Her real target wasn’t the highest-ranking officer of the inscription area.","Under Feng Wu’s control, Duri said everything she needed to say, but she didn’t tell Feng Wu about her relationship with Gosi. She only said the officer was nice to her and left it at that.","Feng Wu didn’t pay much attention to it.","Besides, how would she know the two people were having an affair?","However, Gosi’s concern for her made Feng Wu suspicious.","Sitting at her desk, Feng Wu pretended to be busy with her work, but she was looking around.","It was already just before dawn. The sky was only just about to get bright, and not many people were still awake.","There was only her, Gosi, and two other people.","The other three were very busy and kept looking at the data. They wouldn’t be able to finish any time soon.","In that case, Feng Wu decided to steal the information about the first-generation inscription propeller first.","Hence, Feng Wu turned on the big screen in front of her.","Soon, lines of inscriptions and codes appeared before her eyes.","Feng Wu had an unparalleled memory, but —","There were so many inscriptions and formations that a normal person might not be able to memorize them in a year. It wasn’t impossible for Feng Wu to memorize them all at once. She could do it, but it would mentally exhaust her.","There was no need for that.","Using the Spiritual Fossil Stone, Feng Wu took pictures of the inscription codes to decipher later.","After recording the first-generation inscriptions, Feng Wu saw the last line.","“Compared with the second-generation jet fighter, the first-generation propeller fighter is simply trash!","The Junwu Empire doesn’t even have trash. What a joke!”","Feng Wu frowned. What did Duri have against the Junwu Empire? Why was she scolding the empire even here?","She opened the inscription code for the second-generation jet fighter.","At the top of the code, Duri wrote,","“For the second-generation jet fighter, the fuselage has to be made of metal. We’ll write a line on the fuselage: We won’t return home until the Junwu Empire is destroyed.”","Feng Wu’s stomach lurched!","“We won’t return home until the Junwu Empire is destroyed.”","They wouldn’t return home until they destroyed the Junwu Empire.","Duri really hated the Junwu Empire.","Feng Wu smirked inwardly. “Since you hate the Junwu Empire so much, I won’t worry about stealing your inscription code.”","Feng Wu flipped through the pages on Duri’s big screen and took pictures.","It didn’t take long for Feng Wu to get everything she could.","After Gosi finished discussing things with his disciples, he was about to turn to Duri, when he saw her stand up.","“What’s wrong? You don’t look well. Your voice is a little hoarse too.”","After that, Gosi put his hands on Feng Wu’s shoulders.","Feng Wu frowned and wanted to slap him, but..."]},{"number":3305,"title":"Chapter 3305 Hide (2)","paragraphs":["3305 Hide (2)","In the end, she pushed him away and nodded at him. “I have a headache. I’ll take a break.”","Gosi said, “I’ll walk with you.”","Just then, someone shouted from not far away, “Master Gosi! Master Gosi!”","Feng Wu said in a serious tone, “You can focus on your work here. We’ll be dealing with the Junwu Empire soon. You know what I mean.”","!!","Gosi said, “Duri, don’t worry. Your parents were killed by Feng Xiangnan. Nest Fortress will be destroyed soon, and you’ll have your revenge.”","Feng Wu nodded and urged him, “Go now.”","Gosi looked at Feng Wu reluctantly. “Be careful.”","Feng Wu nodded.","Gosi tried to squeeze Feng Wu’s hands again, but Feng Wu cleverly avoided his hands.","Gosi thought his beloved girl was getting impatient. He lowered his voice and said to “Duri,” “That shrew has been taking slow-acting poison for so long and is about to die. Just wait.”","Feng Wu was speechless.","She understood everything now.","Gosi and Duri were worse than animals.","Instinctively, Feng Wu’s breathing got a little heavier, and Gosi could feel it. Thinking that his beloved girl was happy, he couldn’t hide the smile on his face. “Just be patient and wait. Everything will get better.”","Gosi left quickly because his colleagues were still calling for him.","Meanwhile...","Feng Wu stared at Gosi and secretly shook her head.","There were too many inscription materials in this place. If this place was destroyed, then...","Feng Wu saw that no one was paying attention to her.","She smiled a little.","She placed the inscription bombs which she had stolen from the east wing in every corner according to the formation.","The bombs were hidden well, and it was very difficult to spot them.","It was said an inscription bomb the size of a fist could blow up a house. Now that Feng Wu had buried a quarter of the bombs which she had, it would be able to cause a huge explosion.","However, she couldn’t bomb the place for the time being because she had more important things to do.","Feng Wu left the inscription section and headed straight for the fighter jet area.","On the way, she passed by a secret spot and crouched down to look at Duri, whom she had knocked out earlier.","She hadn’t intended to kill Duri before.","Since she now knew Duri’s true nature, she wasn’t going to let the latter live.","Duri seemed to sense something, and woke up.","She was infuriated to see Feng Wu because she saw a face that was almost identical to hers.","“You... You’re pretending to be me?!” Duri gritted her teeth and glared at Feng Wu.","To be fair, Duri was quite beautiful. She had fair skin, beautiful legs, a slender figure, and a clear voice. She had always been proud of her appearance and had used her beauty to obtain many benefits.","Feng Wu looked at her and sighed. “You shouldn’t have lied to me.”","“I didn’t. I... You’ve discovered my relationship with Gosi?!” Duri was very smart and instantly realized what had happened.","Since she knew, then...","Duri was about to scream, when Feng Wu grabbed her by the throat.","“Don’t you know I’ve already set up a sound barrier around here?” Feng Wu said grumpily.","Duri was very well-versed in inscription machines, but she was much weaker in other aspects. Feng Wu could easily kill her.","“As long as you let me go, I’ll work for you!” Duri gritted her teeth."]},{"number":3306,"title":"Chapter 3306 Hide (3)","paragraphs":["3306 Hide (3)","“You work for the second prince, right? I’ll work for you! I’ll give you the inscription codes of the second-generation jet.”","Feng Wu said, “So sorry, but I found those myself.”","Duri said, “I... I’m still useful. I...”","Feng Wu said, “By the way, I’m sorry, but I’m not with the second prince. I’m...”","!!","Feng Wu whispered something in Duri’s ear.","Duri glared at Feng Wu.","Without another word, Feng Wu twisted Duri’s neck and broke it.","Poor Duri...","She had written so many codes to destroy the Junwu Empire, but...","This person was actually from the Junwu Empire!","Feng Wu didn’t make any unnecessary moves.","She disguised Duri so that it would seem like the latter had been killed by the second prince’s people, while she quickly walked to the aircraft assembly area.","In the assembly area, there were boxes arranged in neat rows.","In each big box was an inscription propeller.","It was very difficult to make an inscription propeller. Even a team of great inscription masters might not be able to make one in a month.","The hundreds of inscription propellers in front of her were so precious.","“Master Duri?”","It was late at night, and there was only a little old man on duty.","He had been dozing, until he saw Duri come over. He immediately woke up.","Duri was an authoritative figure here.","Feng Wu put on an aloof face and gave the old man a cold look. “There’s something wrong with the inscriptions. I’ll check them. Don’t mind me.”","The little old man had wanted to follow her in, but he remembered everything inside was confidential, so...","“Then, these boxes...”","Feng Wu glanced at him. “Since you’re free, open all the boxes. I’ll check them.”","“Yes, of course.”","Duri was usually much colder, so what the little old man saw now was a milder version of her. The real Duri was rarely in a good mood.","These inscription propellers were to be assembled after dawn, so they weren’t tightly sealed.","Seeing that the old man was about to open the entire box, Feng Wu shook her head. “No need. Just open the top.”","The little old man quickly did as he was told.","Soon, more than 100 boxes were opened.","Meanwhile, Feng Wu was already examining them.","She really checked the inscription propellers one by one, holding a magnifying glass in her hand. Her expression was serious and meticulous.","“Du...”","Feng Wu was infuriated when the old man spoke!","“You’re disturbing me!”","Her tone was very impatient!","The little old man didn’t dare make another sound.","Everyone knew about the affair between Gosi and Duri. Duri was the most powerful inscription master here, while the little old man was just a gatekeeper. How could he dare offend her?","“Go stand guard outside and don’t disturb me!” Feng Wu snapped at him.","“Yes, yes. I’ll go out immediately. I’ll go out immediately...”","The little old man ran very quickly.","Seeing the old man run away, Feng Wu smiled a little.","Actually, her heart had been racing since she got here.","There were experts everywhere. If she revealed even the slightest flaw, she would be killed on the spot.","Therefore, every second was filled with fear, tension, and excitement. It was a matter of life and death!","Feng Wu didn’t want to let go of such a good opportunity.","There were 100 inscription propellers here!","How could she bear to give up on them?","Hence, after the old man left, Feng Wu put the 100 inscription propellers into her storage space one by one.","Fortunately, she had moved out a batch of inscription bombs, making some extra space."]},{"number":3307,"title":"Chapter 3307 Hide (4)","paragraphs":["3307 Hide (4)","Fortunately, she had moved out a batch of inscription bombs, making some extra space.","However, Feng Wu felt a little sorry.","After fitting the hundreds of inscription propellers inside, the storage bag that Jun Linyuan had given her was full.","It was so full that not even a straw could fit inside.","!!","Feng Wu didn’t stay any longer.","Because it was dangerous to stay any longer, she walked straight out.","The old man at the door greeted Feng Wu respectfully when he saw her. “Master Duri, are you leaving?”","Feng Wu nodded and left without looking back.","Duri was always so arrogant, so the little old man didn’t pay much attention and dozed off again.","Where was Feng Wu going next?","She had one last place to go, and that was where the fighter jets were parked.","Feng Wu had heard that there were already 200 fighter jets there, so she had to take care of the fighter jets first. Otherwise...","If they really launched an air attack on Nest Fortress, Nest would really be in big trouble.","Feng Wu had already found out where the fighter jet hangar was. She was about to do the same trick to get in, when she heard a voice outside. “Assassin! Assassin!”","Feng Wu’s stomach lurched!","Why did it have to be now?","Just then, Feng Wu saw countless torches coming her way.","Two men were running at the front.","Weren’t they Meng and Zhui?!","Their faces were covered with black scarves, but Feng Wu could tell from their body shapes!","These two people had ruined her plans!","Feng Wu was displeased.","Moreover, she clearly saw that Zhui, who was running behind, had been shot several times in the legs and was slowing down.","“I’ll cover you. Go!” Zhui lowered his voice and said to Meng.","As he spoke, he handed a jade bracelet to Meng!","There was reluctance in Meng’s eyes, but he still nodded solemnly in the end!","After saying this, Zhui turned around and headed toward the enemy!","Zhui had tied explosives around himself, so he rushed into the crowd without caring about his life. Boom!","Zhui died bravely!","At this moment, Meng was caught by Feng Wu around the corner!","“You —”","Meng’s face turned pale, but Feng Wu lowered her voice. “Meng, it’s me!”","The familiar voice and familiar form of address...","Meng immediately recognized Feng Wu.","This was the masked accomplice from before!","Meng asked anxiously, “How can you walk around out in the open?”","Feng Wu said, “I can play different roles. I’m Duri now.”","As they spoke, someone walked over.","Feng Wu shoved Meng into the shadows.","The person said seriously, “Master Duri, it’s dangerous here. Please go back now!”","Feng Wu said seriously, “Alright, I’ll be back at the inscription office. By the way, what’s going on?”","The speaker was a guard captain, who was at least a Level 9 Spiritual Lord.","Flying fighter jets were too important, so this place was guarded by very powerful people to ensure nothing went wrong.","“Someone is here to cause trouble.” The captain frowned. “Don’t ask too much. Be careful. I’ll walk you back now.”","Feng Wu waved him off. “That’s fine. Go on. I won’t keep you any longer.”","All of a sudden, Feng Wu stopped in her tracks and asked, “Who’s causing all this trouble? Is it someone from the Junwu Empire?”"]},{"number":3308,"title":"Chapter 3308 Hide (5)","paragraphs":["3308 Hide (5)","The captain said, “The people from the Junwu Empire can’t enter the Dongsang Kingdom. We would discover them as soon as they appear since they would have the strong aura of the Junwu Empire on them, but not the grass aura of the Dongsang Kingdom.","“It’s either the second or the third prince again. Who else could it be?” The captain didn’t dare to say anything else and quickly left.","After he left, Meng, who was hiding in a corner, looked at Feng Wu in surprise. “You —","“Master Duri?”","!!","Meng was a little uncertain. Was this person the second prince’s subordinate or someone from this base?","Feng Wu pointed at a secluded corner and asked Meng to take a look for himself.","Seeing the slender figure lying by the wall, Meng turned her over. He looked from her face to Feng Wu’s.","Meng was speechless.","These two faces were exactly the same.","In other words, the second prince had really recruited a talented person.","She could actually disguise herself as someone else and hide here!","Overjoyed, Meng lowered his voice and told Feng Wu, “That’s great! That’s brilliant!”","Feng Wu snapped, “No, it’s not! I was just about to go to the fighter jet hangar, when you made such a big fuss. By the way, didn’t you come here to scout things out? Why are you making so much noise?”","Feng Wu had planned to trick them at the critical moment and expose them as the second prince’s men so that the crown prince and the second prince would get into a dogfight.","However, she didn’t expect Meng and Zhui to disappoint her.","“I really couldn’t help it!” Meng couldn’t hide his agitation. “The person guarding the fighter jet hangar over there happened to be taking a nap, so we slipped in. Then, we saw rows of fighter jets!”","Feng Wu asked, “Are there a lot?”","Meng said, “There are at least 200 of them! How could we return empty-handed after entering a treasure cave? We couldn’t control ourselves at all!”","Feng Wu stared at him in disbelief.","Meng said proudly, “So, Zhui and I put the fighter jets into the storage space. When we had about 100 of them, we were discovered, and we ran away!”","“Look, they’re all in here!” Meng pointed at the jade bracelet and showed it to Feng Wu.","Feng Wu’s eyes lit up, but she forced herself to stay calm.","Feng Wu glared at Meng. “The captain only asked you to draw a map. If he finds out what you’ve done, he’ll kill you!”","Meng thought of Zhui’s fate and said, “I’ve touched so many fighter jets. I don’t care if I die now!”","Feng Wu was speechless.","She thought for a moment before she said, “They’re already here, so they’ll definitely do a thorough investigation. You won’t be able to escape. How about this? Take me as a hostage. The person I’m playing is of a high rank. If you kidnap me, they’ll definitely make way for you.”","While talking to Meng, Feng Wu looked at the team not far away.","The entire team had already gathered, and the entire road was surrounded. Not even a fly could sneak out.","Feng Wu was a little anxious.","The situation was getting tenser and tenser.","Meng took a deep breath and said, “I can’t run away. Actually, from the moment we started collecting the fighter jets, we knew we couldn’t escape. The fighter jets are such an important treasure. How can they not take precautions? They’ll definitely catch us!”"]},{"number":3309,"title":"Chapter 3309 Hide (6)","paragraphs":["3309 Hide (6)","“I only want to say one thing: It felt awesome!” Meng was overwhelmed with emotion. “I’m willing to die immediately!”","Feng Wu was about to say something, when Meng waved her off. “I know what you’re trying to say. You want to turn me into someone else so that I can avoid this search, don’t you? No, I’ll drag you down with me.”","Meng smiled bitterly. “You can act so well that no one can tell, not even from your voice, but I can’t. I can blow my cover at any time. If I’m exposed, then you’re basically doomed, so...”","Meng handed the bracelet to Feng Wu. “Take this! Since you’ve been hiding among them, you better hide well. Find a chance to get out and give the bracelet to the second prince!”","!!","Feng Wu put on a show and declined. “That won’t do. I won’t allow it. How can I take credit for that?”","Meng was very generous. “I can’t get out, but you can. By the way, don’t forget to tell the second prince what Zhui and I did!”","After that, Meng pushed Feng Wu away. “Get out of here!”","Feng Wu admired Meng’s character, but they were on different sides.","She nodded at him and dashed off with the bracelet.","“Here! Over here!”","Meng’s voice was followed by a series of explosions.","Feng Wu was filled with emotion.","She turned around and saw Meng exploding amidst the flames.","He had probably stayed there on purpose to blow up Duri’s body.","Sure enough, when Feng Wu rushed up with the others, she saw Meng holding Duri’s body in his arms. The two of them had been blown to pieces.","Seeing this, Feng Wu felt a little dizzy...","“Duri? Duri?!”","A nervous, concerned voice rang out behind Feng Wu.","Gosi?","He reached out to catch Feng Wu, but Feng Wu turned away.","Gosi glared at her in exasperation. “Duri, why are you throwing a tantrum?!”","Feng Wu just didn’t want him to touch her, but she couldn’t arouse his suspicion.","Hence, Feng Wu glared at him. “We’re in public! Watch yourself!”","Gosi was thrilled. He wasn’t angry anymore after being scolded by Feng Wu. Instead, he smiled. “I’m just worried about you. By the way, were you alright just now?”","Feng Wu waved him off. “I’m fine. I just ran into a lunatic and was almost taken hostage. Luckily, I ran away fast enough.”","Gosi said to Feng Wu, “Get inside! I’m going to check out what’s going on!”","At that moment, someone was already calling for Gosi.","He reminded Feng Wu, “Other places may be dangerous, but our inscription room is safe since Mr. Sakiya set up the formation himself!”","Feng Wu nodded and saw a group of people rushing toward them along the road.","She raised an eyebrow. “Mr. Sakiya is here.”","Gosi immediately relaxed. “That’s right. Mr. Sakiya is here. I’ll go look for him. Go back now!”","Feng Wu nodded.","As she walked back, she heard Mr. Sakiya’s command behind her.","“Not even a fly is allowed to leave here!”","It seemed she would have to stay in the underground manufacturing plant for a few days as Duri. Feng Wu tried to recall if she had given herself away.","Suddenly, her pupils contracted.","She almost forgot!","She really had given herself away a little!"]},{"number":3310,"title":"Chapter 3310 Explosion (1)","paragraphs":["3310 Explosion (1)","She almost forgot!","She really had given herself away a little!","Previously, when she was in the assembly department, she had gone in with Duri’s face. That old man...","Feng Wu hurried toward the assembly department.","The old man was about to say something when he saw Feng Wu.","But that was it.","Feng Wu cleared out another 25% of the inscription bombs in her space.","Boom!","After Feng Wu left, the assembly room burst into flames.","Originally, everyone’s attention was on the fighter jet hangar. However, they were alarmed by this noise and immediately rushed over!","Feng Wu had already run away.","She could clearly see Mr. Sakiya at the front.","Her impression of Mr. Sakiya was that he was a calm and composed cultivator, but now, he couldn’t remain calm at all. His face had turned several shades paler.","Boom!","“Mr. Sakiya!”","The highest authority in the base was Gosi’s father, Goy. He had been sleeping, but because he was in a hurry, he ran out in his undergarments and only had one boot on; the other one was nowhere to be found.","Sakiya stared intently at Goy with cold eyes.","Goy felt as if the glare would kill him.","He panicked.","Actually, he hadn’t stayed in the underground base tonight.","It was dark and humid here, so he would run topside from time to time. This time, he had been sleeping soundly in the courtyard aboveground, when the series of explosions woke him up...","“The assembly department! I remember there are inscription propellers there!” Goy’s expression was extremely ugly.","At that moment, the department head in charge of the assembly department rushed over!","Upon seeing Goy and Mr. Sakiya, his face turned terrified and pale. He couldn’t even stand straight, and dropped to the ground.","Goy asked anxiously, “The assembly... How many inscription propellers were there?!”","The head of the assembly department said, “100. They were just shipped in not long ago...”","Someone had already rushed in despite the flames.","However, the explosion had been too intense. They couldn’t even stand close, so how could they salvage anything?","“Those were inscription bombs!” Mr. Sakiya’s face was terrifyingly pale.","He clutched his chest and had the urge to vomit blood.","The inscription bombs were strictly controlled and in the hands of those in power like himself. No one could come into contact with them or mobilize them.","However, the explosion had started in the assembly area.","“Who did it?!” Goy was so angry that his eyes turned red!","No one answered.","“There are 100 inscription propellers in the assembly warehouse. Have they all been blown up?”","No one answered him.","Goy turned around and saw two people kneeling on the ground.","One was the head of the assembly department.","It was normal for him to kneel because the assembly department was blown up like this, but the other person was the head of the aviation department. Why was he kneeling?","Seeing Goy’s questioning gaze, the head of the aviation department burst into tears. “Sir, half of the 200 fighter jets have been stolen!”","Pffft!","Goy spat out a mouthful of blood!","100!","100 fighter jets had been stolen!","The head of the aviation department said, “Sir, all 200 could have been stolen. Fortunately, we quickly discovered the theft and stopped it in time. Otherwise, the consequences would be unimaginable!”","Goy almost died of anger!","The man still wanted to take credit at a time like this?","“You’re only still alive because I’m being lenient!","“Mr. Sakiya...”","At that moment, Mr. Sakiya was frowning.","The assembly department and the aviation department... Were they the only departments that the enemy was after?","Sh*t!","Mr. Sakiya was alarmed. He pushed through the crowd and rushed toward the inscription department!","..."]},{"number":3311,"title":"Chapter 3311 Explosion (2)","paragraphs":["3311 Explosion (2)","However, at that moment —","Boom!","There was the sound of a big explosion in the inscription area.","Goy and the two other ministers’ legs went weak!","!!","The inscription area!","That was the inscription area!","They thought they were going to lose their minds.","Mr. Sakiya rushed toward the inscription area, followed by the others.","Only one person in the crowd was moving swiftly in the opposite direction.","It was Feng Wu.","Feng Wu knew how important the inscription area was.","As long as the inscription area was around, they could create inscription propellers and assemble them for the fighter jets.","But now, the inscription area was destroyed!","All the inscription masters were dead!","Gosi was also dead.","Although they could still transfer new inscription masters here from the Dongsang Kingdom, forming a new inscription team and resuming normal production would be extremely difficult.","Feng Wu spotted Zhu Yi in the crowd, so she quickly disguised herself as Bu Jingyu again. Then, she rushed over and grabbed him by the sleeve.","“Senior Brother Zhu, Senior Brother Zhu!”","Zhu Yi turned around and was surprised to see his junior brother. “Why are you here?!”","Feng Wu said, “I was scared when I heard the explosion. Then, I saw someone coming this way, so I followed them... I didn’t know there was such a serious explosion here.”","She looked like she was still in a state of shock.","Zhu Yi turned around and glared at the captain of the guards.","Even his little junior brother could follow them in. These guards were terrible at keeping secrets!","“Senior Brother Zhu, why is this place...”","Senior Brother Zhu looked away and said to Feng Wu, “It’s a mess here. Get out!”","Feng Wu hesitated. “But...”","Zhu Yi said, “Out!”","Feng Wu had no choice but to feign frustration and kick at the pebbles under her feet. “Okay...”","She lowered his head and walked out silently.","She couldn’t take the way out through Mr. Sakiya’s courtyard.","Because the fighter jets used another exit, Feng Wu left from there and walked slowly back to the great general’s residence.","Bu Jingyu was extremely anxious.","However, he didn’t dare go out.","One Bu Jingyu was already walking around. If he went out, what if he was exposed?","However, such a huge commotion gave him a strange feeling.","He felt that Feng Wu had something to do with it.","Feng Wu wasn’t dead, was she? Bu Jingyu was worried.","“It would be great if she died! I won’t have to worry about her causing me any trouble!","“But... she’s so stunning. Wouldn’t it be a pity for her to die like this?","“Sigh, why don’t I go out and take a look?”","Bu Jingyu’s mind was in turmoil, when he saw a person slowly walking toward him.","The person pushed open the courtyard door, came in, and entered the room.","“What?!”","Bu Jingyu was about to leave when Feng Wu came in, so they almost bumped into each other.","“You’re not dead?!”","Bu Jingyu recognized Feng Wu right away when he saw someone who looked exactly like him!","However, it was quite strange to see someone who looked identical to him and even of the same height.","Feng Wu gave him a confused look. “Dead? That doesn’t apply to me.”","How arrogant!","Bu Jingyu almost choked on his spit.","“I... I mean... It’s such a big commotion outside. Are you really fine? I was lying on the roof just now and saw that the shops on East Street had all collapsed! Was there an earthquake?”"]},{"number":3312,"title":"Chapter 3312 Explosion (3)","paragraphs":["3312 Explosion (3)","Feng Wu had been in a state of high tension the whole night. When she finally got back to the courtyard, she simply lay down, put her hands in her pockets, and took a break to recover her energy.","By then, Bu Jingyu was already by her side.","He could tell from Feng Wu’s words that she knew what had happened.","Seeing how exhausted Feng Wu looked, Bu Jingyu poured her some tea.","!!","Feng Wu finished it in one go.","Bu Jingyu fetched a plate of fruit and placed it right next to Feng Wu’s hand. As for himself...","He brought a stool over, sat down, and massaged Feng Wu’s legs.","“Tell me. Please tell me.” Bu Jingyu was extremely curious.","Seeing how eager Bu Jingyu was to hear about it, Feng Wu teased him. “It’s nothing. I just blew up the underground fighter jet base.”","Pffft!","Bu Jingyu choked on his spit!","OMG!","OMG!","OMG!","“You? You blew up the underground fighter jet base? You must be joking!”","Feng Wu looked very serious. “No, I’m not.”","Bu Jingyu was stunned!","If anyone else had said that, he would have slapped them and told them to stop bragging. But Feng Wu... Even his own teacher had been tricked!","Bu Jingyu said, “You... Did you blow it up with this face?”","Feng Wu asked, “Are you scared?”","Bu Jingyu almost burst into tears. “Oh my god! Please don’t tell me you looked like this when you blew up the base!”","Seeing how anxious Bu Jingyu was, Feng Wu smiled. “No.”","Only then did Bu Jingyu heave a sigh of relief. He clutched his chest. “That’s good. I was scared to death...”","Feng Wu said, “But don’t you hate me for blowing up your base?”","Bu Jingyu said, “The fighter jet base isn’t mine. Why should I hate you? But why are you so powerful? You can even blow up fighter jets! Which part of the base did you blow up? How many fighter jets were there?”","Feng Wu looked at Bu Jingyu and smiled without saying anything.","Bu Jingyu asked, “One? Two?","“Ten?!” Bu Jingyu asked, “Don’t tell me you blew up ten fighter jets!”","Feng Wu said, “How can there be so few? I blew up everything I could: your inscription department, assembly department, and aviation department.”","Thump!","Bu Jingyu dropped to the ground and knelt down in front of Feng Wu.","“Did you really blow them all up?”","Feng Wu said, “Yup.”","However, Bu Jingyu didn’t completely believe her since he didn’t think it was really possible.","How could one person do such a thing?","Since it was a fighter jet base, there had to be a lot of people guarding it. Besides, where did Feng Wu get the inscription bombs? Bu Jingyu tried to comfort himself.","However, such news couldn’t stay hidden.","After all, a large area of East Street had collapsed.","It was an unfortunate event. The entire fighter jet base was below the street. How could the houses above withstand the explosion?","Feng Wu wasn’t going to say anything more to Bu Jingyu. If the kid accidentally let out the secret, the consequences would be unimaginable.","Although tonight’s events had exceeded Feng Wu’s expectations, she still had no idea how to complete her biggest mission.","The Immortal Spiritual Fruit.","It would ripen in another day...","Where had Mr. Sakiya hidden it?","Feng Wu suddenly stood up.","“Boss, where are you going?” Bu Jingyu had already gotten used to calling her boss."]},{"number":3313,"title":"Chapter 3313 Where Is the Immortal Spiritual Fruit? (1)","paragraphs":["3313 Where Is the Immortal Spiritual Fruit? (1)","Bu Jingyu had already gotten used to calling her boss.","Feng Wu looked back at him. “I’m going out for a walk.”","After that, Feng Wu left.","Bu Jingyu was panicking.","!!","“Go out for a walk? Last night, you also said you wanted to go out for a walk. In the end, you caused such a huge commotion. Why do you want to go out now?”","Bu Jingyu had every reason to panic.","When Feng Wu left the yard, Bu Jingyu could only look at her pitifully from the top of the wall.","Feng Wu turned around and glared at him. “Go back inside!”","How scary... Bu Jingyu could only hide back in the courtyard.","Crossing her hands behind her back, Feng Wu walked around the mansion.","Because she was wearing Bu Jingyu’s face, Feng Wu could show up openly without worrying someone would find out she was a spy.","Thanks to the second prince, she now had 100 intact fighter jets and 100 inscription propellers.","However, there weren’t many inscription bombs left. There were only half of them left.","Looking around the mansion, Feng Wu rubbed her chin.","If this place was blown up...","“Bu Jingyu, what are you thinking about?” Just as Feng Wu was smiling, she heard a voice behind her.","It was a very familiar voice.","Feng Wu turned around and saw Mu Yan.","She didn’t know how close Bu Jingyu and Mu Yan were right now, so she couldn’t show too much enthusiasm, nor show too little. Hence, she only nodded.","Mu Yan seemed to be very familiar with Bu Jingyu. She asked him, “Do you know?”","Feng Wu asked, “Know what?”","Mu Yan pointed to the east. “East Street is completely destroyed!”","Feng Wu said, “I see.”","Mu Yan said, “Did you know there was a base that was manufacturing fighter jets?”","Feng Wu asked, “How do you know?”","Mu Yan said smugly, “I didn’t know at first, but it’s such a huge commotion that it’s hard not to notice.”","She couldn’t wait for Feng Wu to ask her for details, but Feng Wu remained silent.","Seeing that Feng Wu wasn’t going to ask, Mu Yan said, “Guess what? All of our fighter jets were blown up! So many inscription masters were killed! His Majesty has suffered the greatest loss since he ascended the throne!","“If this matter is reported, His Majesty will punish Mr. Sakiya for dereliction of duty. We’ve lost so many inscription masters, and they were all the most elite ones. Someone is in deep trouble.","“Did you know that we were all gathered to launch an all-out attack on Nest? All these years, we never made a move, but we secretly created so many fighter jets to take down Nest in one fell swoop!","“But that was what happened!” Mu Yan was furious. “D*mn it! I could have seen how Feng Wu died!”","Feng Wu was surprised to hear her name here.","“Do you really want her to die that badly?” she asked grumpily.","Mu Yan replied, “Of course!”","Feng Wu asked, “What did she do to you?”","Mu Yan’s face twisted. “Her existence is a mistake! She shouldn’t exist in this world!”","Feng Wu said, “You’re just jealous of her looks, aren’t you?”","Mu Yan: “No! What do her good looks have to do with me? Why would I be jealous of her?”","Feng Wu looked into the distance.","Mu Yan probably felt she had overreacted."]},{"number":3314,"title":"Chapter 3314 Where Is the Immortal Spiritual Fruit? (2)","paragraphs":["3314 Where Is the Immortal Spiritual Fruit? (2)","Mu Yan probably felt a little guilty too. She glared at Feng Wu. “You stupid kid. What do you know?”","Feng Wu stood up. “Alright. I don’t understand anything. I’m leaving.”","Mu Yan glared at Feng Wu. “Stop right there!”","Feng Wu looked back at her. “What?”","Mu Yan said, “My master is so busy, the crown prince is in a coma, and your master is so unlucky... No one is talking to me. Won’t you talk to me?”","Feng Wu suddenly had an idea. She asked involuntarily, “What’s your master busy with?”","Mu Yan finally found an outlet to vent her anger. She complained loudly, “Of course, my master is busy saving the crown prince! Tell me, why is Jun Linyuan awake? Why isn’t the crown prince awake? I’ve been thinking about it!”","Feng Wu asked, “Thinking about what?”","Mu Yan said, “I’m thinking about why Jun Linyuan is awake! Logically speaking, only the Immortal Spiritual Fruit can wake someone up. We lost the Immortal Spiritual Fruit, and Jun Linyuan woke up. What do you think...”","Feng Wu said, “But...”","Mu Yan said, “No buts! The more I think about it, the more I feel that someone from the Junwu Empire must have stolen it!”","Feng Wu looked at Mu Yan as if the latter was a retard. “Didn’t you steal it?”","Mu Yan said, “Of course not! Actually, there’s something I haven’t told Mr. Sakiya. I’m not sure if I should tell him or not.”","Feng Wu’s stomach lurched!","It couldn’t be what she thought, could it?","As expected...","Mu Yan looked at Feng Wu and said in all seriousness, “Actually, when I was refining the Immortal Spiritual Fruit last time, I sensed someone come in. The person knocked me out while I was opening the cauldron and stole the Immortal Spiritual Fruit liquid.”","Feng Wu looked at Mu Yan calmly.","When she was opening the cauldron? Did she forget how she had almost destroyed the Immortal Spiritual Fruit?","Feng Wu looked at her indifferently. “Are you sure? Should we go to my master now?”","After that, Feng Wu dragged Mu Yan to the door.","“Don’t!” Mu Yan didn’t dare provoke Mr. Sakiya at that moment.","“I’ve been trying to find an opportunity to tell Mr. Sakiya, but I kept stalling. Then, there was such a huge explosion...” Mu Yan crouched down on the ground. “He let me off on account of my master. How would I dare go see him now?”","Feng Wu asked, “Are you going to tell him or not?”","Mu Yan crouched down on the ground and shook her head. “I won’t, I won’t say it.”","Feng Wu asked, “Then why are you telling me?”","Mu Yan said, “I’m just feeling suffocated. I need someone to talk to. Bu Jingyu, why are you so mean?”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say; she was getting a little carried away.","Feng Wu asked, “So, what do you want to talk about?”","Mu Yan said, “I can’t get over it.”","Feng Wu said, “So?”","Mu Yan said, “The moment I start refining, I remember that incident. I can’t concentrate on refining at all. I’m adrift. After that incident, I haven’t succeeded in refining any Supreme Level elixirs.”","Feng Wu said, “But...”","Mu Yan said, “Guess what? I even suspect that the person who stole my Immortal Spiritual Fruit is Feng Wu!”","Feng Wu said, “Don’t spout nonsense if you don’t have any evidence!”","Mu Yan said, “It’s precisely because I don’t have any evidence that I don’t dare tell Mr. Sakiya! Now that Mr. Sakiya is busy with the fighter jet base, he’s entrusted the second Immortal Spiritual Fruit to my master.”","Feng Wu was astonished!","That was right!"]},{"number":3315,"title":"Chapter 3315 Second Senior Brother","paragraphs":["3315 Second Senior Brother","Feng Wu looked at Mu Yan in astonishment.","Why didn’t she think of this before?","She had specifically targeted Mr. Sakiya, but he was too cunning.","He didn’t check the Immortal Spiritual Fruit at all. That was how calm he was. Therefore, no matter how closely Feng Wu watched him, she couldn’t steal the fruit from Mr. Sakiya.","But —","Mr. Sakiya wasn’t a medicine refiner, so he had no way of refining the Immortal Spiritual Fruit. Therefore, the Immortal Spiritual Fruit would eventually end up in someone else’s hands.","Others wouldn’t be as meticulous and flawless as Mr. Sakiya.","For example, she couldn’t find any flaws with Mr. Sakiya last time, so she turned to Mu Yan instead. This time... Feng Wu’s new target was Mu Yan’s master, Mo Lan.","“Why are you so happy?” Mu Yan gave Feng Wu a strange look.","Feng Wu said, “I think you’re too idle. It’s good to be busy.”","Mu Yan sneered. She ignored Feng Wu and left.","Feng Wu was about to go look for Mo Lan, when someone hurried toward her.","“Bu Jingyu? Why are you here? Come with me!”","The tall and thin man was in his 20s and had deep-set eyes. Recalling what Bu Jingyu had told her before, Feng Wu blurted out, “Second Senior Brother?”","Bu Jingyu’s second senior brother glared at Feng Wu. “What time is it now? Why are you still wandering around outside? Come with me!”","grabbed Feng Wu and dragged her away.","Feng Wu wanted to say no, but Second Senior Brother grabbed her by the back of her collar and didn’t give her a chance to resist.","With Feng Wu’s strength, she could easily defeat Bu Jingyu’s second senior brother, but the real Bu Jingyu couldn’t.","That was why Feng Wu couldn’t use her full strength and had to be taken away by that man.","Feng Wu was frustrated.","She had wanted to walk around the mansion and see where she could find the inscription bombs. She had used around one-third of the ones she had stolen previously, and she was still mourning her loss.","“Second Senior Brother, why are you looking for me? I have to memorize inscriptions. Master told me to,” Feng Wu grumbled.","glanced at her angrily. “What level of inscriptions are you memorizing now?”","Feng Wu said proudly, “Level 5!”","said, “Ha!”","Feng Wu said, “Second Senior Brother, aren’t you being too harsh?”","Without even looking at Feng Wu, Second Senior Brother said, “Since you have nothing better to do, give me a hand.”","Feng Wu remembered Bu Jingyu telling her that Second Senior Brother was in charge of construction work in Sun Castle. He was responsible for everything from the walls to the tunnels.","He had probably built the fighter jet base as well.","Feng Wu said, “Second Senior Brother, if I’m supervising your work, where are you going?”","didn’t look too happy. “There’s a problem with the fighter jet base. That goddamn second prince... I’m going to kill him!”","Seeing “Bu Jingyu” look at him with big, clear eyes, Second Senior Brother felt his stomach lurch. He cleared his throat. “Don’t worry about it. When you’re done, you’re free to go.”","After that, he handed Feng Wu over to his deputy and promptly left.","The deputy smiled when he saw Feng Wu. “Young Master Bu, shall I show you around?”","Feng Wu had no choice but to accept the fact that she had become the supervisor. She could only hope Second Senior Brother would come back as soon as possible. If he didn’t come back tomorrow, Feng Wu would run away herself."]},{"number":3316,"title":"Chapter 3316 The Second Prince","paragraphs":["3316 The Second Prince","They were now outside the walls of Sun Castle.","The castle wall was 3km away.","They were on the only road leading to the castle.","Feng Wu asked involuntarily, “What are you working on now?”","The deputy told Feng Wu in all seriousness, “Burying inscription bombs.”","Feng Wu was speechless.","Seeing the confused look on Feng Wu’s face, the deputy said seriously, “We’ll plant the inscription bombs here and along this road. When the Junwu Empire comes after us, we’ll be able to detonate the bombs.”","Feng Wu asked, “Why will the Junwu Empire come here?”","The deputy looked at Feng Wu as if she was dumb. “If they don’t come after us, we’ll create an opportunity for them to come after us. It won’t be difficult.”","Feng Wu was speechless.","Hence...","Feng Wu saw baskets of inscription bombs!","From afar, she could tell that there were at least tens of thousands of them, and there were more to come.","They were burying all the inscription bombs here to blow up the people of the Junwu Empire.","Feng Wu nodded with a straight face.","The deputy showed the blueprint to Feng Wu. “Do you think anything here needs to be edited?”","In fact, the deputy knew Bu Jingyu’s strength. He knew Bu Jingyu didn’t even know Level 5 inscriptions, so it was useless to ask him. He probably couldn’t even understand the blueprint.","However, Bu Jingyu was Mr. Sakiya’s disciple. With him as the supervisor, they would have one more person to take responsibility.","Seeing the look in the deputy’s eyes, Feng Wu knew what he was thinking.","It seemed Second Senior Brother didn’t treat Bu Jingyu as well as Zhu Yi did. Poor kid.","Crossing her arms, Feng Wu said calmly, “I’m just supervising on Second Senior Brother’s behalf. I’ll do whatever the blueprint says. If anything happens, it has nothing to do with me.”","After that, Feng Wu found a tree branch and went to sleep on it.","The deputy didn’t get what he wanted, but Bu Jingyu was there, and that was enough.","Seeing that Feng Wu was snoring, the deputy went to do his own thing.","Of course, Feng Wu wasn’t sleeping.","When the deputy showed her the blueprint just now, she had already secretly made a copy of the area where they had buried the inscription bombs.","The blueprint was very big. It extended from the outside of Sun Castle to the Dayless Woods and the border.","The area was filled with bombs.","If the troops of the Junwu Empire stepped on them, they would be blown to pieces.","It was a good thing she had seen this blueprint. Otherwise, the cultivators of the Junwu Empire would be in big trouble.","Feng Wu was still trying to figure out how to deal with the inscription bombs, while someone in one of the restaurants in Sun Castle was so angry that his lungs were about to explode!","“The entire fighter base was blown up?”","The second prince of the Dongsang Kingdom was a handsome man, although he wasn’t as good-looking as Night Owl.","He was so angry that he smashed the bowl in his hand!","“What did Zhui and Meng do? Why did they blow up the base? Why did they make such a big fuss?” The second prince was so angry that he threw a bowl at the leader of the assassination team who was kneeling on the ground!","The leader of the assassination team had a bitter expression on his face... How was he supposed to know those two were so ‘capable’?","“I don’t know what information they leaked. If the others find out who they were...” The second prince hesitated.","“They would have done me a great service if they weren’t exposed. But, we’ll kill their entire families if they were exposed!” the second prince said angrily.","Just then, someone entered the room.","“My lord, there’s news from inside. They suspect you sent someone to blow up the fighter jet base.”"]},{"number":3317,"title":"Chapter 3317 Self-Destruct Program","paragraphs":["3317 Self-Destruct Program","“My lord, there’s news from inside. They suspect you sent someone to blow up the fighter jet base.”","The second prince almost exploded when he heard that!","Who could make up such a thing?","After he found the secret passage, he had someone sneak in. However, he wasn’t stupid and knew the importance of these fighter jets. How could he tell them to blow up the base?","“What’s the scale of the explosion? Which areas were blown up?” The second prince took a deep breath and forced himself to calm down.","“Everything!” the subordinate answered carefully.","The second prince almost choked, but he still held onto some hope. “What do you mean by ‘everything’?”","“Well, I mean everything. The inscription area, the assembly area, the aviation area... everything that was assembled and stored were all blown up...”","The second prince’s legs gave way.","The guard captain immediately steadied him.","The second prince put a hand on a chair to support himself and sat down with difficulty. After a long time, he finally said, “Everything was blown up... That’s incredible.”","Everyone looked silently at the second prince. It was indeed incredible. They had no idea the second prince had such capable subordinates.","The second prince said, “Mr. Sakiya...”","The messenger carefully said, “Although Mr. Sakiya didn’t say anything, it seems they found something from Zhui and Meng’s corpses...”","The second prince found it hard to breathe.","He headed for the door.","The captain and the others asked, “My lord, you...”","The second prince gritted his teeth. “What are you waiting for? Are you going to stay here and get caught? Run!”","Although it was embarrassing to use the word “run” as the second prince, it was still better than being caught.","Feng Wu had no idea how badly she had tricked the second prince. Right now, she was resting on a tree branch with her eyes closed.","Something suddenly occurred to her.","Her eyes snapped open.","She remembered something very important.","The fighter jets!","She remembered the fighter jets had a self-destruct mechanism!","She didn’t know when the self-destruct would happen, but the mechanism existed!","She actually forgot such an important setting. D*mn it!","Feng Wu headed for the door.","Seeing Feng Wu, the deputy immediately greeted her. “Young Master Bu, you...”","Feng Wu said, “I need to pee!”","The deputy had no choice but to let Feng Wu leave.","Feng Wu ran back to Bu Jingyu’s yard.","That was the only place where she could dismantle the fighter jets without any risk.","Bu Jingyu was still grumbling inwardly when Feng Wu returned, but when he saw the fighter jets on the ground, he couldn’t believe his eyes!","“B- Boss Feng Wu, y- you...”","One, two, three...","There were actually five fighter jets in the huge courtyard.","All the space was occupied.","Bu Jingyu said anxiously, “Didn’t you say you blew up all the fighter jets?”","Feng Wu answered Bu Jingyu as she worked on dismantling the fighter jets. “How can I blow up such a good thing?”","“But, but...” Bu Jingyu almost burst into tears at Feng Wu’s words. “But why did you put them out here? They can self-destruct. They’ll blow up!”","Feng Wu said, “I know.”","The 100 inscription propellers had yet to be assembled. They weren’t installed with a self-destruct program, so she could ignore them.","However, there were 100 fighter jets in the bracelet that Meng had given to her. All of them had the self-destruct program."]},{"number":3318,"title":"Chapter 3318 Mr. Sakiya Is Back","paragraphs":["3318 Mr. Sakiya Is Back","Bu Jingyu said, “Do you know what this place is? If someone comes in, we’re done for!”","Feng Wu’s hands were steady. As she quickly disassembled the fighter jets with the Phoenix Pen, she answered Bu Jingyu, “I know.”","Bu Jingyu paced around Feng Wu anxiously. “You don’t know the half of it! I’m going to die because of you! How long are you going to keep dismantling these five?”","If they blew up, he would be dead!","Feng Wu glanced at Bu Jingyu.","Five?","Sorry, but 95 more were waiting.","Feng Wu was so fast that her fingers moved like dancing butterflies, leaving behind afterimages.","Bu Jingyu complained at first, but soon, he crouched down next to Feng Wu and watched her intently.","The longer he looked, the bigger his eyes got!","OMG!","Was she even faster than his master?","What was that pen in her hand?","Whoosh! The huge fighter jet was dismantled. The self-destruct program was quickly deactivated.","Feng Wu was incredible!","Bu Jingyu exclaimed as he watched, “Boss Feng Wu, you’re amazing! You took care of a fighter jet in the blink of an eye!”","Feng Wu didn’t have time to talk to him, and she only nodded.","She needed to work as fast as she could.","Feng Wu thought for a moment and asked Bu Jingyu, “Does the self-destruct program have a time limit? Or are the jets detonated manually?”","Bu Jingyu told Feng Wu, “They’re detonated manually.”","Feng Wu asked, “Then why haven’t they destroyed the fighter jets yet?”","Bu Jingyu looked at Feng Wu in amazement.","Feng Wu asked, “Why? Did I say something wrong?”","Bu Jingyu said “They can destroy the fighter jets, but they have to have an operating table. Didn’t you blow up the inscription area?”","Feng Wu was delighted. “So, you’re saying since they don’t have an operating table, they can’t...”","Bu Jingyu said, “No, they have a backup operating table. Anyway, I saw one in Master’s courtyard. Wait. I hear footsteps...”","Bu Jingyu put his elbows on the wall and looked out.","He saw a group of people heading to the left wing.","Bu Jingyu’s place was an extension of the left wing, so he could look over the wall and see what was going on next door.","“Oh my god!” Bu Jingyu exclaimed.","Mr. Sakiya immediately looked in his direction.","Bu Jingyu was so frightened that his face turned pale. He went stiff and couldn’t make a sound.","His master was right there!","The person his master was after was behind him.","Those two people were less than ten meters apart!","Bu Jingyu was scared out of his wits.","Mr. Sakiya didn’t return alone. He had brought several people with him.","There was Zhu Yi, Bu Jingyu’s eldest senior brother, and other inscription masters whom Bu Jingyu had seen before.","The inscription masters who hadn’t been in the inscription area were naturally still alive.","When Mr. Sakiya saw Bu Jingyu, he frowned.","With so many things happening, he naturally had no time to teach his disciple. At that moment, he just wanted Bu Jingyu not to cause trouble.","Therefore, Mr. Sakiya’s face darkened as he glared at Bu Jingyu. “Go back and memorize inscriptions properly! You’re not allowed to leave this room before memorizing Level 6 inscriptions! Get lost!”","Bu Jingyu said, “Yes...”","Mr. Sakiya didn’t stay any longer, and he led his men into the left wing."]},{"number":3319,"title":"Chapter 3319 Right Next Door","paragraphs":["3319 Right Next Door","When Bu Jingyu saw Mr. Sakiya, Feng Wu heard the commotion too.","At that moment, her blood turned cold, and her entire body froze. She didn’t even dare to breathe!","There was great terror between life and death!","What Feng Wu was experiencing right now was that terror.","!!","She knew being a spy was very dangerous, but she didn’t expect it to be this dangerous. Things had always gone smoothly for her before, and she thought it would stay that way.","Bu Jingyu, who had been driven back from the wall, looked at Feng Wu in silence.","Feng Wu looked at him in silence as well.","Bu Jingyu was so anxious that his facial muscles shook.","“What should we do? What should we do? What should we do?”","Feng Wu rushed over and covered Bu Jingyu’s mouth, warning him in a low voice, “Shut up if you want to live!”","After hearing Feng Wu’s words, Bu Jingyu finally calmed down, but he still looked anxious.","“Master must have remembered the self-destruct program. He... There’s an operating table in his courtyard. Although it’s a simple version, it’ll still work. These fighter jets...”","Taking a deep breath, Feng Wu asked Bu Jingyu, “How long will it take for the fighter jets to blow up after the self-destruction program is activated?”","“Two hours? I remember it’ll take two hours.”","Feng Wu asked, “Will the fighter jets explode when the time is up?”","Bu Jingyu lowered his voice and nodded. “They’ll explode! When the countdown ends, they’ll explode! Our courtyard...”","His master was right next door! Would he sense the explosion?","Of course!","Feng Wu asked, “Can your master locate these fighter jets?”","Locating the fighter jets? Bu Jingyu scratched his head. “I don’t think I’ve heard that’s possible.”","Feng Wu said, “That’s great.”","Bu Jingyu said, “What’s great about it? You’re not going to dismantle them just like that, are you? Let me tell you, you won’t be able to make it in time. These five fighter jets...”","While Bu Jingyu was talking, Feng Wu had already dismantled the second fighter jet.","Bu Jingyu said, “You’re fast. Alright, maybe you really can do it.”","It didn’t take long for Feng Wu to dismantle all five aircraft and stop all five inscription propellers.","Bu Jingyu heaved a sigh of relief. “...Thank goodness, thank goodness. Finally...”","However, before Bu Jingyu could finish, Feng Wu waved her hand and put away the five disassembled fighter jets. Then, she waved her hand again and released five more.","Bu Jingyu froze before he could say more.","“How... how many did you steal?!” Bu Jingyu was about to cry!","Those five weren’t the only ones!","Feng Wu was honest. “There are 95 more.”","Thump!","With a loud thump, Bu Jingyu knelt on the ground!","He looked up and stared at Feng Wu, almost in tears. “Boss Feng Wu, are you trying to scare me to death?”","Feng Wu didn’t have time to scare him. She was racing against the clock.","According to Bu Jingyu, even in the bracelet, the fighter jets would still explode.","When the time came, the fluctuations from the explosion would definitely attract the attention of the people next door.","When that happened, Feng Wu couldn’t even imagine the consequences.","Bu Jingyu’s lips trembled. “Boss Feng Wu, you’re lying to me, aren’t you? Tell me, are you really lying to me?”","Feng Wu didn’t have time to talk to him. She dismantled another fighter jet.","Bu Jingyu muttered, “Although you’re fast, you’re not fast enough. We’re running out of time...”"]},{"number":3320,"title":"Chapter 3320 Someones Coming","paragraphs":["3320 Someone’s Coming","“Will I die? My life is so precious. Mother exchanged her life for it. I can’t die.","“What if I confess to Master now? Why don’t I confess?”","Bu Jingyu took two steps toward the door before he heard Feng Wu’s cold voice.","“Who do you think is more powerful, your master or your martial grandfather?”","!!","“Of course it’s my martial grandfather,” Bu Jingyu said without hesitation. “Master listens to Martial Grandfather. In front of Martial Grandmaster, Master is like a cat in front of a tiger. He’s very respectful.”","Feng Wu threw something at Bu Jingyu.","It was a hairpin from her childhood.","It was exactly the same as the hairpin in Bu Jingyu’s painting.","The beautiful lady had made a lot of these, so Feng Wu had taken one as a souvenir.","There was a wooden shelf in her storage space, and one of the compartments in it was used especially to store her old things.","“What’s this?” Bu Jingyu looked at the little girl’s hairpin. He was puzzled but found it a little familiar.","Feng Wu reminded him, “Think about your painting.”","Bu Jingyu’s puzzled eyes lit up instantly!","He stared at Feng Wu, then rushed into the room to look for the painting.","On it was still the cute little girl with a round face.","Bu Jingyu looked at the head accessory in it. It was exactly the same as the one in his hand.","He walked up to Feng Wu with the hairpin. “You... you made this on purpose, didn’t you?”","Feng Wu asked, “Do you think I can be bothered?”","Bu Jingyu didn’t know what to say. As far as he knew, Feng Wu wouldn’t do such a thing, but...","“Don’t tell me... Are you the one my Martial Grandfather is looking for?” Bu Jingyu crouched down in front of Feng Wu and studied her face.","Although her face had matured a little, she hadn’t changed that much, especially her eyes, nose, and mouth...","The more Bu Jingyu looked at her, the more he felt she looked similar.","He was much more convinced now.","Feng Wu said, “Everything will be fine if your master doesn’t find out what I did. If he does, we’ll mention your martial grandfather, and we’ll be safe.”","Despite what she said, Feng Wu knew very well she had caused too much trouble this time. Even her third senior brother’s reputation might not work.","However, these words were indeed enough to fool Bu Jingyu.","Bu Jingyu felt much more at ease. He nodded solemnly. “Alright! I’ll do that!”","As she spoke, Feng Wu finished five more fighter jets.","In such a short period of time, she had already completed ten.","Because she was moving so fast, Feng Wu felt her fingers go numb, and she couldn’t concentrate.","But she couldn’t rest at all.","Time was of the essence!","Feng Wu poured a bottle of tonic into her mouth. The next moment, she began to dismantle and write inscriptions again.","10, 20, 30...","Bu Jingyu paced around the courtyard anxiously. From time to time, he would lean against the wall and stare at the opposite side, fearing that someone would knock on the door.","40... 50... 60...","Finally, they were halfway through.","Sweat covered Feng Wu and Bu Jingyu’s foreheads, but they looked at each other in relief.","Soon, very soon...","At that moment, Bu Jingyu saw a person coming out of the left courtyard and walking straight over to his side.","It was Zhu Yi, his eldest senior brother!","Bu Jingyu’s face instantly turned pale!"]},{"number":3321,"title":"Chapter 3321 Crisis (1)","paragraphs":["3321 Crisis (1)","Bu Jingyu’s face instantly turned pale!","He scampered back, grabbed Feng Wu’s sleeve and said anxiously, “Senior Brother Zhu is here! He’s coming!!!”","Feng Wu’s stomach lurched!","Her fears had just come true.","!!","Feng Wu thought about hiding in the room, but a fighter jet couldn’t fit inside.","Hence, as Feng Wu quickly dismantled the fighter jet, she said to Bu Jingyu, “Go and hold him off for a while.”","After that, Feng Wu pushed Bu Jingyu toward the door.","Before Bu Jingyu realized it, he was already in the doorway.","Zhu Yi happened to arrive at that moment, and the two men looked at each other.","The senior brother was perplexed when he saw Bu Jingyu come out.","That wasn’t the most important thing. Zhu Yi frowned. “Why did you come out?”","Bu Jingyu scratched his head. “Well... I...”","As Bu Jingyu and Zhu Yi chatted, Feng Wu was quickly dismantling the fighter jet.","If Zhu Yi didn’t leave, she would have to hide inside to do her work.","However, the room wasn’t big enough to fit a fighter jet. Therefore, she had to remove the outer shell first.","As long as the shell was removed, Feng Wu could hide in the back room and write the inscription code to stop the self-destruct program.","Feng Wu’s fingers were moving so fast that if Bu Jingyu were here, he would be shocked.","70.","80.","Zhu Yi looked at Bu Jingyu in bewilderment. “Why are you stuttering?","Bu Jingyu said, “I’m not. Senior Brother Zhu, why are you here?”","Only then did Zhu Yi remember why he was here. He raised his hand and was about to push the door open.","However, Bu Jingyu stopped him.","Zhu Yi looked at him in surprise. “Get out of my way!”","Bu Jingyu said, “Why are you here?”","Zhu Yi said, “I remember you still have some tuckahoe leaves here, right?”","Bu Jingyu said, “Well, yes...”","Zhu Yi nodded. “Master and the others are all anxious. I came over to get some tuckahoe leaves to make tea for them. It’ll soothe their throats.”","Bu Jingyu still stood in the doorway.","How could he let Zhi Yi in?","If Zhu Yi went in, Bu Jingyu’s secret would be exposed!","There were many fighter jets in his courtyard!","There was also another Bu Jingyu!","Zhu Yi would be furious if he found out the truth.","Zhu Yi stared at Bu Jingyu. “Bu Jingyu, everyone is in a bad mood today. Master can lose his patience at any moment. You’d better be obedient!”","Bu Jingyu said, “I am. I...”","Zhu Yi ignored him and pushed him aside.","He wanted to see what Bu Jingyu was up to.","The courtyard was empty, and everything looked the same as before.","Bu Jingyu’s heart was in his mouth, and his entire body was stiff. His legs were so weak that he was about to kneel down, but when he saw the empty courtyard, he let out a long breath...","Boss Feng Wu was so fast! How amazing!","Feng Wu was awesome, but she wasn’t fast enough to dismantle all 100 fighter jets.","Feng Wu had been working on the last one when Zhu Yi pushed the door.","What other choice did Feng Wu have?","She couldn’t stop Zhu Yi.","In the end, she had no choice but to give up on the last fighter jet for the time being and hide in Bu Jingyu’s room."]},{"number":3322,"title":"Chapter 3322 Crisis (2)","paragraphs":["3322 Crisis (2)","Inside, Feng Wu sat on the floor with the Phoenix Pen in her hand as she worked on modifying inscriptions.","It was a major project.","It involved layers of inscription codes and formations. If one wasn’t careful, everything would all be destroyed.","Hence, Feng Wu was careful as she rewrote the words with the Phoenix Pen.","!!","Zhu Yi paced around the living room.","Scratching the back of his head, Bu Jingyu glanced at the room from time to time... Would Zhu Yi discover Feng Wu? He was panicking...","Zhu Yi glanced at Bu Jingyu. “Why do you look preoccupied?”","Bu Jingyu said, “No! I’m fine! I’m really fine!”","Zhu Yi was going to leave after taking the tuckahoe leaves.","Bu Jingyu almost relaxed.","Just then, Zhu Yi paused and looked at Bu Jingyu. “I didn’t want to say this, but you’re too reckless!”","What? Bu Jingyu looked at his senior brother in confusion.","What did he do?","He had stayed in this courtyard the entire time.","Before Bu Jingyu could say he was innocent, Zhu Yi glared at him. “You shouldn’t have gone to the scene in the early hours of the morning! Do you know how dangerous it was?!”","To the scene? OMG!","Bu Jingyu immediately realized what Zhu Yi was talking about.","It wasn’t him. It was Feng Wu!","Fortunately, he didn’t say he had never left the courtyard... Otherwise, no matter how much trust Zhu Yi had in him before, he would be suspicious now.","“Yes, Senior Brother Zhu. You’re right.” Bu Jingyu nodded.","Zhu Yi said, “If you go to the scene, it’s easy for you to get injured or be captured by the enemy as a hostage. You’ll even upset Master. Do you understand why you shouldn’t have gone there?”","Bu Jingyu wanted to cry because it hadn’t been him.","But he still had to answer respectfully, “Yes, yes, Senior Brother Zhu. You’re right.”","He was ready to see Zhu Yi off.","Why was his senior brother still here?","Bu Jingyu was so nervous!","Zhu Yi stared at Bu Jingyu. “Why are you nervous?”","Bu Jingyu said, “I – I’m not nervous!”","Zhu Yi glanced at him indifferently and didn’t say anything. Holding the box of tuckahoe leaves, he pushed open Bu Jingyu’s door!","Bu Jingyu turned pale.","Oh god!","Zhu Yi would see another Bu Jingyu inside.","He wondered if it was too late to ask for forgiveness.","However...","Bu Jingyu took a deep breath, but he saw the room was empty.","He was greatly relieved.","Zhu Yi looked back at Bu Jingyu and found the latter rather strange.","He walked up to the cupboard and opened it.","Bu Jingyu almost screamed.","Luckily, there was no one inside.","Zhu Yi looked at Bu Jingyu, who asked in confusion, “Senior Brother Zhu, what are you doing? Did you think I was hiding someone here?”","Zhu Yi rolled his eyes at Bu Jingyu. “You wouldn’t dare!”","Bu Jingyu said, “There are no pretty girls here in the manor. When we defeat the Junwu Empire, we can take their women. They have so many pretty girls.”","Zhu Yi knocked him on the head. “Why do you want to do that? They’re someone’s daughters too.”","He finally left with the tuckahoe leaves.","Bu Jingyu was relieved and started looking for Feng Wu."]},{"number":3323,"title":"Chapter 3323 Crisis (3)","paragraphs":["3323 Crisis (3)","Where was Boss Feng Wu hiding? She had hidden so well that even Senior Brother Zhu couldn’t find her.","Bu Jingyu kept making low whistling sounds, but he didn’t find any traces.","With a thump, Zhu Yi returned and stood at the entrance of the courtyard.","Bu Jingyu looked at him in shock. “Senior Brother Zhu, why are you here again?”","Zhu Yi stared at Bu Jingyu. After looking around the courtyard, he still didn’t find anything. He turned around and left quickly.","Where was Feng Wu now?","She had run to the woodshed.","Bu Jingyu was such a terrible actor that he would give himself away the moment he got nervous. So, Feng Wu slipped out of the window while Zhu Yi was outside.","In any case, she was already a Level 9 inscription master. Even Mr. Sakiya’s formation couldn’t stop her.","Feng Wu didn’t waste any more time because every second was precious!","She would never allow the self-destruct program to activate.","After climbing over the wall of Bu Jingyu’s yard, Feng Wu was very careful because she was next to the left courtyard, which was filled with inscription masters and formation masters. Just the slightest movement from her would alert them.","Thankfully, Mr. Sakiya wasn’t paying attention to her side. Otherwise, he would have noticed if Feng Wu touched his formation.","Carefully, Feng Wu walked out of the yard, found a woodshed nearby, and jumped into it.","She first dismantled the last fighter jet. That way, all that was left were the inscription propellers.","Feng Wu still had 20 inscription propellers.","The Phoenix Pen was powerful and moved as fast as lightning!","What Feng Wu didn’t know was that all the inscription masters in the left courtyard were staring at a screen nervously.","Mr. Sakiya sat in the middle with an inscription master each on his left and right.","On the big screen was the image of 100 fighter jets.","Behind each jet was a string of red numbers.","If one looked closely, one would see that the red numbers were counting down.","Beep!","The number was getting closer and closer to zero.","The countdown was about to finish for the first fighter jet.","Standing beside Mr. Sakiya was an inscription master whose surname was Bian.","Elder Bian frowned as he looked at Mr. Sakiya. “Must it be destroyed?”","Mr. Sakiya nodded. “Yes.”","Elder Niu also frowned. “If the second prince did it, we can take these fighter jets back. Why do this? These 100 fighter jets are too precious!”","The other two elders also looked at Mr. Sakiya.","After this incident, Mr. Sakiya still looked pale, but his expression had calmed down.","His face was pale because he hadn’t recovered from the injury that Jun Linyuan had inflicted on him, and he didn’t seem to be recovering at all.","Even Mo Lan didn’t know what to do.","Mr. Sakiya kept coughing up blood at night, but no one knew about that.","“What if it wasn’t the second prince?” Mr. Sakiya’s expression was cold.","“If it wasn’t the second prince, could it be the third prince?” everyone asked in unison.","Mr. Sakiya rubbed the area between his eyebrows. He only said, “What if it was someone from the Junwu Empire?”","“That’s impossible!” Elder Bian rejected the idea. “It can’t have been someone from the Junwu Empire! I can swear it on my head!”","The other elders also expressed that it was impossible.","Mr. Sakiya said calmly, “Why not? Since Jun Linyuan exists in this world, nothing is impossible.”"]},{"number":3324,"title":"Chapter 3324 Impossible","paragraphs":["3324 Impossible","Mr. Sakiya said calmly, “Why not? Since Jun Linyuan exists in this world, nothing is impossible.”","“Mr. Sakiya, you mean...”","The other four men gasped at the same time!","Elder Bian exclaimed, “Jun... Jun Linyuan is here?! Jun Linyuan is behind all this?!”","Mr. Sakiya glanced at him and said indifferently, “No.”","Everyone looked curiously at Mr. Sakiya. Why not?","Mr. Sakiya said, “Jun Linyuan is an arrogant and straightforward man. If he wants to attack the castle, he’ll do it openly. He’s not the type to do such a sneaky thing.”","That made sense.","Jun Linyuan was a powerful man, and he had always been a man of his word.","He wouldn’t do such a sneaky thing.","“Then who could it be?” Everyone frowned.","A person came to Mr. Sakiya’s mind, but he quickly rejected the possibility.","That girl was too weak. Her future might be limitless, but right now, she wasn’t worthy of the attention of experts like them.","So, it couldn’t be her.","Mr. Sakiya rubbed his temples and said coldly, “Now isn’t the time to investigate anyone.”","The most important thing now was to make the fighter jets self-destruct!","“I don’t think it was the second prince.” Elder Bian shook his head. “If it was him, he wouldn’t have ordered his men to steal the fighter jets since he must know that they have a self-destruct program. Not only would he not be able to steal them, he would also expose himself.”","The more Elder Niu thought about it, the more he felt Elder Bian’s words made sense.","He nodded and said, “That’s right. I also think the second prince is less suspect. In fact, any of our fellow Dongsanger would be less suspect. We can focus on the enemy!”","The other two inscription masters also nodded.","Mr. Sakiya didn’t say a word. His eyes were like deep pools, and no one knew what he was thinking.","His eyes were fixed on the fighter jets!","He had a feeling that something was about to go wrong.","Due to his injuries and the fact that he had been running around the entire night, Mr. Sakiya looked like he had aged a little. He didn’t seem as composed as usual.","Elder Bian couldn’t help but glance at Mr. Sakiya.","Why was he staring at the screen?","Soon, these fighter jets would be automatically destroyed.","“Wait a minute!”","Elder Bian suddenly exclaimed in surprise!","At that moment, everyone’s eyes were also fixed on the screen!","These 100 fighter jets were marked with numbers 1 to 100.","The countdown for the fighter jet with serial number 001 had clearly reached the end. It should have exploded!","However, on the screen, it was in a suspended state.","Suspended?","The four elders looked at each other. All of them had unprecedented doubt and shock on their faces!","Finally, they focused on Mr. Sakiya’s face!","At that moment, Mr. Sakiya...","He was also stunned!","He had a feeling that he knew this was going to happen.","Previously, he had a premonition that his opponent was so strong that he had to go all out. He didn’t expect the other party’s strength to be beyond his expectations.","“Has the self-destruct program on the inscription propeller been suspended?” Elder Bian didn’t believe it as he stared intently at Mr. Sakiya!","The other inscription masters also looked at Mr. Sakiya.","Mr. Sakiya nodded lightly."]},{"number":3325,"title":"Chapter 3325 Why Eavesdropping?","paragraphs":["3325 Why Eavesdropping?","He could maintain his composure, but the anger in his heart surged like lava!","“How can this be?” Elder Bian was stunned. He kept muttering to himself, “How can this be? How can it be suspended?”","Mr. Sakiya stared at Elder Bian. “If I remember correctly, the self-destruct code was written by the four of you, right?”","“That’s right.” Elder Bian and the other three nodded and admitted, “We studied it for decades before we finally developed it!”","Mr. Sakiya said, “But now...”","“That’s impossible!” Elder Bian shook his head. “I don’t believe anyone can break our inscription code!”","The other three elders also agreed.","Mr. Sakiya didn’t say a word as he frowned. “Could it be that the Junwu Empire has produced a powerful inscription master?”","“Impossible!” Elder Bian was the first to frown. “The technology of the Junwu Empire is much poorer than ours. It’s impossible for anyone to stop our self-destruct program.”","“There’s more than one. Look, number 002, number 003, number 004... All of these have been suspended!” Elder Niu exclaimed.","Everyone gasped.","They didn’t want to admit it, but they had to admit that the other party’s attainments in inscriptions were extraordinary!","Mr. Sakiya rubbed his brow.","He said in resignation, “How is the strength of this person who cracked the inscription code compared with yours?”","Elder Bian blurted out, “Definitely not as good as us!”","Mr. Sakiya didn’t say a word as he silently looked at Elder Bian.","Elder Bian felt a little guilty under his stare. He said weakly, “The other party’s strength is about the same as ours, right?”","Mr. Sakiya said, “I see.”","Elder Bian couldn’t refute Mr. Sakiya’s retort. After all, their opponent had indeed cracked their code.","Elder Bian said, “But I’m sure this person is definitely not from the Junwu Empire! They don’t have an inscription master this powerful! I can vouch for that with my own head!”","Mr. Sakiya frowned slightly and didn’t reply.","In fact, Mr. Sakiya himself also didn’t believe that the person could be from the Junwu Empire.","On the big screen, the self-destruct program of all 100 fighter jets had been suspended.","Mr. Sakiya pointed at Elder Bian. “What do you think we should do?”","Elder Bian patted his chest and said, “This is definitely a temporary suspension. Let’s modify the code and reactivate the self-destruct program.”","Without another word, Mr. Sakiya stood up and said indifferently, “Please.”","He gave his seat to Elder Bian.","Elder Bian didn’t know what to say.","Why did he suddenly feel a little guilty?","Meanwhile, Feng Wu finally dismantled the 100th fighter jet and heaved a sigh of relief.","She clapped her hands, stood up in the woodshed, and walked straight to Bu Jingyu’s small courtyard.","Along the way, she didn’t meet anyone else. She successfully climbed into the courtyard and appeared in front of Bu Jingyu.","Bu Jingyu’s eyes lit up when he saw Feng Wu.","“You’re back? Are you alright? You didn’t get caught, did you? I’m telling you, you scared me to death! I can’t believe Senior Brother Zhu suspected me and came back!” Bu Jingyu had just escaped a disaster. Right now, he was patting his chest and asking Feng Wu for credit, trying to show how good his acting was. He had even fooled the people in the left courtyard next door!","Feng Wu said, “Why were you standing on tiptoe and eavesdropping on everyone next door?”","Bu Jingyu said, “My master is admonishing Elder Bian and the others. He said the self-destruct program they designed isn’t good. Elder Bian said he wants to show his real strength and reactivate the self-destruct program automatically!”"]},{"number":3326,"title":"Chapter 3326 Nervous","paragraphs":["3326 Nervous","Feng Wu’s eyes flickered. “Elder Bian... Who’s that?”","Bu Jingyu said, “Elder Bian is amazing! He’s one of the most powerful inscription masters in our Dongsang Kingdom. He specializes in inscriptions. Even my master admits he’s not as good as Elder Bian. Perhaps he can really...”","Without another word, Feng Wu went next door.","Speaking of which, Feng Wu had been quite busy. She had been very nervous and hadn’t been able to relax.","!!","When Feng Wu went into the left yard, everyone was busy.","Only Zhu Yi noticed her.","“Jingyu, why are you here?” Zhu Yi frowned slightly.","Feng Wu looked inside and saw Mr. Sakiya and four old men arguing.","Feng Wu said, “I was worried about Master, so I came to take a look.”","Seeing that their Master didn’t chase Feng Wu away, Zhu Yi let her stay and help with serving tea to the elders.","The elders kept discussing and correcting. Finally, they confirmed the final code.","However...","They had never expected that the most important person, Feng Wu, would be right in front of them.","Even Mr. Sakiya didn’t notice her.","Feng Wu looked like she was about to fall asleep. Worried that Mr. Sakiya would be displeased by “Bu Jingyu’s” laziness, Zhu Yi nudged Feng Wu. “If you’re tired, go back.”","Feng Wu looked troubled. “But Senior Brother Zhu, I want to share Master’s burden...”","Zhu Yi hurriedly pushed her out. “Hurry up and leave. Master will definitely be angry if he sees you like this.”","Covering her mouth with her hand, Feng Wu yawned and said to Zhu Yi, “So... I’m really leaving?”","Zhu Yi said, “Go ahead.”","Feng Wu said, “Then I’ll come and help you after I wake up.”","Zhu Yi said, “Go ahead.”","Seeing his junior brother skip back to the courtyard next door, Zhu Yi smiled bitterly.","His lazy little junior brother... When would he grow up?","The only good thing was that the elders had finally developed a new method. Not only could they reactivate the self-destruct program, they could also locate the fighter jets.","Mr. Sakiya could finally heave a sigh of relief.","When Zhu Yi walked in, he heard his master ask Elder Bian, “When can you make it work?”","Elder Bian said proudly, “It’ll be done in less than an hour!”","Meanwhile, Feng Wu was back in Bu Jingyu’s yard.","When she turned around, cold sweat broke out on her forehead.","It was too dangerous!","If she hadn’t gone to the courtyard next door, she would have been caught by Mr. Sakiya in another hour.","When that happened, her life would end, and she could forget about the Immortal Spiritual Fruit.","Seeing Feng Wu, Bu Jingyu rushed up to her and said, “You’re finally back. I was so scared of dying just now. I was so worried...”","While Bu Jingyu was talking to Feng Wu, she rushed into the house and disappeared into an inner room.","Bu Jingyu was left behind. He subconsciously scratched his head, wondering what was going on.","Meanwhile, Feng Wu had already gone into the inner room. She took out the Phoenix Pen and started editing!","This was all thanks to Elder Bian.","Elder Bian had proudly explained his inscription encoding method, so...","Whoosh!","Feng Wu’s fingers moved so fast.","If not for Elder Bian’s spoiler, she wouldn’t have known how to modify the program. However, it was very easy to modify it now."]},{"number":3327,"title":"Chapter 3327 Immortal Spiritual Fruit","paragraphs":["3327 Immortal Spiritual Fruit","Seeing Feng Wu’s speed again, Bu Jingyu couldn’t believe his eyes.","“You’re so fast!” Bu Jingyu’s eyes widened. “Hey, Boss Feng Wu, what are you editing? Didn’t you do that already?”","Feng Wu said, “Elder Bian next door is locating them as we speak.”","Bu Jingyu was so frightened that his face turned pale!","!!","Locating them? OMG! Were all the inscription masters in Dongsang so powerful?! They could even locate the fighter jets?!","“Then, then, can they trace the fighter jets back to us? Can they? Can they really do that?” Bu Jingyu panicked.","Feng Wu nodded. “Yup.”","Bu Jingyu asked, “Then what should we do now?”","Feng Wu said, “I’ll edit them again.”","Bu Jingyu was about to say something else when Feng Wu glanced at him. “If you keep talking, I might not be able to change the last one in time...”","Bu Jingyu instantly covered his mouth with both hands, not daring to say a word!","Feng Wu was editing with the Phoenix Pen in her hand. Bu Jingyu was dazzled by the speed of her fingers.","...","Feng Wu’s hands were cramping up after she finished modifying the inscription propellers.","The Phoenix Pen fell to the ground, and she didn’t even have the strength to pick it up.","Bu Jingyu knelt and picked up the Phoenix Pen before putting it in front of Feng Wu respectfully.","He was so impressed that he didn’t know how to describe Feng Wu.","“Are we safe now?” Bu Jingyu asked weakly. His eyes were wet and filled with anticipation.","Looking at her hands, Feng Wu could see that her tendons were twitching.","She had been writing so fast that the tendons in her hands throbbed...","Feng Wu glanced at Bu Jingyu and said indifferently, “Let’s see if they’ll come to capture us.”","Bu Jingyu was shocked.","He couldn’t sleep the entire night.","He hugged his blanket and tossed and turned on the bed, unable to fall asleep.","Oh god...","“Was Boss Feng Wu fast enough?","“Does Master know the troublemaker is here?","“Will Master kill me for this?","“Martial Grandfather, when are you coming back?”","The poor child was so frightened that he didn’t sleep the entire night. When he woke up in the morning, he had the largest dark circles under his eyes, and his face was almost gray.","At the same moment, Feng Wu was no longer in Bu Jingyu’s courtyard.","Today was the last day before the Immortal Spiritual Fruit ripened.","The fruit would fall off the tree, and Mr. Sakiya would give it to Mo Lan.","Therefore...","Feng Wu had wanted to play Mu Yan at first so that she could go into the lab and repeat what happened last time. Then, she could steal the Immortal Spiritual Fruit.","After getting the Immortal Spiritual Fruit, she would leave right away.","However, things didn’t go as planned.","To Feng Wu’s surprise, Mu Yan wasn’t allowed to enter the lab.","Mr. Sakiya rejected her.","Since Mu Yan lost the Immortal Spiritual Fruit previously, Mr. Sakiya would never allow her to enter again.","To make matters worse, Mr. Sakiya would be in the lab.","When Mo Lan was refining the medicine, Mr. Sakiya would be watching her for fear of something happening.","Feng Wu was speechless when she learned this.","Although she had been prepared for this, she was still a little nervous when she saw how cautious Mr. Sakiya was.","In order to steal the Immortal Spiritual Fruit, she had come up with a total of three plans.","Plan A was no longer feasible.","Plan B was where Feng Wu would play the role of Mo Lan.","Therefore, it was also out of the question.","It had to be Plan C.","“Jingyu, where are you going?”"]},{"number":3328,"title":"Chapter 3328 What the Hell?","paragraphs":["3328 What the Hell?","“Jingyu, where are you going?” Zhu Yi asked Feng Wu.","Of course, Feng Wu couldn’t tell him where she was taking Mu Yan.","She told Zhu Yi, “We’re going to visit the crown prince. I wonder how he’s doing now.”","Hearing this, Zhu Yi let her leave.","After they were out of Zhu Yi’s sight, Mu Yan asked Feng Wu in bewilderment, “You said you wanted to tell me a secret. What’s that?”","Feng Wu said, “We can’t talk here. Someone will hear us.”","Mu Yan asked, “Is it that serious?”","Feng Wu said, “Of course! It’s top secret!”","Mu Yan looked around and finally said to Feng Wu, “This place is very close to Lotus Garden, where I live. Let’s talk there.”","Feng Wu nodded and followed Mu Yan.","Once they got there, Mu Yan turned around and looked at Feng Wu. “Tell me, what’s the secret...”","However, before Mu Yan could finish her sentence, Feng Wu had already knocked her out.","Mu Yan’s last memory was swamp-like darkness...","Feng Wu didn’t waste any time because time was of the essence.","After putting Mu Yan on the bed and tucking her in, Feng Wu disguised herself as Mu Yan.","She and Mu Yan had met many times, so Feng Wu already knew Mu Yan’s expressions, choice of words and demeanor.","Feng Wu gave Mu Yan a meaningful look. “...I’m going to make you the scapegoat again. I think I should call you Dr. Scapegoat.”","If Mu Yan were awake, she would have been driven mad by Feng Wu.","Feng Wu left Mu Yan’s place and headed for the crown prince’s courtyard.","Feng Wu had gathered some information already.","There were four Spiritual Overlords guarding the main courtyard. They each guarded one direction.","There was also a Spiritual Saint.","He was the deputy general manager of the Dongsang Kingdom’s royal palace.","Ever since Night Owl was chosen as the crown prince, this deputy general manager had been following him and protecting him.","When Night Owl and Jun Linyuan fought, Feng and the deputy director had both been searching for something. That was why the battle had gone out of control.","Now, the deputy general manager was afraid that something would happen to Night Owl again, so he had been guarding him in the room.","Behind a curtain, the deputy general manager sat in a corner and closed his eyes to rest.","Feng Wu took a deep breath.","She had to be bold and careful.","Because this mission would decide everything.","Just as Feng Wu was about to start setting up a trap, the deputy general manager’s cold voice came from behind her.","Feng Wu stiffened and felt a chill run down her spine.","She had to play it right.","Feng Wu turned around and complained to the deputy general manager, “I can’t believe you’re from the palace. How can you be so unromantic?”","Feng Wu had brought some warm water over earlier, so she was taking off Night Owl’s clothes to wipe him down. “His Royal Highness likes to keep things clean. You know that. Besides, we... we’re already as intimate as a married couple. Why don’t you... leave us alone?”","The deputy general manager had never seen such a straightforward girl. He really didn’t like her!","However, he knew what his young master was like, so he turned around and walked out. On his way out, the deputy general manager gave Feng Wu a warning look. “Don’t make the young master too tired!”","Feng Wu was speechless. She wasn’t going to do anything to Night Owl!"]},{"number":3329,"title":"Chapter 3329 The Critical Moment","paragraphs":["3329 The Critical Moment","After the deputy general manager left, Feng Wu took out a few more inscription bombs.","While the deputy general manager was not paying attention, she secretly stuffed the inscription bombs under Night Owl’s bed and the blanket.","The inscription bombs varied in size.","The big one was the size of a football, and the small one was the size of a fist.","!!","The inscription bomb that Feng Wu put under Night Owl’s blanket was only the size of a fist. If one didn’t lift the blanket, it would be impossible to tell it was there.","By the time Feng Wu finished making the special arrangements, she had used up more than half of her time.","She was making preparations, just in case something unexpected happened.","However, what Feng Wu didn’t notice was Night Owl’s fingers twitching under the blanket.","In fact... his eyeballs also moved slightly.","However, he had yet to completely wake up.","Just then, footsteps came from outside.","Mo Lan came with Mr. Sakiya, who was recuperating in a wheelchair.","Feng Wu glanced at Mr. Sakiya.","Mr. Sakiya was invincible in the Dongsang Kingdom and was ranked as one of the three dukes. Although his face was pale, he was cold and solemn, and his eyes were as deep as water. No one could tell what he was thinking.","When he stared at someone, it was as if the secret hidden deep in one’s heart would be revealed.","Luckily, Feng Wu had a tough mind.","When Mr. Sakiya’s lightning-like gaze fell on her, she handled the situation perfectly, reacting the way Mu Yan would.","Therefore, even someone as observant as Mr. Sakiya didn’t notice anything wrong with Feng Wu.","Mo Lan removed her hand from the back of Mr. Sakiya’s wheelchair and took out a bottle of medicinal liquid.","Feng Wu lowered her eyes.","To be able to refine a medicinal liquid that was as light as water was enough to show that Mo Lan’s medical skills were as good as hers.","Feng Wu stepped in front of Mo Lan and said calmly, “Master, please take care of Mr. Sakiya. Let me help you.”","Mo Lan was about to give the liquid to Feng Wu.","However, before she could reach out, Mr. Sakiya frowned slightly and said firmly, “Mo Lan, you do it.”","After Mu Yan failed the previous time, Mr. Sakiya no longer trusted her.","Seeing that her disciple was dejected, Mo Lan patted her shoulder and encouraged her, “You have to work hard to eliminate others’ doubts about you, understand?”","“Right...” Feng Wu lowered her head and looked aggrieved.","Her original plan was to get the liquid from Mo Lan and replace it. However, now that her plan had failed, Feng Wu began to feel a little nervous.","Because she only had one last chance.","Mr. Sakiya urged, “Mo Lan, what are you waiting for?”","Once the liquid was injected, Night Owl’s illness would recover, and he would be able to wake up.","Mr. Sakiya was afraid of further complications, so he kept urging Mo Lan.","Mo Lan wanted to give the opportunity to her disciple, but in the end, at Mr. Sakiya’s urging, she could only take a look at her disciple before standing beside Night Owl.","And at this moment, Night Owl was on the verge of waking up.","He had opened his eyes a little before. His mind was clear, so he knew very well what was under his blanket, and even what was under his bed.","Therefore, he tried his best to wake up.","However, the more anxious he was, the more chaotic the spiritual essence in his body became. In the end, Night Owl’s entire body stiffened."]},{"number":3330,"title":"Chapter 3330 Blow up Night Owl","paragraphs":["3330 Blow up Night Owl","However...","Night Owl’s moving fingers made contact with the inscription bomb, and it was cold to the touch.","He really wanted to warn Mo Lan to take the inscription bombs away. Otherwise, they would explode!","Also, that disciple of hers was a traitor! A blatant traitor!","!!","Because of his anger, Night Owl’s face was flushed and covered in sweat.","Mo Lan frowned. “The crown prince’s condition isn’t good. We have to inject the liquid quickly.”","As she spoke, Mo Lan took out a syringe and was about to inject the Immortal Spiritual Fruit medicinal liquid into Night Owl’s body.","At such a critical moment!","Boom!","There was a loud explosion outside!","A small fist-sized inscription bomb could blow up a house.","Of course, the main courtyard was protected by a formation, but Feng Wu was an expert at dismantling formations, so she had already made preparations.","The inscription bombs she had set up exploded at the most critical moment!","Speaking of which, she had learned that from the self-destruct program in the inscription propellers. Feng Wu was very grateful to Elder Bian.","“What’s going on?”","In an instant, everyone’s attention was attracted by the explosion outside!","Even Mr. Sakiya couldn’t help but turn his head!","Because!","An important corner of the formation he set up had actually been broken and couldn’t protect the courtyard.","Therefore, the entire house was shaking, and half of the courtyard collapsed from the explosion!","Mr. Sakiya’s expression was extremely ugly!","Continuous setbacks made the calm and composed Mr. Sakiya look angry and frustrated.","However...","Standing next to him, Feng Wu smiled.","Night Owl saw it!","He saw with his own eyes “Mu Yan” actually sneer in a strange way!","The next second, Feng Wu mouthed one word: “Explode!”","No!","Night Owl wanted to cry!","However, the explosion really happened.","Night Owl couldn’t understand why these inscription bombs were so ‘obedient’ to the girl. When she ordered them to explode, they really did!","Boom!","“Master, be careful!”","Feng Wu triggered an explosion when everyone’s attention was on the outside.","Given what she learned from Elder Bian, she could now set the inscription bombs to explode whenever she wanted.","Because of the sudden turn of events, Mo Lan didn’t react in time.","Feng Wu jumped up, pinned Mo Lan under her, and used her own body to block the explosion!","Mo Lan was knocked back by Feng Wu while Feng Wu was still holding onto her hand...","Hence, she let go of the tube in her hand, and it was about to fall to the ground...","Feng Wu caught it!","“Master, are you alright?” Feng Wu looked at Mo Lan anxiously.","Mo Lan choked on the smoke and quickly waved her hand. “I’m fine. I’ll take a look at the crown prince first...”","The explosion happened with Night Owl at the center... Mo Lan couldn’t imagine what kind of condition Night Owl would be in now.","Mr. Sakiya’s face was already as dark as soy sauce.","How could he still sit in the wheelchair? He had already rushed forward!","“Your Royal Highness?!”","Mr. Sakiya pulled Night Owl out of the flames with his bare hands.","Feng Wu could feel a scorching glare coming from Night Owl.","He was staring at her.","Feng Wu felt suffocated...","So Night Owl saw everything...","That was bad news.","Feng Wu had accomplished all her goals. She couldn’t stay here any longer.","..."]},{"number":3331,"title":"Chapter 3331 The Deceived Crown Prince","paragraphs":["3331 The Deceived Crown Prince","Feng Wu said to Mo Lan, “Master, the crown prince is seriously injured. I’ll go back and get him some medicine.”","Mo Lan didn’t suspect her at all and quickly waved her hand. “Go! Quickly!”","Feng Wu could still feel Night Owl’s furious gaze on her when she walked out.","Feng Wu bowed and hurried away.","!!","Feng Wu ran out of the yard and dashed off.","The castle gate!","She had to rush out of the castle gate before Mr. Sakiya could react.","Otherwise, if she was locked up inside, she wouldn’t be able to do anything.","“Miss Mu Yan, where are you going?” A voice rang out behind Feng Wu.","Feng Wu saw five people in a row.","It was the five brothers.","Special blood!","Seeing the five brothers, Feng Wu was reminded of the special blood.","These five brothers had competed against her in an eating competition, but they were defeated. Of course, she was now acting as Mu Yan, so they couldn’t recognize her.","Feng Wu was conflicted.","The special blood...","If she had time, she would definitely make a trip to Mo Lan’s medicine refinery to steal some special blood for research, but time was too tight.","No one knew when Mr. Sakiya would see through her trick.","No one knew if Night Owl would suddenly speak.","Hence, Feng Wu decided not to be greedy.","“Babu, I’ll take your mount,” Feng Wu said to one of the five brothers.","Babu was riding a shire horse. Its shoulder height was 195cm, and it weighed over a ton, so it could support Babu.","The five brothers were all riding such horses.","For Feng Wu, that horse was like an elephant.","If she had a choice, Feng Wu wouldn’t choose such a mount because the shire horse was a cold-blooded horse.","Cold-blooded horses were huge, quiet and steady by nature. They were usually used to working, just like cows.","However, she had no choice now.","Before Babu could react, Feng Wu took his horse.","Clip-clop! Clip-clop!","Feng Wu rode toward the castle gate.","Babu and the rest looked at each other in confusion. What was wrong with Mu Yan? She was acting like someone was chasing after her.","Moreover, she had actually taken a fancy to a shire horse as a mount? How strange.","Feng Wu didn’t care if others thought she was strange or not. She would run as far as she could, preferably all the way back to Nest Fortress.","Soon, Feng Wu arrived at the gate...","Meanwhile, in the main courtyard of the great general’s residence, Night Owl...","This crown prince was really pitiful.","He had blown up Jun Linyuan before, and Feng Wu had taken revenge on him.","His entire body was charred black. His hair was the most severely affected and was almost completely burnt. Even though Mr. Sakiya had saved him in time, smoke was still rising from his body.","However, Night Owl had the physique of a Spiritual Saint, so the inscription bomb could only injure his skin and not his internal organs.","However, how could Night Owl take this lying down?!","“Mu... Mu...” Night Owl couldn’t move yet, but he had to say the culprit’s name even if it cost him his life!","Mo Lan sat in front of Night Owl’s bed and looked at him in concern. “Calm down. Mu Yan has already gone to get the pills and will be back soon. Don’t worry. Your injuries are all minor...”","She thought Night Owl was calling Mu Yan’s name.","However, Night Owl was still moving his lips. “Mu... Mu...”"]},{"number":3332,"title":"Chapter 3332 Take the Blame","paragraphs":["3332 Take the Blame","However, Night Owl was still moving his lips. “Mu... Mu...”","Mo Lan said, “Are you still trying to move in this state? Don’t think about it anymore. The treatment is more important.”","After that, she looked around and wondered why Mu Yan wasn’t back yet.","However, Mr. Sakiya looked at Night Owl and was alarmed when he saw the anger in his eyes!","!!","“You mean Mu Yan?”","Night Owl blinked, then blinked hard.","Mr. Sakiya’s heart skipped a beat!","He had a very bad feeling!","He asked Mo Lan, “Where’s the Immortal Spiritual Fruit liquid?!”","Mo Lan said unhappily, “It’s right here.”","She was holding the potion in her hand. Then, she handed it to Mr. Sakiya.","The medicine bottles were all standard ones, so there was no difference in their appearance. However, Mr. Sakiya’s eyelid twitched.","He grabbed a servant of the crown prince and injected the medicine into him.","At first, the servant was fine, but soon...","The servant’s face turned ashen. His body trembled, and he fell to the ground, never to wake up again.","Mr. Sakiya put a finger under his nose, but the servant was no longer breathing.","When Mo Lan saw Mr. Sakiya’s reaction, she hurriedly went forward to check the servant’s breathing. Her expression instantly changed!","Mo Lan asked, “Is he dead?”","Mr. Sakiya kept a straight face and didn’t say a word.","Mo Lan said, “How can this be? I refined the liquid myself. How could this happen...”","Mr. Sakiya was so angry that he couldn’t say a word.","He was on guard, but it was still impossible to guard against his enemy!","“It was Mu Yan!” Mr. Sakiya turned around and rushed out!","Mu Yan?","How could it be Mu Yan?","Mo Lan couldn’t understand.","What did this have to do with Mu Yan?","She lowered her head and looked at the potion in her hand. Did Sakiya mean Mu Yan had switched out the potion?","But that was impossible...","However, Mu Yan never came back.","Mo Lan really wanted to rush out and capture Mu Yan so that she could clarify this matter, but...","Now that Night Owl had to be treated, she had no time to go out.","Mo Lan shouted at Mr. Sakiya’s back, “Find Mu Yan. Don’t kill her!”","However, Mr. Sakiya didn’t reply.","In Mu Yan’s courtyard.","When Mr. Sakiya came in, he realized the place had been ransacked. The clothes in the wardrobe had been thrown everywhere, and the floor had been turned over...","“Master, there’s no sign of Mu Yan.”","Mr. Sakiya frowned deeply as he surveyed his surroundings. Finally, he ordered coldly, “Split up and find her! Put a bounty on her head!”","“Yes!” His second disciple nodded and left.","As for Bu Jingyu, he almost couldn’t breathe properly.","Mu Yan had been knocked out by Feng Wu in her room, but...","When Feng Wu was forced by Mr. Sakiya to choose Plan C, she asked someone to deliver a letter to Bu Jingyu.","The letter was very simple. It told Bu Jingyu that if he didn’t want to be exposed, he would follow Feng Wu’s instructions.","The steps were also listed in the letter.","It was the process of faking the scene to make it look like Mu Yan had escaped with her belongings and finally disappeared.","Where was Mu Yan?","By then, she had long been killed by Bu Jingyu. Her corpse had also been dissolved by a melting potion. She was dead without a trace.","If anyone had to take the blame for what Feng Wu had done, it would be Mu Yan.","Mr. Sakiya could only trace things back to Mu Yan and not Bu Jingyu."]},{"number":3333,"title":"Chapter 3333 Endless Pursuit","paragraphs":["3333 Endless Pursuit","Bu Jingyu was such an obedient helper that Feng Wu might be able to use him as a disguise again in the future.","At the same moment, Feng Wu rode the horse into the Dayless Woods.","The shire horse was good at carrying burdens, but not traveling. Hence, Feng Wu let go of it and drove it into the territory of a beast king.","She knew very well that the shire horse would be devoured by the beast king.","!!","What she wanted was to leave no evidence behind.","Mr. Sakiya would definitely investigate. She only hoped Babu wouldn’t say anything unnecessary...","But in fact, that was impossible.","When Mr. Sakiya issued the bounty, Babu immediately came looking for him.","The person who greeted Babu was Mr. Sakiya’s second disciple.","Yu Ming, the second disciple, was a vicious person. When he heard Babu mention Mu Yan, he immediately brought him to see Mr. Sakiya.","Then, Mr. Sakiya quickly found out that Mu Yan had run to the Junwu Empire.","Mr. Sakiya’s expression was extremely ugly!","Mu Yan!","Mo Lan tried to defend her. “No, Mu Yan wouldn’t do that.”","Mr. Sakiya stared at Mo Lan. “She was also the one who lost the first Immortal Spiritual Fruit.”","Mo Lan was speechless.","At that moment, Zhu Yi rushed over and handed him a book. “Master, I found this book in Mu Yan’s room.”","The title of the book was revealed to everyone.","It was “Basic Language of the Junwu Empire.”","Everyone was astonished.","Mr. Sakiya recalled a girl who had complained to him once, saying that Mu Yan liked Jun Linyuan so much that she was going crazy.","In the past, Mr. Sakiya wouldn’t have thought of this possibility, but now, something like this had happened.","When Mr. Sakiya accepted the assumption that Mu Yan was crazy about Jun Linyuan, he realized that everything made sense.","Mu Yan had betrayed the Dongsang Kingdom because she was crazy about Jun Linyuan.","Mu Yan was crazy about Jun Linyuan, so she stole the first Immortal Spiritual Fruit.","Mu Yan was crazy about Jun Linyuan, so she stole the second Immortal Spiritual Fruit.","Mu Yan was crazy about Jun Linyuan... Mr. Sakiya thought of the destroyed fighter jet base!","Could Mu Yan have contributed to that?","Mr. Sakiya was about to go crazy from anger!","And at this moment, Yu Ming told him Babu had seen Mu Yan, who had even taken his horse. Furthermore, the shire horse had run toward the Junwu Empire!","How could Mr. Sakiya sit still?","He lowered his head and shouted, “Deputy general manager, please come with us!”","The deputy general manager stared at Mr. Sakiya with dark eyes.","His duty was to protect the crown prince, Night Owl. The rest was none of his business.","But this time, he was also furious.","He was an invincible existence at the Spiritual Saint stage, yet he was tricked by a girl.","That girl was really thick-skinned. She looked like she wanted to sleep with the crown prince, but it was only a deception.","The deputy general manager stared at Mr. Sakiya but didn’t agree directly. Instead, he turned to look at Night Owl.","He said to Mr. Sakiya, “I’ll go once the crown prince is no longer in critical condition.”","Mr. Sakiya realized he couldn’t order the deputy general manager around. He felt even more enraged.","However, he was usually calm and collected, and this time was no exception.","Mr. Sakiya left with several Spiritual Overlords.","Meanwhile, Feng Wu was dashing toward the border of the Junwu Empire!","She was sprinting at a speed she had never experienced in her life!","Run! Run! Run!","She couldn’t get caught!"]},{"number":3334,"title":"Chapter 3334 Dragon Phoenix Blood","paragraphs":["3334 Dragon Phoenix Blood","Wait!","Feng Wu suddenly remembered something.","She still looked like Mu Yan!","She had to change her appearance back as soon as possible. Otherwise, if she was caught, she would have to take the blame for Mu Yan.","!!","Feng Wu found an ancient tree with lush branches and leaves at the top, jumped on it, and quickly changed her clothes.","Her headdress, her face, her clothes... She changed back into her original appearance.","She was dressed in bright red and exuded a refreshing aura.","Feng Wu jumped from tree to tree like a nimble monkey.","Because she had the Sacred Imperial Spider’s golden bead and knew the layout of the Dayless Woods, she didn’t go astray. She rushed to the border of the Junwu Empire in a safe way!","Once she passed the peacock’s woods, she would reach the border of the Junwu Empire!","The Peacock King looked at Feng Wu in surprise when she went past. “You’re back?”","Feng Wu threw a small bottle containing a Semi-Divine essence pill at the peacock!","The Peacock King was dumbfounded!","Why did she suddenly give it such a precious gift?","As she ran, Feng Wu told the peacock, “If Mr. Sakiya and the others come after me, don’t tell them I’ve been to the Dongsang Kingdom!”","Before the peacock realized what Feng Wu meant, Feng Wu was already gone.","The Peacock King muttered, “What happened?”","Suddenly!","The Peacock King was struck by a thought.","Had the girl caused trouble in the Dongsang Kingdom?","Mr. Sakiya must be pursuing her!","Oh no!","“I can’t stay here.”","It had a long-term cooperative relationship with the Dongsang Kingdom and had always sided with the latter. If Mr. Sakiya came here and asked about Feng Wu, should it answer or not?","The Peacock King hurriedly hid the Semi-Divine pill in its pocket and quickly walked back to its nest.","Just as the peacock entered the cultivation state, Mr. Sakiya arrived with his men.","Behind Mr. Sakiya were four Spiritual Overlords, and the five of them stopped in unison.","Mr. Sakiya walked up to the peacock and stared at it with his cold eyes.","The Peacock King’s stomach lurched.","“No, I can’t open my eyes. I can’t wake up!”","It couldn’t answer Mr. Sakiya’s questions.","Although it was a beast king, it understood human principles. It had to keep its promise.","Mr. Sakiya’s deep, cold eyes were like needles as he stared at the Peacock King. His stare seemed to become colder and colder.","The Peacock King refused to exit its cultivation state no matter what!","Never!","The corners of Mr. Sakiya’s mouth curled up into a sneer.","He knew the Peacock King well. The way the peacock reacted meant that there was a problem.","Mr. Sakiya raised his hand. “Let’s go!”","Meanwhile, inside Nest Fortress.","In Jun Linyuan’s yard.","In the basement.","A pair of tightly shut eyes slowly opened.","In an instant, it was like an explosion of a myriad of stars.","His face was cold and expressionless.","The atmosphere was solemn and silent.","His breath carried the aura of a dragon and a phoenix!","Jun Linyuan, the peerless young man who was feared by everyone, finally pushed open the door and walked out of the dark basement.","Feng had been standing outside with his hands on either side.","Even if the outside world was destroyed, he wouldn’t take a step away from the door.","The door opened, and the young man appeared in front of him.","“Young master!”","In a moment of desperation, the steward addressed Jun Linyuan that way.","He had always referred to him as Your Royal Highness.","Jun Linyuan frowned. Young master?","...","Before Jun Linyuan could ask anything, Feng realized he had made a mistake and changed the subject. “Your Royal Highness, Miss Wu’s life is in danger!”"]},{"number":3335,"title":"Chapter 3335 Great Opportunity","paragraphs":["3335 Great Opportunity","Meanwhile, Feng Wu had no idea that Jun Linyuan had woken up. She was running as fast as she could!","She wanted to cover as much ground as possible.","Soon, Feng Wu arrived at the Sacred Imperial Spider’s territory.","Ever since Feng Wu left, the Sacred Imperial Spider hadn’t had a good night’s sleep. As soon as it closed its eyes, it would imagine how Mr. Sakiya would smash Feng Wu into a pulp.","!!","When it opened its eyes again, it would worry about how Jun Linyuan would crush it into a pancake.","As the Sacred Imperial Spider tossed and turned, it was startled by Feng Wu.","“You’re back?!”","The Sacred Imperial Spider looked at Feng Wu in delight.","Feng Wu nodded and returned the golden bead to the Sacred Imperial Spider. “This saved my life. It’s a little worn out.”","The Sacred Imperial Spider took a look. “Worn out” was an understatement. The bead had almost become flat!","The Sacred Imperial Spider swallowed the golden bead and told Feng Wu, “So be it. I have nothing to do anyway. I’ll be able to nourish it once more.”","Feng Wu handed the Sacred Imperial Spider a bottle of all-purpose transformation liquid. “This is your compensation.”","“All-purpose transformation liquid?!” The Sacred Imperial Spider was excited. “How did you get this treasure?!”","Feng Wu asked, “Is it useful to you?”","The Sacred Imperial Spider said, “Of course it’s useful! It’s too useful! I’ve always been stuck at this bottleneck. If I have the help of the all-purpose transformation liquid, not only can I break through, my physique might also change. You’re really my lucky star!”","That was good news. Feng Wu heaved a sigh of relief. “I can’t run anymore. If Mr. Sakiya comes later, give me a hand.”","The Sacred Imperial Spider nodded.","However, it was very curious. “What did you do over there to make Mr. Sakiya chase after you?”","Feng Wu said, “I’ll tell you once everything blows over.”","The Sacred Imperial Spider knew now wasn’t the time to talk about this, so it nodded.","Feng Wu took a few mouthfuls of recovery medicine before she felt better.","The Sacred Imperial Spider had its underlings, who had already gone to inform Nest’s people. Soon, they would send someone to protect Feng Wu.","Moreover, there was a good chance that Mr. Sakiya wouldn’t recognize Feng Wu as Mu Yan.","Feng Wu was right. Soon, Mr. Sakiya arrived with his men.","When he reached the Sacred Imperial Spider’s woods, he suddenly frowned and stopped.","Mr. Sakiya had his suspicions along the way.","He knew Mu Yan’s abilities.","Mr. Sakiya was personally leading the chase. Four Spiritual Overlords came with him, and one of them was his eldest disciple, Zhu Yi.","With such a team, it was impossible for them not to catch up to Mu Yan. However, they never saw her along the way!","Therefore, Mr. Sakiya was a little suspicious.","Either Mu Yan had been hiding her strength, or that person wasn’t Mu Yan at all. Someone was pretending to be her!","Mr. Sakiya had a keen intuition!","He stared at the Sacred Imperial Spider.","For some reason, he felt that person had entered the Sacred Imperial Spider’s woods.","Hence, Mr. Sakiya led the team inside.","When he entered, the Sacred Imperial Spider was sitting on the roof, cultivating.","It had already had the three lucky draws provided by the all-purpose transformation liquid.","Perhaps it was because good people were always rewarded for their good deeds, but the Sacred Imperial Spider had gained a lot this time!","The first two draws were all cultivation experience points, which meant that its cultivation could increase greatly!"]},{"number":3336,"title":"Chapter 3336 Admit Your Crime","paragraphs":["3336 Admit Your Crime","The third draw was an energy that could change one’s physique. This was a treasure that the Sacred Imperial Spider had always dreamed of!","At this moment, one could imagine how excited the Sacred Imperial Spider was!","Just as the Sacred Imperial Spider was feeling excited, Mr. Sakiya arrived.","The first thing Mr. Sakiya saw was the Sacred Imperial Spider. He frowned imperceptibly.","!!","This Sacred Imperial Spider gave him a feeling similar to the Peacock King.","Both of them had the same guilty conscience.","“Master!”","Yu Ming pointed at the person busy working in the field with her pants rolled up.","Mr. Sakiya turned his head and saw a familiar figure.","Even Zhu Yi recognized her at a glance. Wasn’t she the rising star from the Junwu Empire?","Feng Wu was digging for military badges with her pants rolled up. When she saw Mr. Sakiya, she waved at him and greeted him in a clear voice. “Mr. Sakiya, hello. Long time no see. How have you been?”","How else could Mr. Sakiya have been? He was about to die from anger.","Mr. Sakiya kept staring at Feng Wu with brooding looks in his eyes.","Feng Wu’s back went a little stiff.","She was a little flustered.","Did Bu Jingyu follow her instructions?","Did Mr. Sakiya find out that Mu Yan wasn’t the real one?","Had her whereabouts been exposed?","Feng Wu didn’t know the answers, so she pretended that Mr. Sakiya hadn’t figured out what she was doing. In any case, she wouldn’t admit it, and she wouldn’t be caught red-handed.","Yu Ming darted a look at Feng Wu and then at his master. All of a sudden, a plan formed in his mind.","Pointing at Feng Wu, Yu Ming said, “Feng Wu! How dare you! What have you done?!”","Feng Wu was almost scared to death!","Did Mr. Sakiya recognize her as Mu Yan?!","That wasn’t right... If Mr. Sakiya had recognized her, the first glance he gave her wouldn’t have been a probing look. Instead, it would have been filled with anger and killing intent.","So, Yu Ming was bluffing.","Feng Wu glared at Yu Ming. “What are you screaming for? I don’t know what you’re talking about!”","Yu Ming was speechless.","As expected, Yu Ming was a little intimidated by Feng Wu’s tough demeanor.","Yu Ming stole a glance at his master from the corner of his eye. Seeing that the latter had no intention of objecting, he knew Mr. Sakiya had tacitly given him approval.","With his teacher’s tacit approval, Yu Ming immediately said righteously, “You stole 100 of the Dongsang Kingdom’s fighter jets. How are we going to settle this score?!”","Feng Wu’s stomach lurched. 100 fighter jets... He was right.","However, Feng Wu didn’t believe Mr. Sakiya could find that out. Were they trying to trick her?","What Feng Wu didn’t know was that the Sacred Imperial Spider was flabbergasted!","100 fighter jets?! Oh my god! When this girl made a move, she could shock everyone!","However, Feng Wu looked confused. “100 fighter jets? What about them?”","Yu Ming said, “Stop pretending! You stole them!”","Feng Wu chuckled as she studied Yu Ming. “The Dongsang Kingdom lost 100 fighter jets, and they were stolen? Really? That’s hilarious!”","Seeing the gloating look on Feng Wu’s face, Yu Ming was frustrated.","He didn’t know what to say when Feng Wu acted so unreasonably.","Zhu Yi stared at him with a displeased look.","It wasn’t Feng Wu, so how could Yu Ming blame it on her?","What Yu Ming was doing wasn’t something a gentleman would do."]},{"number":3337,"title":"Chapter 3337 Save Her Life","paragraphs":["3337 Save Her Life","Mr. Sakiya’s gaze was gloomy and unfathomable the entire time.","Zhu Yi looked at Yu Ming and shook his head. “You shouldn’t have done that.”","Yu Ming looked at Zhu Yi with dissatisfaction and secretly gritted his teeth.","He wasn’t doing it for himself. It was to help the Dongsang Kingdom!","“Feng Wu stole 100 fighter jets from the Dongsang Kingdom!” Yu Ming wouldn’t let it go.","He stared at his master. It was such a good opportunity to take Feng Wu away. Why should they let it go?","He had asked around and found out that Feng Wu was Jun Linyuan’s girlfriend. If they took her away, they would be able to blackmail Jun Linyuan!","The two forces were at war. If the Dongsang Kingdom could blackmail Jun Linyuan, they would be invincible!","How smart was Mr. Sakiya? How could he not think of something that Yu Ming could think of?","However, Mr. Sakiya thought deeper.","On the surface, all the evidence pointed to Mu Yan, but was it really Mu Yan? Couldn’t it be Feng Wu?","Mr. Sakiya waved his hand. “Bring her back!”","Yu Ming and another Spiritual Overlord hurried over and were about to detain Feng Wu.","Feng Wu frowned. “Mr. Sakiya, I’ve always respected you as a wise elder. It’s not like you confuse right and wrong!”","However, Feng Wu’s words didn’t stop Mr. Sakiya.","Because Yu Ming’s words reminded him.","Jun Linyuan.","The stunning Jun Linyuan.","He had woken up and recovered his cultivation ability.","From Jun Linyuan, Sakiya’s thoughts went to his own crown prince. No matter how magnanimous Mr. Sakiya was, he would still favor his own side.","Night Owl was lying in bed, and no one knew if he was dead or alive. Why could Jun Linyuan and Feng Wu enjoy each other’s company after the former recovered his strength?","Besides, no matter how innocent Feng Wu looked, Sakiya still found her suspicious","“Take her away!” ordered Mr. Sakiya.","The spider became flustered.","It was at the critical moment of its breakthrough!","However, it couldn’t accept that Mr. Sakiya wanted to take Feng Wu away, because it knew very well Feng Wu really had gone to the Dongsang Kingdom to cause trouble.","If they really took Feng Wu away, it would be hard for her to keep a secret under torture. Once the truth was out, Feng Wu would die, and the spider knew Jun Linyuan would slap it to death!","At that thought, the Sacred Imperial Spider appeared between Mr. Sakiya and Feng Wu.","“Wait!”","The spider stared at Mr. Sakiya. “This is my territory. Shouldn’t you ask for my permission first?”","Mr. Sakiya stared at the Sacred Imperial Spider and waved his hand. “This is none of your business.”","The Sacred Imperial Spider didn’t move.","Mr. Sakiya’s expression was unprecedentedly serious as he warned the spider, “Do you really think I won’t dare touch you?!”","When Mr. Sakiya was gentle, he had the image of a civilized scholar, but when he was angry, he could create a stir that reminded one of a storm, making people tremble involuntarily.","The Sacred Imperial Spider stared at Mr. Sakiya in disbelief. “Are you a junior Spiritual Saint now?”","The Sacred Imperial Spider remembered clearly that Mr. Sakiya hadn’t been that powerful before. He had been severely injured by Jun Linyuan and was on the verge of death. He wasn’t supposed to be so powerful!","Mr. Sakiya was also staring at the Sacred Imperial Spider. “You have also reached the threshold of the Spiritual Saint stage.”","The Sacred Imperial Spider snorted. “You finally noticed.”","Although the Sacred Imperial Spider hadn’t completely advanced to the Spiritual Saint stage, it had already touched the threshold. Given time, it would advance to the Spiritual Saint stage in less than a day!"]},{"number":3338,"title":"Chapter 3338 Crisis","paragraphs":["3338 Crisis","Mr. Sakiya said indifferently, “If you don’t want all your years of cultivation to go to waste, stand aside.”","“Are you threatening me?!” the Sacred Imperial Spider asked angrily.","Mr. Sakiya said, “You’re a smart creature.”","What he meant was that a smart creature should protect itself and not get involved blindly.","!!","The Sacred Imperial Spider also wanted to protect itself. It wasn’t easy to advance to the Spiritual Saint stage, and it was only halfway through its breakthrough. It would be such a pity if it died here.","The spider was conflicted.","At this moment, a figure appeared in the Sacred Imperial Spider’s woods.","“Mr. Sakiya?”","Feng Wu turned around, and her heart sank.","Elder Dongfang!","The Sacred Imperial Spider turned around and was surprised to see Elder Dongfang. Why was she here? Where was Elder Helian, who was close to Feng Wu? The spider remembered that Elder Dongfang wanted Feng Wu dead!","The Sacred Imperial Spider immediately felt even more pressure!","Behind Elder Dongfang were four Spiritual Overlords.","At that moment, she was staring at Mr. Sakiya.","Mr. Sakiya and Elder Dongfang were old acquaintances. He didn’t say anything else as he silently stared at Elder Dongfang.","Elder Dongfang frowned. “What happened?”","Before Feng Wu could say anything, the Sacred Imperial Spider spoke up for her.","“Mr. Sakiya wants to take her away as a hostage and threaten Jun Linyuan and Nest Fortress!”","Yu Ming immediately said, “Feng Wu stole 100 fighter jets from the Dongsang Kingdom!”","WHAT?!","Elder Dongfang turned to Feng Wu. Was she that capable?!","Feng Wu knew that Yu Ming didn’t know she had really stolen 100 fighter jets. She knew he was framing her, but it just so happened that she had stolen them...","Of course, Feng Wu would never admit it.","She stared at Yu Ming and sneered. “Fighter jets? 100 of them? Gosh! Can’t you see what level I am at? I’m a Level 6 Spiritual King!","“Are all the people from the Dongsang Kingdom idiots? There are so many Spiritual Overlords and even Spiritual Saints in Sun Castle. How could I, a Level 6 Spiritual King, steal your fighter jets, let alone 100 of them?! If you want to frame me, at least use your brain!”","Yu Ming flushed at Feng Wu’s scolding, but he couldn’t refute her.","Because what Feng Wu said made perfect sense.","Elder Dongfang thought for a moment and realized Feng Wu was right. She was only a Level 6 Spiritual King, so how could she steal 100 fighter jets from Sun Castle, which was full of powerful cultivators? Feng Wu would be lying through her teeth if she said she did it.","What was more...","Elder Dongfang glared at Feng Wu. “Haven’t you been in the Magical Equipment Division for the past few days?”","Feng Wu said, “That’s right! I’ve been in the Magical Equipment Division all this time. I just came out for a breather today, and the spider brought me here to work for it. However, he accused me of stealing 100 fighter jets. If I had the ability to steal them, I wouldn’t be here picking up military badges.”","The Sacred Imperial Spider almost wanted to applaud Feng Wu!","She was so d*mn right!","If she had such ability, why would she be here?","Elder Dongfang said to Mr. Sakiya, “Mr. Sakiya, have we clarified this matter?”","Mr. Sakiya shot a suspicious glance at Elder Dongfang.","He knew about the war between the Military Academy and Imperial College. He also knew that Elder Dongfang and Feng Wu were at loggerheads, but Elder Dongfang was defending Feng Wu now."]},{"number":3339,"title":"Chapter 3339 Elder Dongfang","paragraphs":["3339 Elder Dongfang","Yu Ming said directly, “Elder Dongfang, it’s best if you don’t interfere in this matter. It will do you good.”","Feng Wu was alarmed.","was hostile to her, to begin with. If she helped the Dongsang Kingdom now...","However, to Feng Wu’s surprise, Elder Dongfang smirked.","“In the Junwu Empire, there is competition between the Military Academy and Imperial College. However, at the national level, the Military Academy and Imperial College have always had the same goal.”","!!","stared at Mr. Sakiya. “That’s why I won’t allow you to take Feng Wu away.”","Feng Wu looked at Elder Dongfang in surprise.","Her behavior reminded Feng Wu of a character she had read about in a novel before.","That character wasn’t very likable, but she was principled.","Somehow, Elder Dongfang seemed to have a halo above her head. Feng Wu wondered which Elder Dongfang was the real one.","Mr. Sakiya stared at Elder Dongfang. “Are you not going to back off?”","said, “The people of the Junwu Empire won’t swallow such a humiliation!”","Mr. Sakiya nodded. “I respect your choice.”","As soon as he finished speaking, the two of them stood opposite each other.","Feng Wu could feel the tension in the air.","There was deadly killing intent between Mr. Sakiya and Elder Dongfang!","glared at Feng Wu. “Back off!”","Feng Wu gave Elder Dongfang a meaningful look. This battle was beyond the capability of a Level 6 Spiritual King.","No matter how good she was at fighting, there was no way she could ignore the gap between their levels.","Taking a deep breath, Feng Wu accepted Elder Dongfang’s kindness and stood behind her.","“Bring it on.” Elder Dongfang bluntly invited Mr. Sakiya to fight to the death.","Strong killing intent gathered between them.","Before Feng Wu could react, Elder Dongfang and Mr. Sakiya had already started fighting!","was a peak Level 9 Spiritual Overlord.","Mr. Sakiya was at the initial stage of a Spiritual Saint, but he was severely injured.","Before Feng Wu could react, the two people were already fighting in midair.","The Sacred Imperial Spider watched the battle for a while and grew anxious. It said to Feng Wu, “Although Elder Dongfang isn’t injured, there’s a world of difference between a peak Level 9 Spiritual Overlord and an early-stage Spiritual Saint. Your elder will definitely lose.”","That was what Feng Wu thought.","Hence, she became anxious.","It had been so many days; hadn’t Jun Linyuan come out of seclusion yet?","Feng Wu didn’t place her hopes on the general, because the general, Mr. Lu, Mr. Xu and Elder Helian had gone to fight the four Dongsang masters, so they couldn’t spare any time.","Feng Wu had wondered if Elder Dongfang was up to something, but when she saw how badly Mr. Sakiya injured Elder Dongfang and the blood she vomited, Feng Wu finally believed her.","Thump!","was sent flying by Mr. Sakiya.","She crashed into a huge tree with a bang.","The tree that was thick enough for five people to wrap their arms around was crushed, but Elder Dongfang kept flying backward!","She only stopped after crushing over ten big trees.","Mr. Sakiya was about to step forward when Feng Wu stared at him coldly. “Mr. Sakiya, I used to respect you, but I despise you for what you’ve done!”","She then ran toward Elder Dongfang."]},{"number":3340,"title":"Chapter 3340 Jun Linyuan, Help Your Girl","paragraphs":["3340 Jun Linyuan, Help Your Girl","Feng Wu stuffed a Semi-Divine Golden Crow Pill into Elder Dongfang’s mouth and fed her the all-purpose transformation liquid.","Before Elder Dongfang could react, she swallowed something that others couldn’t even dream of.","Elder Dongfang only felt a chill in her abdomen. The burning sensation in her throat was also suppressed.","“What did you feed me?” Elder Dongfang forced the blood back down and glared at Feng Wu!","!!","Feng Wu said, “A Semi-Divine Golden Crow Pill.”","Elder Dongfang frowned. “What else?!”","Feng Wu said, “All-purpose transformation liquid.”","Elder Dongfang frowned even more. Glaring at Feng Wu, she pushed the latter away. “I don’t need your fake kindness!”","Poor Feng Wu. She was pushed to the ground by Elder Dongfang.","Meanwhile, Elder Dongfang had already risen to her feet. Staring at Feng Wu, she snorted. “You can’t please me like that. I’ll settle the score with you when we get back!”","With that, Elder Dongfang staggered toward Mr. Sakiya!","Feng Wu looked at Elder Dongfang in resignation.","What a stubborn but soft-hearted old lady!","By then, more and more people came from Mr. Sakiya’s side.","To Feng Wu’s horror, the deputy general manager was here!","Bu Jingyu, Mo Lan and some people she had met before were all here.","Even Night Owl was here.","That shocked Feng Wu.","What was the crown prince, Night Owl, doing here?","Half of Night Owl’s head was wrapped in white gauze. He was wearing a hat, which covered the wound a little.","He was pushed over in a wheelchair.","Feng Wu could sense an indescribable ferocity in Night Owl’s eyes.","Her stomach lurched. Did Night Owl notice something?","“She...”","Night Owl couldn’t finish his sentence. Pointing at Feng Wu, he glared at her!","Bu Jingyu broke out in a cold sweat!","Oh my god! He won’t recognize Feng Wu, will he? If he does, I’ll be incriminated.","“Her!” Night Owl pointed at Feng Wu.","Elder Dongfang stood in front of Feng Wu as if she could hold off ten thousand enemies by herself!","“Feng Wu is from the Junwu Empire, and she’s under the empire’s protection!","“You want to take her away without any evidence? Over my dead body!”","Night Owl couldn’t speak or move, but he was trembling as he stared at Feng Wu.","The deputy general manager beside him stood up and stared at Elder Dongfang. “Then go to hell!”","After saying that, the deputy general manager pounced on Elder Dongfang like an eagle!","It was so intimidating!","Elder Dongfang’s face instantly turned pale!","She couldn’t withstand it!","This time, she was really going to die.","Feng Wu turned around and shouted, “Jun Linyuan, if you don’t show up, your girl will be beaten to death!”","To be honest, she was just scaring her enemies.","The deputy general manager really slowed down a little when he heard that.","Night Owl, Mr. Sakiya and the others all looked behind Feng Wu.","Elder Dongfang grabbed Feng Wu and threw her in the other direction. “Run!”","Jun Linyuan was in seclusion, so she knew Feng Wu was trying to confuse their enemies.","The girl should take this chance and run!","Feng Wu was thrown backward.","“I’m here.”","Everybody heard a clear voice.","Feng Wu, on the other hand, was wrapped in a pair of strong arms."]},{"number":3341,"title":"Chapter 3341 Battle","paragraphs":["3341 Battle","Feng Wu met a pair of bright eyes.","She recalled what she said earlier.","“Jun Linyuan, if you don’t show up, your girl will be beaten to death!”","Feng Wu was astonished!","!!","She had only been using Jun Linyuan’s name to intimidate her opponent just now. How was she supposed to know Jun Linyuan would respond to her call?","Why was he here?! Feng Wu was so embarrassed that she wanted to dig a hole and hide in it.","But in this situation, she couldn’t run away.","How awkward...","Feng Wu cleared her throat and pretended that she hadn’t said anything. “What are you doing here?”","Jun Linyuan stared at Feng Wu with brooding eyes.","Realizing that she had wrapped her arms around Jun Linyuan’s neck, Feng Wu struggled to get off.","Meanwhile, all hell had broken loose.","Feng and the deputy general manager were fighting.","Elder Dongfang was no match for the deputy general manager. Right now, she was holding onto a tree and vomiting blood.","Feng Wu hurried over and gave Elder Dongfang a hand.","Elder Dongfang didn’t like Feng Wu. When she saw how close Feng Wu was to Jun Linyuan, Elder Dongfang felt bad for Dongfang Ziyun, so she glared at Feng Wu when the latter came over.","Feng Wu said arrogantly, “Don’t act like I’m trying to please you. If you hadn’t bought me some time, I wouldn’t have done this.”","After that, Feng Wu took out a Semi-Divine solution and injected Elder Dongfang with it.","The effect of the medicinal liquid was much faster than that of medicinal pills.","Elder Dongfang had already taken a Semi-Divine Golden Crow Pill and the all-purpose transformation liquid. Now that Jun Linyuan was here, she seemed to have found her support. She was relieved of the burden and sat down cross-legged under the tree to cultivate.","Feng Wu looked at Elder Dongfang helplessly.","Jun Linyuan and the steward were the only two Spiritual Saints here, and the other side was obviously stronger. Why was Elder Dongfang so relaxed? Did she think everything would be fine with Jun Linyuan around?","Right now, Jun Linyuan didn’t do anything. With his sword on his back, he stared into the distance, and an intangible kingly aura emanated from him. Not many people could withstand that pressure.","Feng Wu looked at Jun Linyuan, who stood out from the crowd, and then at Night Owl, who was covered in gauze. She didn’t know what to say.","She wanted to ask Night Owl if he regretted blowing up Jun Linyuan.","Feng Wu had no idea Feng was so capable!","He was actually a Spiritual Saint!","Against the deputy general manager, he was calm and at ease!","Thump!","Feng threw a punch, and the deputy general manager fell to the ground. He tried to stop himself, but his feet kept sliding backward!","He slid for dozens of meters before stopping.","Feng Wu noticed that the deputy general manager looked like he was going to vomit blood, but he held it in!","It was obvious that Feng was much more capable than the deputy general manager.","Feng Wu praised him right away. “Our crown prince is much more powerful than theirs, and Feng is much more powerful than... theirs!”","Feng Wu was going to say “deputy general manager,” but she then remembered if she hadn’t been to Sun Castle before, she wouldn’t have known that man’s job. Hence, she changed her words.","Feng smiled at Feng Wu.","Night Owl’s face was already red with anger.","Of course he knew Feng Wu had said that on purpose."]},{"number":3342,"title":"Chapter 3342 Brother Jun","paragraphs":["3342 Brother Jun","Night Owl’s face was already red with anger.","Of course, he knew Feng Wu had said that on purpose.","Before he could say anything, Yu Ming bellowed, “Feng Wu, how dare you!”","Feng Wu felt safe with Jun Linyuan around.","!!","She darted a look at Yu Ming, then turned around and tugged at Jun Linyuan’s sleeve.","“Your Royal Highness, he’s so mean to me!” little Feng Wu complained.","So what if she wasn’t a Spiritual Saint? She had a Spiritual Saint behind her.","“Your Royal Highness?” Jun Linyuan frowned.","Feng Wu wondered how else she should address him. Bro?","He would probably smack her.","“Brother Jun!” Feng Wu played along because she wanted to annoy her enemies.","“Brother Jun, they’re bullying me!” Feng Wu was indeed a weakling in front of these big shots.","But her greatest strength was her flexibility.","She didn’t mind asking for help or admitting her weakness.","Now that her patron was here, she couldn’t wait to complain about her mistreatment.","The people of the Dongsang Kingdom were astonished.","Bu Jingyu rubbed his eyes and thought, She’s tugging at a man’s sleeve in front of so many people. Isn’t she ashamed?","The others around him thought the same.","Fine. She’s young and probably can’t help showing off her patron, but Jun Linyuan won’t buy it, will he? He’s not someone who falls for such tricks!","Look at Jun Linyuan’s big frown!","That was what Night Owl and Mr. Sakiya thought.","All the other Dongsangers felt the same way.","They were all waiting for Jun Linyuan to wave his hand and smack Feng Wu away.","Not far away, Elder Dongfang, who was sitting under a tree, saw those people’s expectant gazes...","She looked disdainfully at them as she recovered from her injuries.","They’ll be disappointed. Jun Linyuan must be thrilled!","If he didn’t like Feng Wu, he would have sent her flying a long time ago, just as he had done to Dongfang Ziyun.","Fearing that her cultivation would go awry, Elder Dongfang closed her eyes. Out of sight, out of mind.","As expected...","Jun Linyuan frowned, but he didn’t push Feng Wu away. He only said calmly, “And?”","Feng Wu tugged at Jun Linyuan’s sleeve. “Brother Jun, they said I stole 100 fighter jets from the Dongsang Kingdom! 100!”","Jun Linyuan lowered his eyes. “Impressive.”","Feng Wu said, “That’s right. Everyone in the Dongsang Kingdom is useless. With so many experts guarding the fighter jets, I, a Level 6 Spiritual King, can steal 100 of them.”","Everyone on Feng Wu’s side laughed.","The people from the Dongsang Kingdom looked embarrassed.","“Come out now.”","Feng Wu heard what Jun Linyuan said and looked up, wondering to whom Jun Linyuan was talking.","She followed Jun Linyuan’s gaze and found the person.","It was Yu Ming.","Staring into Jun Linyuan’s dark eyes, Yu Ming felt a chill run down his spine!","He was indeed very capable in front of ordinary people, but compared to Jun Linyuan...","Yu Ming’s heart trembled. He looked at his master for help.","Mr. Sakiya’s expression was extremely ugly!","Last time, Jun Linyuan had injured him here.","When Mr. Sakiya stared at Jun Linyuan, he suddenly realized the latter was different from before."]},{"number":3343,"title":"Chapter 3343 Dragon Phoenix Blood","paragraphs":["3343 Dragon Phoenix Blood","Mr. Sakiya frowned. Something seemed to have happened to Jun Linyuan.","It was a change he didn’t want to see.","Yu Ming said, “Master...” He was flustered.","Mr. Sakiya turned to Jun Linyuan and said slowly, “Your Royal Highness, why do you have to make things difficult for my disciple?”","!!","Jun Linyuan didn’t like to talk, and he usually started fighting right away.","Hence, it was Feng Wu who said, “You can slander me, so why can’t Brother Jun back me up?","“Right?” Feng Wu gave Jun Linyuan a smug look.","She thought, We’re facing the same enemy now. You better not humiliate me.","Jun Linyuan decided he would deal with Feng Wu when they returned to the fortress. Why did she have to run around when he was in seclusion?","His attention landed on Mr. Sakiya again.","Without another word, Jun Linyuan said, “Your turn.”","Mr. Sakiya stiffened.","He was stroking his beard and almost pulled it off when he heard those words.","Mr. Sakiya couldn’t beat a seriously injured Jun Linyuan even when he was at his peak, let alone now.","He didn’t stand a chance.","The deputy general manager couldn’t beat Feng, so if they started a battle here, the Dongsang Kingdom would definitely lose!","Mr. Sakiya subconsciously looked at Night Owl.","The crown prince ripped off the gauze, revealing his face, and looked Jun Linyuan in the eye. “Bring it on!”","Jun Linyuan looked at Night Owl in bewilderment. “What happened to your face?”","The question made Night Owl angrier.","Sensitive and irritable, he felt Jun Linyuan was mocking him.","“Were you injured as badly as this last time?","“You can’t withstand many explosions, can you?","“Why did you try to blow me up, then?” Jun Linyuan asked three questions in a row.","“Were you trying to kill yourself?”","Pffft!","Every time Jun Linyuan asked a question, Night Owl felt like he was being stabbed in the heart. It hurt!","“Why did you try to provoke me?” Jun Linyuan was perplexed.","Night Owl attacked Nest as soon as he became a Spiritual Saint. An injured Jun Linyuan showed up, and Night Owl chose to injure Jun Linyuan further by blowing them up together. However, Jun Linyuan was unharmed now, while Night Owl was still in a miserable state.","“Why did you provoke me?","“Where did you find the courage?”","Jun Linyuan asked the questions in all seriousness, which made Night Owl’s face burn.","How did it feel to be slapped in public?","It was how Night Owl felt now.","He spat out a mouthful of blood.","Was he too weak to be Jun Linyuan’s opponent now?","“Boss Jun, why did you run so fast?!”","Just then, Feng Xun and Xuan Yi arrived, and Feng Xun cried out when he saw Jun Linyuan. “OMG! Boss Jun, your Dragon Phoenix Blood! You’ve activated your Dragon Phoenix Blood!”","Feng Xun seldom shouted in public, but he couldn’t help it now.","The Dragon Phoenix Blood?","All eyes were on Jun Linyuan.","The crown prince stood there with his hands behind his back, his sleeves billowing in the wind. He looked indescribably handsome!","Night Owl was dumbfounded.","Mr. Sakiya had a bitter taste in his mouth, and he couldn’t even smile.","The deputy general manager was shocked. His expression was ugly and extremely vigilant!","Elder Dongfang forgot about her cultivation as her eyes opened wide.","...","Everybody stared at Jun Linyuan.","The Dragon Phoenix Blood..."]},{"number":3344,"title":"Chapter 3344 Don’t Exaggerate","paragraphs":["3344 Don’t Exaggerate","Jun Linyuan was already so talented, and with the Dragon Phoenix Blood...","The Dongsang Kingdom’s future...","With this in mind, Mr. Sakiya and the deputy general manager looked at each other as their pupils contracted.","They looked at Night Owl in unison and saw his hands shaking in his sleeves.","Was he scared too?","Mr. Sakiya felt even more despair.","No one made a sound.","Clasping his hands behind his back, Jun Linyuan stood there proudly, looking straight ahead with his sharp eyes. He looked so cold and distant that no one dared to approach him.","However, no one knew he kept stealing glances at someone from the corner of his eye.","When Jun Linyuan saw how amazed Feng Wu was, he was even more pleased.","“Yes,” he replied to Feng Xun in an indifferent tone.","Feng Xun was so thrilled that he nearly cried. “Boss Jun, you’re a genius! That’s the Dragon Phoenix Blood! According to ancient scriptures, only one person in history has ever had it!”","Mr. Sakiya felt even more bitter.","Night Owl couldn’t believe his ears.","Jun Linyuan cleared his throat as if he didn’t care about it at all.","However, if that really were the case, why would he glance at Feng Wu all the time? Feng Xun was perplexed.","Feng Wu was really amazed.","She didn’t expect Jun Linyuan to actually activate the Dragon Phoenix Blood. That was really...","Her beautiful master gave her the Divine Phoenix Blood, but Jun Linyuan had activated his bloodline himself. Feng Wu had to admit she wasn’t as good as him in that aspect.","She was about to praise Jun Linyuan, when she saw the look on Night Owl’s face. He looked as if he had been struck by lightning. Feng Wu immediately had an idea.","Feng Wu tugged at Jun Linyuan’s sleeve and said with sparkling eyes, “Oh my god, Jun... Brother Jun, you’re so awesome! You’re the best! You’re the smartest, most handsome, elegant, and dignified man in the world... You’re amazing! All other teenagers are useless in front of you, including that Night Owl!”","Feng Wu’s eyes were filled with admiration, making Jun Linyuan believe he really was the most impressive, awesome person in the world.","Holy crap!","The crown prince was overjoyed when he heard Feng Wu’s compliments.","His expression became even more serious, but his earlobes still turned a little red.","The crown prince darted a look at Feng Wu and frowned. “Don’t exaggerate.”","Feng Wu could tell Jun Linyuan was enjoying it. His face was grim, but he was smiling a little. What a vain crown prince! Feng Wu was elated. She had found the crown prince’s weakness.","Seeing how happy Feng Wu was, Jun Linyuan sighed in resignation.","Feng Wu wasn’t done yet.","“Dragon Phoenix Blood! That’s Dragon Phoenix Blood! Night Owl, what kind of blood do you have? How does it compare with Jun Linyuan’s Dragon Phoenix Blood?” Feng Wu said that on purpose!","She wanted to show off so much that Night Owl was scared.","Night Owl had always regarded Jun Linyuan as his greatest enemy and only opponent. That was why he still hadn’t recovered from the shock.","However, Feng Wu provoked him on purpose.","Feng Wu asked Jun Linyuan, “How did you activate the Dragon Phoenix Blood? Didn’t Night Owl try to blow you up? How did you recover? Did your bloodline activate automatically?”"]},{"number":3345,"title":"Chapter 3345 Did I Let You Go?","paragraphs":["3345 Did I Let You Go?","Even Feng Xun was worried for Feng Wu.","Little Feng Wu, don’t you think you’re exaggerating? It’s obvious that you’re putting on an act. Boss Jun isn’t an idiot! He’s a noble man, and won’t fall for such a thing. He’ll even get mad at you!","Night Owl thought so too.","Having been Jun Linyuan’s enemy for so long, he was aware of Jun Linyuan’s noble character.","However, they guessed wrong again!","Jun Linyuan said proudly, “I know.”","He actually said he knew...","Night Owl spat out another mouthful of blood!","Looking at Night Owl, who was vomiting blood non-stop, Mr. Sakiya knew the Dongsang Kingdom had suffered heavy losses today. If they stayed any longer, the losses would be even greater.","Mr. Sakiya cupped his fists at Jun Linyuan. “Goodbye!”","With that, Mr. Sakiya pushed Night Owl’s wheelchair and was about to leave.","The others were so intimidated by Jun Linyuan that they all wanted to run away.","“Did I let you go?”","Just those words carried the domineering aura of an emperor who looked down on the world!","Mr. Sakiya paused and turned to look at Jun Linyuan. “Your Royal Highness, don’t forget the promise.”","The promise?","Feng Wu didn’t know what that meant, but she could see how everyone else’s expressions changed.","Feng Xun and Xuan Yi didn’t understand what it meant either.","However, Elder Dongfang’s eyes were filled with anger and humiliation!","Jun Linyuan felt the same way.","He stared at Mr. Sakiya with deep eyes that were as cold as knives.","Mr. Sakiya nodded at Jun Linyuan and turned to leave.","Boom!","Before Mr. Sakiya could react, he realized that beside him, Yu Ming had exploded.","Yu Ming was Mr. Sakiya’s second disciple!","He was a Spiritual Overlord!","However, Jun Linyuan flicked his finger, and Yu Ming exploded on the spot.","When he exploded, flesh and blood splattered, staining the people around him.","Especially Night Owl...","That seemed to be the purpose of the explosion.","He was hit by a blood clot on his head, and his face was covered in blood... When had Night Owl ever suffered such humiliation?","“Jun Linyuan! Screw you!” Night Owl stood up angrily and was ready to fight.","Jun Linyuan nodded. “Let’s fight.”","The promise mentioned earlier was a restriction on Spiritual Saints.","The Spiritual Saints of the Junwu Empire weren’t allowed to initiate a battle with the Spiritual Saints of the Dongsang Kingdom.","This was the unequal treaty that Feng Xiangnan had signed with Xue Zhibei to protect the people of Nest when the fighter jets bombarded the fortress.","Mr. Sakiya held down the enraged Night Owl. His expression was serious, and his tone was cold. “You Royal Highness, calm down.”","Night Owl also wanted to calm down, but how could he?!","“Jun Linyuan, you’re going too far!” Night Owl smashed the wheelchair to pieces!","Although he relied on the powerful physique of a Spiritual Saint to wake up, without the Immortal Spiritual Fruit to treat him, his cultivation recovery would be very slow.","Jun Linyuan smiled a little.","That was the coldest sneer that Feng Wu had ever seen on his face.","“Night Owl, we’re just getting started.” Jun Linyuan smirked.","He hadn’t even started to wash away the humiliation that the Dongsang Kingdom had inflicted on the Junwu Empire.","Night Owl also knew things weren’t looking good for him.","A man should know when to yield and when to stand tall. He should lay low now.","But...","He was the ruthless crown prince after all. He couldn’t stand it.","“Jun Linyuan, what are you doing here? Don’t you know the three Spiritual Saints of your fortress are about to die?”"]},{"number":3346,"title":"Chapter 3346 Invincible Jun Linyuan (1)","paragraphs":["3346 Invincible Jun Linyuan (1)","“Jun Linyuan, what are you doing here? Don’t you know the three Spiritual Saints of your fortress are about to die?”","As soon as Night Owl said that, everyone looked at him!","Feng Wu frowned. “Night Owl, what do you mean?”","Night Owl sneered and didn’t say anything.","!!","Feng Wu almost blurted out, “You’ve been unconscious all this time. How do you know what the great general is doing?”","However, she suddenly realized if she said that, Mr. Sakiya and the others would know that she had gone to Sun Castle.","She reminded herself to be careful with her words.","At that moment, Mr. Sakiya picked up the conversation.","Staring at Jun Linyuan, he said in a serious tone, “That’s right. They’re in the final stage of the battle.”","Jun Linyuan’s expression turned cold, and a vicious look appeared on his face!","Mr. Sakiya said, “Our great general, Xue Zhibei, and three guardian elders are all Spiritual Saints. They’re fighting your Spiritual Saints. The battle is probably coming to an end.”","Four Spiritual Saints?","Elder Dongfang snapped at Jun Linyuan, “Elder Helian has reached the Spiritual Saint stage.”","Jun Linyuan realized Feng Xiangnan, Mr. Lu, Mr. Xu, and Elder Helian were the four Spiritual Saints on their side.","The first three were fine, but Elder Helian had just broken through. How could he deal with the Dongsang Kingdom’s long-standing Spiritual Saints?","He would definitely lose!","If Elder Helian was defeated, the battle would become a four versus three, and the Spiritual Saints on the Junwu Empire’s side would immediately fall into danger!","There weren’t many Spiritual Saints in the empire.","Therefore, every Spiritual Saint was extremely precious!","Mr. Sakiya stared at Jun Linyuan. “Do you still have time to come after us?”","Jun Linyuan closed his eyes. No one knew what he was doing.","However, the spiritual essence which emanated from his body made everyone tremble.","Even Feng Wu was affected.","It was as if he was the ruler of the world!","She looked up and saw Jun Linyuan’s handsome face.","He stood there proudly, looking indescribably noble and handsome.","He was strong, handsome and unparalleled. Feng Wu was starting to believe that he could make all the girls in the world fall head over heels for him.","Right at that moment...","Suddenly!","Jun Linyuan reached out!","It was as if the world was under his control!","What was he doing?","Everyone looked at him in surprise.","Mr. Sakiya’s pupils suddenly contracted as his facial muscles twitched violently.","He had a very bad feeling.","Jun Linyuan wasn’t going to break the barrier all by himself, was he?","Mr. Sakiya knew very well that there was a barrier in space.","It was impossible for the eight Spiritual Saints to fight on the ground since the consequences of their battle would be too terrifying.","Landslides and avalanches, upended mountains and rivers... The impact on the human environment would be too intense, and innocent people could be injured at any time.","Therefore, a spatial barrier would be set up for a battle of their level.","Only Spiritual Saints with high cultivation levels could tear apart the barrier with their bare hands.","As far as Mr. Sakiya knew, Xue Zhibei was the only one who could do it in the Dongsang Kingdom.","Jun Linyuan...","Could he have advanced to that level?!","This was something Mr. Sakiya didn’t want to see happen!"]},{"number":3347,"title":"Chapter 3347 Invincible Jun Linyuan (2)","paragraphs":["3347 Invincible Jun Linyuan (2)","This was also what Night Owl didn’t want to see.","If that was the case, the gap between Jun Linyuan and Night Owl couldn’t be bridged in a short time.","What made Mr. Sakiya despair was that it really happened!","Jun Linyuan reached out, and a black vortex spread out from his palm.","This power was extremely terrifying!","The space around them cracked like a spider web.","Everyone’s expressions changed!","Could he break through the space by himself?!","The capability...","The power...","Mr. Sakiya gasped.","He had always been unperturbed by anything, but his face had turned pale!","Night Owl was so angry that he gripped the armrests of the wheelchair so tightly that he almost broke them.","The web-like space soon showed signs of collapse.","“Break!”","At Jun Linyuan’s command, the space shattered like glass!","A black hole appeared in front of him.","No one could believe their eyes.","To most people here, the subspace was a legendary thing. They had never seen it in their lives until now.","Fierce astral winds swept out from the black subspace!","Everyone felt they would freeze to death.","“It must be at least -100 degrees Celsius,” Feng Wu thought to herself.","The extreme cold wasn’t the only thing that could hurt them.","What flowed out of the dark subspace wasn’t just cold air, but also steel-like wind blades!","The wind blades shot out like arrows from a crossbow. Every arrow contained thick killing intent!","These arrows were useless against Spiritual Saints because their physical defenses were very strong. They simply landed on their bodies like snowflakes.","However, these arrows were a nightmare to cultivators below the Spiritual Saint stage!","Whoosh!","Countless arrows rained down on Feng Wu, but Jun Linyuan was already in front of her.","The wind blades couldn’t hurt Feng Wu at all.","On the Dongsang Kingdom’s side, Mr. Sakiya and the deputy general manager were in a fluster. This was because most of the arrows were aimed at them.","Feng Wu wondered if Jun Linyuan had calculated the exact angle when he tore open the space with his bare hands.","“Back off!” Gripping Sky Destroyer behind him, Jun Linyuan shouted at everyone!","The people of the Junwu Empire respected him as if he were a god, so they all stepped back without hesitation.","Feng Wu backed away as well.","They had just retreated a few hundred steps when something happened.","A golden light flashed across the sky.","A person rushed out first!","“You want to run? Die!” Feng Wu saw an incomparably powerful man raise his axe as he gave an angry roar!","Feng Wu was surprised.","He was clearly from the Dongsang Kingdom.","And the person he was threatening was Elder Helian!","Therefore, that person was the Dongsang Kingdom’s guardian elder that Mr. Sakiya had mentioned!","Instantly, Feng Wu understood Jun Linyuan’s plan.","When Mr. Sakiya said that the masters of both sides were fighting, Jun Linyuan immediately guessed that they were fighting in the dark subspace.","When Mr. Sakiya said that Dongsang Kingdom had the upper hand, Jun Linyuan immediately thought of a way to help his people get out of that space.","He didn’t know where they were, but once he broke through the space, the people inside would immediately know!","Because!","It was dark inside, but it was bright outside!"]},{"number":3348,"title":"Chapter 3348 Invincible Jun Linyuan (3)","paragraphs":["3348 Invincible Jun Linyuan (3)","A ray of light appeared in the darkness. Unless one was blind, it was impossible for them not to notice.","That was why Jun Linyuan had torn open the dark subspace. He wanted the light to shine inside and let the people know there was a way out so that they could escape.","It was brilliant!","Feng Wu looked at the crown prince in admiration. How was he so smart?","The most amazing thing was that this wasn’t a plan that had been thought up over a long period of time. He came up with that idea in an instant!","Jun Linyuan made his move.","“Elder Jiang Yin!” Mr. Sakiya’s eyes lit up when he saw that man!","Elder Jiang Yin was a Spiritual Saint who had been famous for a long time. His strength was extraordinary. He was more than enough to deal with Elder Helian, who had just advanced to the Spiritual Saint stage!","However, if Jun Linyuan took action...","Mr. Sakiya wanted to see how strong Jun Linyuan was with the Dragon Phoenix Blood!","He remembered it had only been a couple of years since Jun Linyuan became a Spiritual Saint. He should be at the initial stage.","Boom!","Jun Linyuan flew into the air!","He didn’t even pull out Sky Destroyer from his back. Instead, he blocked the strike with his fist!","How powerful!","Terrifying spiritual essence filled the air.","Elder Jiang Yin came down from the sky while Jun Linyuan went up from the ground. Elder Jiang Yin had the upper hand.","When Elder Jiang Yin saw Jun Linyuan, he frowned. “You brat! I’ll destroy you!”","A streak of sword energy tore through the sky!","The sword energy had been aimed at Elder Helian, but now, it was aimed at Jun Linyuan!","However, never in his wildest dreams could Elder Jiang Yin have imagined that Jun Linyuan would be right in front of him!","Before Elder Jiang Yin could react, Jun Linyuan punched the sword with his left fist!","Thump!","The sword fell from the sky to the ground.","Elder Jiang Yin cursed Jun Linyuan. “You!”","However, before Elder Jiang Yin could finish, Jun Linyuan clenched his right fist and punched Elder Jiang Yin in the face!","One shouldn’t hit people in the face, especially when the one getting hit was a Spiritual Saint.","However, Jun Linyuan didn’t hold back at all!","Boom!","Elder Jiang Yin felt the impact and wanted to dodge, but he was shocked to discover that he was far slower than his opponent!","He couldn’t dodge it!","Elder Jiang Yin’s face was punched, and his Spiritual Saint defense barrier cracked like a spider web. In the end, Jun Linyuan’s fist landed on the elder’s face!","A large part of Elder Jiang Yin’s face caved in!","He could no longer hold back and was sent flying!","To everyone else, all of this happened in a second!","Therefore, they saw Jun Linyuan disarm Elder Jiang Yin’s weapon with one punch and send him flying with a second punch!","“Elder Jiang Yin!”","Mo Lan immediately rushed forward to examine him.","However, it was only a punch, after all. Elder Jiang Yin’s injuries weren’t too serious.","Pushing Mo Lan away, he charged at Jun Linyuan like a cheetah!","“Brat, you’re dead!” Elder Jiang Yin was unafraid of death!","Elder Jiang Yin’s punch contained all the strength he had accumulated over the years!","Jun Linyuan didn’t move.","As Elder Jiang Yin rushed toward him in wrath, Jun Linyuan placed his right hand behind his back and clenched his left hand into a fist!","“Go!”","Their fists met.","Their power clashed.","At the impact...","Light condensed!","Strong winds howled!","An explosion broke through the clouds!","Only then did Elder Jiang Yin realize how terrifying Jun Linyuan was!"]},{"number":3349,"title":"Chapter 3349 invincible Jun Linyuan (4)","paragraphs":["3349 invincible Jun Linyuan (4)","Only then did Elder Jiang Yin realize how terrifying Jun Linyuan was!","He finally realized how much of a gap there was between him and Jun Linyuan!","Jun Linyuan stood there with one hand behind his back and only threw one punch.","After that punch, he still stood in place, his legs not moving at all!","!!","As for Elder Jiang Yin, he was sent flying by Jun Linyuan’s fist again!","This time, Jun Linyuan didn’t hold back. He used even more force than before, so Elder Jiang Yin flew far, far away...","No one knew how far he flew.","Everyone watched helplessly as Elder Jiang Yin turned into a smaller and smaller black dot in the air and finally disappeared.","Everyone was speechless.","Mr. Sakiya had a bitter taste in his mouth as he was rendered speechless.","Night Owl was really shocked. Today had been one astonishment after another for him.","He panicked.","Feng Wu observed Jun Linyuan after stuffing some medicine in Elder Helian’s mouth.","How was he so awesome?","She couldn’t imagine anyone else like that!","Feng Wu’s eyes sparkled.","After Jiang Yin was sent flying, Feng Wu rushed to Jun Linyuan’s side and grabbed his sleeve. She looked up with twinkling eyes. “Brother Jun, you’re awesome! I’m so proud of you!”","She was quite genuine this time, although she was still exaggerating a little.","The exaggeration was to annoy Night Owl.","She thought, “I hope Night Owl loses his mind.”","Jun Linyuan appreciated what Feng Wu said, but he was a shy teenager, so he always kept a straight face.","“Go back to the fortress!”","Jun Linyuan pushed Feng Wu behind him. “Stay as far away as you can. Go!”","Jun Linyuan’s eyes were still fixed on the black hole. He looked like a hunter catching fish in winter, waiting for the fish to swim out of the hole in the ice!","“No problem!”","Feng Wu didn’t wait for him to say anything else. She kept running.","As a mere Level 6 Spiritual King, she didn’t dare participate in such a battle. Otherwise, she would lose her life if a shockwave hit her!","Indeed, in the next second!","Boom!","People began to rush out of the black hole.","The first to rush out was Mr. Xu and the Left Guardian Elder.","The second to rush out was Mr. Lu and the Right Guardian Elder.","The last to rush out was the general of the Junwu Empire, Feng Xiangnan, and the great general of the Dongsang Empire, Xue Zhibei.","Feng Wu’s chest tightened, and she grew nervous.","Elder Helian had obviously lost the battle against Elder Jiang Yin.","Elder Helian was covered in injuries and dripping with blood. A few of his injuries were especially serious, and they wouldn’t stop bleeding.","And his right arm...","Only then did Feng Wu notice that his right arm was severed at the elbow!","“Elder Helian, where’s your arm? Where’s your right arm?!” Feng Wu asked anxiously.","If she could find the arm, she would be able to sew it back on.","However, Elder Helian smiled bitterly. “Where’s the arm? It’s gone. I’m lucky to be alive.”","Elder Helian looked worried. He said to Feng Wu in a hurry, “Go back! Go back now!”","Feng Wu said, “Don’t worry. Jun Linyuan is here.”","However..."]},{"number":3350,"title":"Chapter 3350 Jun Linyuan’s Strength (1)","paragraphs":["3350 Jun Linyuan’s Strength (1)","The first to rush out was Mr. Xu and the Left Guardian Elder.","The second to rush out was Mr. Lu and the Right Guardian Elder.","The last to rush out was the general of the Junwu Empire, Feng Xiangnan, and the great general of the Dongsang Empire, Xue Zhibei.","After the three pairs came out, they immediately started fighting without any hesitation!","Jun Linyuan sealed the space with a wave of his hand.","Feng Wu, Feng Xun, and the others were outside a barrier, but Mr. Sakiya and Night Owl were inside.","One had to wonder if Jun Linyuan had done it on purpose.","It was a transparent barrier. Although Feng Wu and the others were outside, they could still see what was going on inside.","It was obvious Mr. Xu was weaker than the Left Guardian Elder. Mr. Xu was in a defensive state while his opponent attacked.","Mr. Xu could still hold on, so Jun Linyuan only glanced at him.","Mr. Lu was seriously injured and was vomiting blood from time to time.","Jun Linyuan knew very well that Mr. Lu wouldn’t last long.","Therefore, he instantly went forward!","As soon as Jun Linyuan stepped forward to help Mr. Lu, Mr. Sakiya followed suit.","The four Spiritual Saints of the Dongsang Kingdom and the four Spiritual Saints of the Junwu Empire were evenly matched.","Was that really the case?","General Feng, who was struggling, didn’t think so.","He had a bad feeling.","He felt the Junwu Empire was going to be destroyed this time.","Xue Zhibei had the same opinion. “Feng Xiangnan, do it yourself.”","General Feng sneered. “Do you think you can win?!”","Xue Zhibei’s expression was cold and solemn. He said matter-of-factly, “You’re already in a situation where you’re bound to lose. Save your last bit of dignity.”","General Feng almost fainted from anger. “Don’t even think about it!”","He was already covered in injuries.","This was especially true for his abdomen. A long blade had slashed across it, leaving a huge open wound. It was a shocking sight.","This time, Xue Zhibei didn’t hold back. He grabbed at General Feng’s abdomen with his bare hand!","Once Feng Xiangnan was injured in the same spot again, the consequences would be unimaginable!","After being injured time and time again, General Feng was already at the end of his rope!","Xue Zhibei hoped to end the battle quickly, so this time, he attacked with all his might!","Xue Zhibei stared at General Feng’s wound with a cold glint in his eyes.","After so many years, his opponent was finally going to fall this time.","There was hesitation, reluctance, and regret in his eyes, but mostly, he was relieved.","But just as his hand was about to touch General Feng’s wound, a sword struck out from the side.","Holding Sky Destroyer in his hand, Jun Linyuan wrapped his energy around General Feng.","Feng Wu’s heart raced!","Xue Zhibei was a very powerful cultivator.","Was Jun Linyuan a match for him now?","Feng Wu wasn’t the only one who wanted to know. Night Owl was also wondering about the same thing.","Night Owl stared at Jun Linyuan with bloodthirsty eyes!","He grabbed the armrests of his wheelchair.","If that wheelchair weren’t made of a special material, it would have been torn apart!","“No...","“Jun Linyuan definitely isn’t strong enough to fight Xue Zhibei!”","Night Owl shouted and prayed in his head!","Everyone stared at Jun Linyuan’s sword.","Spiritual essence howled in the center as Sky Destroyer spun.","Feng Xiangnan was forced to take a few steps back while Xue Zhibei was also forced to take a few steps back!"]},{"number":3351,"title":"Chapter 3351 Jun Linyuan’s Strength (2)","paragraphs":["3351 Jun Linyuan’s Strength (2)","Jun Linyuan had single-handedly separated the most powerful cultivators of Nest and Sun Castle.","He was so powerful!","Xue Zhibei stared at Jun Linyuan in surprise.","“Jun Linyuan, you —”","Feng Xiangnan also stared at Jun Linyuan. “You Royal Highness...”","Jun Linyuan nodded at Feng Xiangnan. “Thank you for your hard work, General Feng. I’ll take it from here.”","How would General Feng dare to believe that?","Their opponent was Xue Zhibei!","General Feng said, “Your Royal Highness, get out of here. It’s too dangerous!”","Jun Linyuan didn’t say another word to General Feng. Instead, he stared at Xue Zhibei. “Bring it on!”","A cold glint flashed in Xue Zhibei’s eyes.","Given how smart he was, he immediately noticed the change in Jun Linyuan.","The last time he met Jun Linyuan, the latter didn’t exude such a powerful aura. This time, although Jun Linyuan wasn’t as powerful as Xue Zhibei, he still exuded an air of authority that intimidated even the latter.","“Jun Linyuan activated his Dragon Phoenix Blood,” Mr. Sakiya told Xue Zhibei.","Xue Zhibei stared at Jun Linyuan with a cold glint in his eyes.","“Dragon Phoenix Blood?” Xue Zhibei took a deep breath.","“You have Dragon Phoenix Blood inside you? Looks like I underestimated you.” Xue Zhibei quickly calmed down. “Dragon Phoenix Blood is indeed rare, but it’s just been activated. Shouldn’t you protect it?”","When General Feng saw how calm Xue Zhibei was, a tinge of anxiety appeared in his eyes.","They shouldn’t have revealed that fact!","From what he knew of Xue Zhibei, the calmer he was, the more it meant he was going to kill his opponent.","Jun Linyuan had just activated the Dragon Phoenix Blood, so now was the best time to take him out. Otherwise, he would be very difficult to deal with once he grew stronger!","“Get out!” General Feng stood in front of Jun Linyuan, shielding him and yelling at him.","Blood was still flowing from the wound on his abdomen, and his entire lower body was dyed red with blood.","Xue Zhibei’s eyes shone with mocking and coldness. “All of you can come at me together.”","Jun Linyuan said to General Feng, “General Feng, go help Mr. Lu.”","General Feng turned his head and saw that Mr. Lu was being attacked by the Right Guardian Elder and Mr. Sakiya. His life was in danger!","General Feng’s cultivation level had been reduced by more than half because of his serious injuries. He indeed wasn’t Xue Zhibei’s match.","Seeing that Mr. Lu couldn’t hold on any longer, he had no choice but to go over and help.","Night Owl was frustrated at being too seriously injured and not being able to use his strength. Otherwise, he would have already joined this chaotic battle!","Feng didn’t move.","He didn’t look nervous at all, either because of his confidence in himself or because of his trust in Jun Linyuan.","Jun Linyuan and Xue Zhibei confronted each other.","Their eyes were as deep as an abyss, and their faces were filled with killing intent!","The space around them twisted and rippled.","Violent streaks of energy surrounded them.","The impact was unprecedentedly terrifying!","It was as if the entire world would be destroyed if they weren’t careful.","The people who had been fighting around them stopped at this moment.","They split into two sides and returned to their respective camps.","Behind Jun Linyuan were General Feng, Mr. Lu and Mr. Xu. All of them were injured and looked grim.","Behind Xue Zhibei were the Guardian Elders and Mr. Sakiya. They looked much better than the Spiritual Saints of the Junwu Empire."]},{"number":3352,"title":"Chapter 3352 Chu Tianxiao (1)","paragraphs":["3352 Chu Tianxiao (1)","Feng Wu’s heart was in her throat.","Jun Linyuan definitely wasn’t as powerful as Xue Zhibei. Now that Xue Zhibei had seen the Dragon Phoenix Blood in him, how could he not feel intimidated? How could he not take the opportunity to kill Jun Linyuan?","Would Jun Linyuan lose?","Clenching her fists, Feng Wu stared at Jun Linyuan, afraid of missing something.","However, the two of them stared at each other and didn’t attack for a long time.","“Actually, they’ve already made their move,” Elder Helian told Feng Wu.","Feng Wu was surprised. “What?”","Elder Helian nodded and said very seriously, “At their level, a competition of mental strength is the most terrifying. Others think that they aren’t fighting, but in fact, they’re already in a life-and-death battle.”","Feng Wu looked at the others.","As expected, the other Spiritual Saints had all stopped. Everyone held their breaths and stared at Jun Linyuan and Xue Zhibei seriously.","They were all nervous, worried and surprised.","They were as nervous as Elder Helian.","“Since when did the crown prince become so powerful?” At first, Elder Helian thought Jun Linyuan would lose, but when he saw Jun Linyuan still hadn’t backed down, he looked at Feng Wu in surprise.","Feng Wu said, “He activated the Dragon Phoenix Blood.”","Xue Zhibei had already said this just now, and Elder Helian also knew about it, but...","“He has just activated the Dragon Phoenix Blood and already has the strength to fight Xue Zhibei. Doesn’t that mean in the future...”","The more Elder Helian thought about it, the more excited he became!","If he could think that, naturally, so could the people of the Dongsang Kingdom.","Hence, they couldn’t wait for General Xue to kill Jun Linyuan on the spot.","Night Owl, in particular, was extremely wary of Jun Linyuan!","He wanted Jun Linyuan dead!","The battle between Jun Linyuan and Xue Zhibei suddenly became more ferocious.","The two of them stood still, but the veins on their faces protruded. Others could even see the blood flow through their veins.","But Feng Wu couldn’t understand it at all!","She wasn’t strong enough right now to understand the life-and-death battle between Spiritual Saints.","“Oh, no! They’ve already entered the final life-and-death battle!” Elder Helian covered his right arm and stood up from the ground with difficulty. His eyes were fixed on the scene in front of him, and the look on his face was even more anxious!","Feng Wu was also worried.","She couldn’t wait for someone to stop this battle!","Right at that moment...","Suddenly!","It began to snow.","Heavy snow fell from the sky.","It wasn’t the right season.","What was going on?","At that moment, a reverent look appeared on Elder Helian’s face. His back seemed to bend, and he almost knelt down.","Feng Wu turned around and saw that everyone below the Spiritual Saint stage was on their knees!","As for the Spiritual Saints like Elder Helian, they were all bowing.","“Get on your knees!”","Elder Helian growled at Feng Wu!","But why? Feng Wu was confused. Why should she kneel?","Feng Wu took a closer look at Elder Helian and saw that his face was pale and covered in sweat, as if a terrifying god was about to descend to the world.","“Kneel!”","Seeing that Feng Wu wouldn’t kneel, Elder Helian was almost scared out of his wits.","That person was coming. How could she not kneel?! She would die!","Feng Wu gave Elder Helian a confused look and looked around, only to see that Elder Dongfang and the others had already knelt down.","As for the Dongsang Kingdom... Bu Jingyu and the others had already knelt down properly, not daring to show any disrespect."]},{"number":3353,"title":"Chapter 3353 Chu Tianxiao (2)","paragraphs":["3353 Chu Tianxiao (2)","She also saw Bu Jingyu trembling.","He was that scared?","Feng Wu was bewildered because she didn’t feel any threat.","She didn’t sense any terrifying pressure either. Was she immune to it?","Just then, the sky seemed to split open.","A booming voice resonated in the air, as if it came from the beginning of time.","“Stop!”","The simple word was like a thunderclap.","Feng Wu noticed Elder Helian’s spiritual essence run wild, and he spat out a mouthful of blood.","He wasn’t alone.","Elder Dongfang and Mr. Sakiya’s disciples all vomited blood.","The Spiritual Saints were all as pale as a sheet.","Jun Linyuan and Xue Zhibei were forced to stop their battle.","Feng Wu could tell that the barrier Jun Linyuan had set up had already shattered.","When the others vomited blood, Feng Wu ran to Jun Linyuan’s side and asked, “Jun Linyuan, are you alright? Talk to me!”","Jun Linyuan was still in a daze, so he couldn’t answer Feng Wu yet.","Instead —","Xue Zhibei, who had quickly regained his senses, looked at the young couple in shock.","He was shocked that Jun Linyuan was capable of fighting him!","He was also shocked that Prime Minister Chu had stopped the battle.","He was even more shocked that when he was still dizzy from Prime Minister Chu’s voice, this girl was still so lively!","Xue Zhibei stared at Feng Wu. “Who are you? Why weren’t you restrained by that peerless master?”","He wasn’t the only one who was surprised.","Everyone slowly came back to their senses.","They all saw that Feng Wu was as lively as ever.","Compared to their dizziness, Feng Wu was simply too healthy. Her skin was fair and rosy, and she looked radiant!","“She didn’t kneel just now!” someone exclaimed.","Everyone looked at Feng Wu.","Even with Xue Zhibei’s strength, he had no choice but to lower his head. This girl was completely unaffected? What kind of secret was she hiding?","Feng Wu didn’t even look at Xue Zhibei. Instead, she looked at Jun Linyuan worriedly. “How are you? Are you alright?”","Feng Wu knew one could turn into an idiot if one wasn’t careful in a mental battle.","Jun Linyuan had come back to his senses, and he nodded at Feng Wu.","In the end, Jun Linyuan stared at Xue Zhibei and said coldly, “I’m not as good as you for now.”","These words made Xue Zhibei flush.","Jun Linyuan wasn’t as good as he was right now, but Jun Linyuan was only a teenager. Xue Zhibei knew very well that he was a whole generation older than Jun Linyuan.","Xue Zhibei glanced at his own crown prince, then back at Jun Linyuan. He had to admit, “You’re the best of your generation.”","Night Owl’s expression instantly turned ugly, as if his face had been slapped swollen.","Jun Linyuan nodded. “I’ll surpass you before long.”","Next to him, Feng Wu almost felt sorry for Xue Zhibei.","As expected, Xue Zhibei’s expression was a little ugly.","Xue Zhibei: “I wanted to kill you today.”","Jun Linyuan said, “Even without Chu Tianxiao, you wouldn’t have been able to kill me.”","Xue Zhibei was speechless. Why was this brat so mean?","“Hahahaha —”","A loud voice came from behind Jun Linyuan. Xue Zhibei didn’t need to turn around to know that it was his archenemy."]},{"number":3354,"title":"Chapter 3354 Make Him Happy (1)","paragraphs":["3354 Make Him Happy (1)","As expected, it was General Feng.","General Feng walked up to Xue Zhibei and smiled happily. “Xue Zhibei, how’s our crown prince? He’s as good as your crown prince, isn’t he?”","As good as?","That was an understatement!","Xue Zhibei was obviously displeased. He cupped his fists at Feng Xiangnan. “We’ll soon carry out the bombardment for the final battle. General Feng, we will meet again.”","With that, he turned around and left with the rest of the people from the Dongsang Kingdom.","General Feng’s expression instantly turned extremely ugly!","“Father!” Feng Wu caught General Feng in a hurry!","General Feng held his stomach. “Let’s go back now.”","Frowning, Jun Linyuan stared at Feng Wu’s hand on General Feng’s arm.","Did she call him father?","Still, Jun Linyuan didn’t like what he saw.","Therefore, he stood rooted to the ground.","Seeing that Jun Linyuan wasn’t injured, Feng Wu focused on the injured people, especially General Feng and Elder Helian, the two seniors whom she respected.","Feng Wu noticed Jun Linyuan wasn’t following her, so she turned around and saw he was still standing there stiffly.","Feng Wu asked Elder Dongfang to assist the general while she hurried back.","“Jun Linyuan?” Feng Wu looked at him in confusion.","The crown prince threw a dirty look at Feng Wu and looked away.","Feng Wu was even more confused. “What’s wrong?”","The crown prince sheathed his sword, put his hands behind his back, and turned away again.","Feng Wu was utterly confused.","She looked at Feng in confusion. Holding his fist to his lips, Feng cleared his throat in a hint to Feng Wu, then turned around and left.","Feng Wu was puzzled.","What was going on?","She was sure Jun Linyuan was angry, but she didn’t know the reason.","Was it because she hadn’t called him Brother Jun?","That had been a special situation. Why should she call him that all the time? She wasn’t his fan.","Of course, Feng Wu wouldn’t tell Jun Linyuan that. She poked Jun Linyuan with a finger.","Jun Linyuan stood ramrod straight, and his muscles were very hard.","Feng Wu’s finger hurt, but he still stood there.","Feng Wu thought of the battle today. Thankfully, Jun Linyuan was there, or all the Spiritual Saints would have been killed.","Hence, Feng Wu went up to him and said in a soft voice, “Your Royal Highness, are you mad?”","The crown prince said, “Yes!”","What?","He actually said yes.","When did he become so thick-skinned? In the past, when he was angry, he would keep a straight face and ignore people.","However, it was much easier to coax him now.","Feng Wu walked up to him and was only three inches away from him.","“Then why are you angry?” The girl’s face was beautiful, and her eyes were lively and bright, reminding him of a deer in the forest.","Her watery eyes were just inches away.","He could feel her breath on his skin.","Jun Linyuan’s move improved a little.","“Tell me. Why are you angry?” Feng Wu asked in bewilderment, jabbing a finger into his chest.","The crown prince said in a muffled voice, “I’m not!”","Feng Wu burst out laughing. Her voice was soft, and her smile was like a flower. “One moment you’re angry, and the next moment you’re not. Are you angry or not?”","The talented teenager kept his handsome face straight.","Feng Wu’s smile widened. Taking Jun Linyuan’s hand, she said, “There, there. Don’t be mad. Let’s go back together, okay?”"]},{"number":3355,"title":"Chapter 3355 Make Him Happy (2)","paragraphs":["3355 Make Him Happy (2)","Jun Linyuan didn’t say yes, but he didn’t reject it when Feng Wu held his hand.","He also let her lead him away.","A few steps away, Feng couldn’t believe what he was seeing.","Who would have thought the amazing crown prince would behave this way around the girl he liked?","Feng didn’t dare make a sound or glance at them too often, for fear that he would draw their attention.","In the beginning, the young couple hadn’t known what to do at all. Although they were still making slow progress now, they were at least moving forward. Feng felt so relieved and wanted to celebrate the occasion.","Feng Wu was in a hurry to return to the fortress to treat General Feng and Elder Helian, so she walked very fast.","Jun Linyuan seemed to think she was walking too fast and wasn’t very happy about it. However, he was too proud to say anything, so he could only let Feng Wu drag him along.","Feng Wu arrived at the general’s residence to find everybody there.","Moreover, their expressions were very solemn, and the surrounding air felt heavy.","Before anyone realized it, Feng Wu let go of Jun Linyuan’s hand.","Seeing that Feng Wu had dropped his hand, the crown prince was immediately displeased.","Feng Wu didn’t notice. She hurried toward the general. “Father, you’re seriously injured. Lie down, and I’ll treat you.”","She had already briefly treated General Feng, but she hadn’t been able to do it thoroughly, so she was worried about him.","Feng Wu had treated Mr. Lu before, and everybody knew her excellent medical skills.","Therefore, no one objected when she treated the general.","Everybody was there.","There was General Feng, Mr. Xu, Mr. Lu, Elder Dongfang and Elder Helian.","General Feng’s face was pale and solemn. Lying on the couch, he let Feng Wu treat him.","His gaze landed on Jun Linyuan.","“The Dongsang Kingdom is going to bombard us. Your Royal Highness, what do you think?","Jun Linyuan would only behave like a spoiled child in front of Feng Wu.","He wouldn’t get emotional over major issues.","He started thinking and didn’t give any advice right away.","Meanwhile, the others were discussing it.","Mr. Xu said, “Dongsang’s technology is much more advanced than the Junwu Empire’s. They have at least 100 fighter jets, but the Junwu Empire’s fighter jets...”","Mr. Lu said bluntly, “Ours hasn’t been developed yet.”","Mr. Xu looked depressed, but he had no choice but to nod. “Indeed, ours are still in the research stage. However, Master Duanmu said he would definitely be able to complete it in a year.”","Mr. Lu said, “That’s great.”","General Feng was also delighted. However, he soon shook his head. “It’s too late.”","That was right...","Everybody had heard what Xue Zhibei said.","In a few days, the Dongsang Kingdom would launch a large-scale bombing, which would naturally be carried out by fighter jets.","With the sky controlled by the Dongsang Kingdom, the Junwu Empire didn’t stand a chance at all.","Spiritual Saints could rise into the sky, but the other side had Spiritual Saints as well.","Therefore, the Spiritual Saints alone couldn’t protect Nest Fortress.","“Should we evacuate everyone first?” Mr. Xu suggested.","General Feng fell into a dilemma.","If they evacuated Nest, they would lose this place.","Where could they retreat to?","Mr. Lu said, “Where can we retreat to? Northern Border City? If we go there, won’t they bomb the city?”"]},{"number":3356,"title":"Chapter 3356 I Have Something to Tell You","paragraphs":["3356 I Have Something to Tell You","Mr. Lu said, “Where can we retreat to? Northern Border City? If we go there, won’t they bomb the city?”","Everyone fell silent when they heard this.","It was true, They were powerless in front of such technology.","Feng Wu looked from General Feng to Elder Dongfang. Everybody seemed dejected.","She finished treating General Feng’s wounds.","General Feng told her, “You can leave now.”","The meeting was above Feng Wu’s level of confidentiality.","Feng Wu raised her hand. “Well, I have something to say.”","Seeing the frown on Mr. Xu’s face, Elder Helian gestured at Feng Wu. “That’s enough. Get out of here.”","Everyone present was Nest’s high-ranking officials, and Feng Wu was too weak in terms of both her rank and her strength.","As expected, Mr. Xu’s expression turned ugly. “Who do you think you are? Do you think you have the right to stay here? Get out!”","Jun Linyuan took a step forward and stood in front of Feng Wu. There was a murderous look in his eyes.","Mr. Xu’s stomach lurched when he saw Jun Linyuan’s gaze!","He was a senior minister of the empire and the head of the Military Academy!","The crown prince was actually siding with the girl.","The blood in Mr. Xu’s chest surged, and his expression was extremely ugly!","Feng Wu waved her hand without another word.","General Feng’s spacious house was thousands of square meters in size. It was more than enough to fit what Feng Wu took out of her storage space.","Things started dropping on the floor.","When they turned to look...","Everyone looked like they were seeing a ghost!","Because those things...","Mr. Xu was the leader of the Magical Equipment Division. He had been watching Master Duanmu research fighter jet for a long time. Therefore, he was most familiar with fighter jets!","He now saw that the room was filled with them.","With the fighter jets spread out, there wasn’t enough space, and they had to be moved into the courtyard outside.","Feng Wu kept a few fighter jets and all the inscription bombs for herself.","Even so, what she took out was already incredible.","“These are... They are...” Mr. Xu’s voice shook.","He had seen Feng Wu wave her hand, so he knew they had come out of Feng Wu’s storage space.","Feng Wu smiled at Mr. Xu without saying a word.","Mr. Xu no longer cared about Feng Wu’s attitude. All he could see were the fighter jets.","Most of the inscription propellers were in the house.","Most of the fighter jets were in the yard.","When Mr. Xu rushed out of the room, he saw the yard packed with fighter jets.","“Am I dreaming?” Mr. Xu rubbed his eyes.","Elder Dongfang ran out after him.","“I’m seeing them too...” Elder Dongfang’s voice was hazy, as if she were in a dream.","Just then, General Feng also came out, one hand on his lower back.","Everyone saw how inscription propellers and fighter jets filled the courtyard.","Instantly, all eyes were on Feng Wu.","Jun Linyuan was staring at Feng Wu as well.","The others were all amazed, but Jun Linyuan wanted to smack the girl.","Feng Wu cleared her throat and ignored Jun Linyuan’s cold gaze.","“What happened?” In the end, General Feng asked the question."]},{"number":3357,"title":"Chapter 3357 His Royal Highness Is Angry","paragraphs":["3357 His Royal Highness Is Angry","Feng Wu said, “Well, it’s exactly what you see.”","General Feng asked, “How many inscription propellers and fighter jets are here? 200?”","Feng Wu said, “There was some wear and tear, so I only have 100 inscription propellers and 95 fighter jets here.”","General Feng said, “So, can you tell me where these fighter jets came from? Don’t tell me that our Magical Equipment Division can already mass-produce fighter jets.”","Mr. Xu said, “Master Duanmu won’t be able to build an inscription propeller before next year.”","Whoosh!","All eyes were on Feng Wu.","Feng Wu said, “Well, I went to the Dongsang Kingdom...”","Mr. Lu was the first to react, and he cried out, “Did you get the fighter jets from the Dongsang Kingdom?”","Feng Wu nodded.","Mr. Lu said, “Wait. When did you go there? Did you go with His Royal Highness?”","The others thought they knew what had happened.","If she went with the crown prince, she wouldn’t have any problem obtaining the fighter jets.","However, Jun Linyuan crossed his arms, stared at Feng Wu, and snorted. “I’m not that lucky.”","He was angry!","Feng Wu immediately felt a little guilty and stole a glance at Jun Linyuan.","The crown prince’s jaw was clenched, and his lips were pursed. He looked furious.","Feng Wu said, “Well, I didn’t have anything to do, so I thought I could visit the Dongsang Kingdom...”","Jun Linyuan snorted. “Awesome. You just took a walk and brought back so many fighter jets.”","Feng Wu didn’t know what to say.","Feng Wu had a temper, too. She stuck out her chest and glared at Jun Linyuan. “I risked my life on this trip. It took me so much effort and everything I could think of to bring these fighter jets back!”","The crown prince said in an unfriendly tone, “Oh, you didn’t know how dangerous it was?”","Feng Wu almost choked.","When did Jun Linyuan become so sarcastic?! He used to be so arrogant!","The others gave Jun Linyuan strange looks as well.","As far as they knew, Jun Linyuan was cold, arrogant and unruly to the extreme. Why would he bother to insult others? Only Feng Wu got such treatment.","Everyone looked at Feng Wu enviously, but Feng Wu wasn’t convinced.","“I’m not talking to you anymore!” Feng Wu glared at Jun Linyuan, then turned to General Feng. She straightened her back and said in a heroic tone, “Father, I got all of this from Sun Castle. I did it all by myself!”","General Feng gave Jun Linyuan a sympathetic look.","Jun Linyuan, I’m so glad I get to see this. General Feng was elated. He didn’t like it that some boy was going to steal his precious daughter away.","Hence, General Feng asked Feng Wu, “How did you do it?”","Jun Linyuan snorted.","Feng Wu turned around and glared at him. “If you don’t want to hear it, then get out!”","Ssss —","Everybody gasped.","This girl didn’t know when to stop. She was talking to Jun Linyuan, not Feng Xun. Jun Linyuan would really get angry.","To their surprise, Jun Linyuan wasn’t angry. He only snorted and leaned against a pillar with his sword between his crossed arms."]},{"number":3358,"title":"Chapter 3358 A Different Jun Linyuan","paragraphs":["3358 A Different Jun Linyuan","Well...","General Feng darted a look at Jun Linyuan. He had never seen this kid remain so calm after hearing such criticism. It was unheard of.","The others were also secretly amazed.","Feng Wu told them everything that had happened after she snuck into Sun Castle.","She told General Feng in detail how the second prince’s men had given her the jade bracelet after she entered the underground passage.","“Did the second prince’s men do it? And you just stole their prize?” General Feng couldn’t believe it.","Feng Wu said, “That’s right. It was the second prince’s men. They thought I was one of them. How stupid!”","General Feng and the others all looked at Feng Wu, amazed by her good luck.","“You can infiltrate the Dongsang Kingdom?” Mr. Xu frowned at Feng Wu. “People from the Junwu Empire can’t do that because we don’t have the scent of plants. You’re lying!”","Everybody looked at Feng Wu and wondered if she was lying.","Feng Wu snorted. “The scent of plants, is it? Just because you don’t have it doesn’t mean I don’t have it either.”","As she spoke, her aura changed.","In an instant, she had the scent of plants, which came from the Magic Soul Vine.","“You do have it!” General Feng was surprised. “How did you do that?”","He wanted to know if all cultivators could learn how to do it.","Feng Wu flipped her hand around, and the Magic Soul Vine appeared on her palm.","Feng Wu said, “This vine comes from the Dongsang Kingdom, and it can change my aura. That was why the Dongsangers didn’t notice any abnormality when I was over there.”","Jun Linyuan stared at the Magic Soul Vine on Feng Wu’s palm.","Feng Wu immediately sensed his gaze. She hid the plant in her sleeve and warned Jun Linyuan, “Don’t even think about it!”","Jun Linyuan nodded without saying anything.","Feng Wu said, “I’ve told you everything. I took the fighter jets, the second prince took the blame, and I came back safely.”","Jun Linyuan said, “If Elder Dongfang hadn’t protected you, do you think you could come back in one piece?”","Feng Wu said, “I...”","Jun Linyuan said, “Why did you think you’re capable enough to go to Sun Castle alone?”","Feng Wu said, “I...”","The crown prince’s face darkened. “What did I tell you before I went into seclusion? You’re not allowed to go out alone! What did you do? Why did you go to the Dongsang Kingdom alone? Do you think you’re so powerful now?!”","Jun Linyuan was already terrifying when he lost his temper, and with his current strength, even General Feng might not be able to handle him. Therefore, when he spoke in an angry voice, all the high-ranking officials of Nest fell silent.","Even General Feng, who had wanted to speak several times, felt silent when Jun Linyuan glared at him.","Feng Wu stood there with a pitiful look on her face. Her hands were clasped behind her back, and she looked a little uneasy and displeased.","What’s wrong with Jun Linyuan? Even if he wants to scold me, he should do it in private. There are so many people here. I’m so embarrassed!","At that thought, Feng Wu glared at Jun Linyuan.","Seeing her pitiful but angry face, Jun Linyuan felt his heart skip a beat.","However, he still glared at Feng Wu because he decided to teach her a good lesson this time.","The crown prince had always been a man of action. He immediately made his move."]},{"number":3359,"title":"Chapter 3359 Amazing Girl","paragraphs":["3359 Amazing Girl","There was a gust of wind, and Feng Wu was on Jun Linyuan’s shoulder.","He carried Feng Wu away.","Everyone’s eyes popped.","That wasn’t the Jun Linyuan they remembered!","It had to be a joke!","They all rubbed their eyes, but they only saw their crown prince carry Feng Wu away on his shoulder.","Everyone immediately fell silent.","Elder Helian reacted quickly and immediately congratulated General Feng.","General Feng’s face darkened. “What are you congratulating for?! What’s there to congratulate?!”","She was his precious daughter. Being carried away in public was highly inappropriate!","If General Feng hadn’t been severely injured, he would have tried to take Feng Wu back from Jun Linyuan.","Something suddenly occurred to Elder Dongfang.","“Aren’t the inscription propellers equipped with a self-destruct program?”","Immediately, everyone looked at the pile of inscription propellers and fighter jets on the ground!","That was right!","Mr. Xu was the first to react. He rushed forward to check the propellers and fighter jets.","The others didn’t move because they didn’t know inscriptions or how to examine them.","General Feng was frustrated.","There were so many fighter jets and inscription propellers. They were the lifeblood of Nest Fortress.","Earlier, Xue Zhibei had boasted that he would bomb Nest Fortress in the near future. General Feng had been worried, but Feng Wu had brought him a bunch of fighter jets.","However, before General Feng could rejoice, Mr. Xu told him there was a self-destruct program.","General Feng was on an emotional rollercoaster.","“How is it? Has the self-destruct program been activated?”","Before General Feng could ask, the others asked Mr. Xu anxiously.","At that moment, everyone’s attention was focused on the fighter jets, and they weren’t in the mood to care about the young couple’s row.","Mr. Xu looked up at General Feng in a daze.","General Feng asked, “What’s wrong?”","Mr. Lu also urged, “Say something. Don’t just stand there!”","Mr. Xu said, “No. The Dongsang Kingdom didn’t activate the self-destruct program.”","Mr. Lu asked, “Doesn’t the Dongsang Kingdom know their fighter jets were stolen?”","Elder Helian said, “Didn’t Feng Wu say the entire underground base was blown up? How could they not know?”","Elder Dongfang nodded. “Mr. Sakiya’s disciple wouldn’t stop accusing Feng Wu of stealing their fighter jets and wanted to take her back to the Dongsang Kingdom. Of course, they knew their fighter jets were stolen. Why wouldn’t they activate the program?","Everybody looked at Mr. Xu.","Mr. Xu said, “It’s not that the program wasn’t activated. To be more precise, the self-destruct program has been modified.”","Modified?","The others all looked at Mr. Xu in amazement. General Feng frowned and asked, “How?!”","Mr. Xu was still in a daze, and he tried to describe how surprised he was.","“My understanding is that the program has been activated, but someone tampered with it, so the program stopped halfway,” said Mr. Xu. “But that doesn’t make sense. How can anyone have the ability to do that?","“Maybe someone in the Dongsang Kingdom could do it, but can we really have such a talented person in the Junwu Empire?”"]},{"number":3360,"title":"Chapter 3360 Geniuses Exist","paragraphs":["3360 Geniuses Exist","Mr. Xu looked at General Feng in bewilderment. “This person has to be at least a Level 9 inscription master.","What Mr. Xu didn’t know was that Feng Wu had been pretending to be Bu Jingyu when she heard the elder’s secret code, which was why she could modify the program so quickly.","General Feng shook his head involuntarily. He didn’t have any subordinates like that.","Mr. Xu said, “That’s why it’s strange.”","Mr. Lu glared at Mr. Xu. “What are we looking at now?”","Mr. Xu spread his hands. “As you can see, these fighter jets are ours.”","Everyone fell silent, not knowing how to react.","Elated?","Surprised?","Disbelieving?","Probably all of the above.","Elder Helian asked, “Then, will General Xue still bombard us?”","Everyone looked at General Feng.","General Feng frowned.","This was a top priority.","“First, we have to figure out how many fighter jets they still have. If there are still many left, I’m afraid they’ll still attack. Helian, Dongfang!”","“Yes, General Feng!”","“Yes, General Feng!”","“Choose some promising cultivators and train them as flying combatants!”","“Yes!”","Elder Helian and Elder Dongfang soon left.","They had a lot to do.","“Mr. Xu, I’ll leave the assembly and maintenance of the fighter jets to you.”","Mr. Xu couldn’t wait to do that.","General Feng said, “If there’s something you don’t understand, you’d better ask for Feng Wu’s advice.”","Mr. Xu didn’t like the sound of that. “That girl...”","General Feng said, “She’s even better than me with inscriptions. Do you know what she has?”","Mr. Xu shook his head.","General Feng said, “She has the Phoenix Pen.”","“Phoenix Pen?! Master Linghu’s Phoenix Pen?!” Mr. Xu exclaimed.","General Feng stroked his beard and nodded.","Mr. Xu was genuinely shocked. “How? Where did she get it?”","General Feng said, “Even Master Linghu found that girl talented. What do you think?”","Mr. Xu had wanted to become Master Linghu’s disciple, but Master Linghu had turned him down.","Hearing what General Feng said, Mr. Xu immediately took Feng Wu seriously.","“Is that girl’s achievement in inscriptions really higher than yours?” That was something Mr. Xu had never expected.","General Feng nodded seriously.","Mr. Xu said, “Was she the one who ended the self-destruct program of the inscription propellers?”","It was so hard to believe!","“She’s no more than 16 years old, isn’t she? Why...” Mr. Xu felt a bitter taste in his mouth..","He had studied and researched all his life. How could a girl surpass him?","General Feng patted Mr. Xu’s shoulder. “You have to admit that there are geniuses in this world. Obviously, that girl is a genius too.”","Why “too”?","Because Jun Linyuan was another perfect example.","How could any teenager be as capable as they were? It was simply too scary!","Mr. Xu didn’t want to admit it, but when he thought back, he recalled how fast Feng Wu had made breakthroughs, her level of medicine refinery, and her inscription level...","He had to admit what General Feng said made sense.","So be it. Although Mr. Xu still had suspicions, he no longer let it show.","Dongsang Kingdom, Sun Castle.","Xue Zhibei had no idea so much had happened during the few days he was away.","He was dumbfounded when he saw his destroyed residence.","He turned around and looked at Mr. Sakiya in bewilderment."]},{"number":3361,"title":"Chapter 3361 Rage","paragraphs":["3361 Rage","From what he knew, Mr. Sakiya had always been calm and serious, but this time...","Xue Zhibei asked grimly, “Mr. Sakiya, give me an explanation.”","Mo Lan had already taken Night Owl away to treat his wounds.","God knew how badly his wounds had been aggravated.","It would take him forever to recover, let alone catch up with Jun Linyuan.","Mr. Sakiya’s face also darkened when he saw the destroyed house.","However, more bad news was waiting for them.","Mr. Sakiya said, “General Xue, please follow me.”","He had yet to recover from his injuries and was still limping.","However, General Xue pretended he didn’t see anything.","Mr. Sakiya led him to the underground base.","General Xue wondered if the base had come up with second-generation fighter jets.","Was Mr. Sakiya going to tell him that good news?","If that was the case, General Xue could live with what he had seen just now.","This confrontation with the Junwu Empire had a huge impact on General Xue.","Because of Jun Linyuan, the Dongsang Kingdom, which had been at an absolute advantage, was now at a disadvantage.","It wouldn’t have too big an impact if it was just one event. However, Xue Zhibei knew that as long as Jun Linyuan was alive, the higher-ranking officials of the Dongsang Kingdom would always be at a disadvantage.","Instead of destroying Nest, they would have to watch out for Nest’s revenge.","Therefore, Xue Zhibei’s hopes were on the fighter jets.","However, he was astonished when he saw what was left of the fighter jet base.","His sharp eyes were filled with rage.","“Sakiya, explain this to me now.” General Xue sounded calm, but his voice was filled with murderous energy.","After the initial frustration, Mr. Sakiya calmed down.","He said, “The fighter jet base was invaded, and 100 inscription propellers that were waiting to be assembled were stolen...”","Boom!","General Xue was enraged. He punched Mr. Sakiya furiously.","Mr. Sakiya knelt and slid backward.","His back soon hit the wall, making a loud noise.","He almost vomited blood, but he fought it back.","Although he was a Master Tutor, his strength was inferior to General Xue’s. Therefore, Mr. Sakiya wasn’t as good as General Xue.","He took a deep breath and forced himself to breathe normally. He looked at General Xue again and continued to report calmly, “100 fighter jets were stolen as well.”","General Xue breathed heavily and stared at Sakiya.","Mr. Sakiya saw killing intent in Xue Zhibei’s eyes.","However, Mr. Sakiya had to continue.","“We’ve also lost 100 fighter jets in the explosion...”","Xue Zhibei was astonished beyond words.","In an instant, he was in front of Mr. Sakiya and grabbed him by the throat.","Mr. Sakiya was the crown prince’s tutor and one of the most influential people in the Dongsang Kingdom. However, he couldn’t fight back at all.","“Is that all?!”","Mr. Sakiya smiled bitterly and went on. “The fighter jet base and research area were destroyed. All the personnel working on the second-generation fighter jets were killed in the explosion.”","Xue Zhibei was astonished beyond words."]},{"number":3362,"title":"Chapter 3362 Feng Wu Did It","paragraphs":["3362 Feng Wu Did It","General Xue’s facial muscles were trembling!","He knew the base would have 300 fighter jets in a few days.","100 of them were to be assembled, and 200 were already assembled.","But now, Sakiya had told him that 100 had been stolen, 200 fighter jets and the inscription research area had been blown up, and the second generation of inscription masters had been wiped out... How could General Xue, who had confidently declared that they would bomb Nest Fortress, accept this?","!!","General Xue wished he could strangle Mr. Sakiya to death!","“Stop.” Mo Lan rushed over and stopped General Xue at the most crucial moment.","But what she brought was not good news either.","“The crown prince is in critical condition,” Mo Lan told General Xue.","General Xue was so angry that he was about to stop breathing.","“Don’t we have the Immortal Spiritual Fruit? Why is he in critical condition?!” General Xue was furious.","Mo Lan didn’t know what to say.","She lowered her head and took a deep breath. Finally, she told General Xue the truth. “The Immortal Spiritual Fruit was stolen.”","General Xue was dumbfounded.","Mo Lan said, “That’s the truth.”","General Xue was in disbelief. “The first Immortal Spiritual Fruit was stolen. After all the precautions we took, the second Immortal Spiritual Fruit was stolen again?”","Mo Lan said, “That’s the truth.”","General Xue’s gaze moved back and forth between Mo Lan’s face and Mr. Sakiya’s face.","He pointed a trembling finger at the two of them!","One of them was a Semi-Divine medicine refiner, and the other was the crown prince’s tutor. What were they doing?!","“Screw you!”","General Xue would also curse if he was forced into a corner.","Mr. Sakiya and Mo Lan were already part of a small group of people at the top of the food chain in the Dongsang Kingdom. They had noble statuses and were respected by others, but they were now being reprimanded like puppies by General Xue.","Just then, Zhu Yi rushed over.","Seeing what was happening, he said in a hurry, “Master, we’ve contacted our secret agent in the Junwu Empire according to your instructions. The real Mu Yan is dead, and the fugitive was Feng Wu in disguise. As for Feng Wu, not only is she good at inscriptions, she’s also good at disguising herself!”","Mr. Sakiya turned his head and stared intently at his eldest disciple!","Zhu Yi had been by his master’s side for so long, but he had never seen him look like that.","What kind of gaze was that?","Killing intent surged as if it would devour the entire world!","Mo Lan exclaimed, “Feng Wu? The Feng Wu from the Junwu Empire?!”","Zhu Yi nodded. “Yes, it’s her.”","Mo Lan said, “How’s that possible? How could she have entered Sun Castle? She’s from the Junwu Empire. How could she...”","“It’s possible.” Mr. Sakiya leaned against the wall, closed his eyes, and slowly said, “It’s no wonder I find that girl strange. That’s why!”","Everyone looked at Mr. Sakiya.","Mr. Sakiya was in pain, anger, and disbelief. “She has the aura of plants on her. It’s easy for her to disguise herself as a citizen of the Dongsang Kingdom. If she knows how to disguise herself...”","He recalled the first time the Immortal Spiritual Fruit was stolen.","“No wonder she was with Jun Linyuan last time. She was injecting Jun Linyuan with the Immortal Spiritual Fruit, wasn’t she?","“How could you not have known?!","“Mu Yan didn’t betray us! Feng Wu replaced her from the beginning!”","Mr. Sakiya was sure Feng Wu had been disguised as Mu Yan this whole time.","Because of this, Bu Jingyu didn’t become a suspect. That was very lucky for him since he wouldn’t be able to withstand any investigation."]},{"number":3363,"title":"Chapter 3363 The Unbelievable Crown Prince","paragraphs":["3363 The Unbelievable Crown Prince","“Divine Phoenix Blood. I really underestimated the Divine Phoenix Blood...”","How could Mr. Sakiya withstand the truth?","He had been defeated by a teenage girl.","Clutching his chest, he coughed violently until he vomited blood.","!!","When General Xue saw Mr. Sakiya hunch over and cough, he felt this blow had made the latter age ten years. General Xue felt terrible just looking at Mr. Sakiya.","By now, what could the general possibly say?","“If you can’t...” General Xue said.","Mr. Sakiya finally stopped coughing up blood. He wiped the blood from the corner of his mouth with a handkerchief and finally looked up at General Xue.","Although he was old and dispirited, his eyes were shining!","“General, if we don’t take revenge, I won’t be able to accept my punishment in peace. Please hand this matter over to me. After I kill Feng Wu and take back the fighter jets, I’ll end my own life to atone for my crimes.”","Mr. Sakiya bowed deeply.","What else could General Xue say?","In the end, he could only flip his sleeves. “If you don’t kill Feng Wu within a month, I’ll have your head on a plate!”","After saying that, General Xue left.","A month... A bitter smile appeared on Mr. Sakiya’s face. Soon, it was replaced by ruthlessness!","Feng Wu had no idea she had made such a terrifying enemy, nor did she know who had passed the information to the Dongsang Kingdom.","Right now, she was hanging over Jun Linyuan’s shoulder.","His shoulder dug into her belly, which was quite painful.","Feng Wu knew Jun Linyuan wanted to teach her a lesson.","No!","She struggled violently, trying to jump off Jun Linyuan’s shoulder.","“Put me down, you b*stard! Put me down!","“Jun Linyuan, what are you doing? This is abuse!","“D*mn you, Jun Linyuan! Put me down!”","...","Feng Wu was so angry that she didn’t care about her choice of words.","When Jun Linyuan heard them, his face became as dark as ink.","They weren’t the only people on the road.","Zuo Qingluan was a few steps away, and next to her was Shan Jingfei.","They were walking toward Jun Linyuan while talking to each other. They looked up when they heard the voice, and saw the crown prince carrying Feng Wu on his shoulder as if he were trying to take her away.","They were astonished.","Was that the crown prince?","What happened to the crown prince they knew?","Why was he carrying a woman over his shoulder like any ordinary man?","Wait!","Did Feng Wu just curse at His Royal Highness?","Oh god...","Zuo Qingluan and Shan Jingfei didn’t know how to describe their feelings.","Should they feel shocked, elated or excited?","Who was the crown prince? How could he tolerate Feng Wu scolding him like that? Was Feng Wu going to be beaten to death? Would he tear her apart?","Zuo Qingluan and Shan Jingfei couldn’t wait to see that happen.","However, what they wanted never happened.","The crown prince did raise his hand, but his palm landed on Feng Wu’s buttocks!","“Shut up!” Jun Linyuan gritted his teeth, his voice hoarse.","Did he just spank her?","Zuo Qingluan was astonished.","Shan Jingfei was shocked.","Even Feng Wu was dumbfounded by what Jun Linyuan did.","He had just taken advantage of her, hadn’t he?","Feng Wu wanted to fight back, but the crown prince threatened her. “Do you want to try it again?”"]},{"number":3364,"title":"Chapter 3364 Get the Facts Straight","paragraphs":["3364 Get the Facts Straight","No, of course not!","Feng Wu didn’t want to be humiliated in public again.","She felt aggrieved, but she couldn’t move because Jun Linyuan was a man of his word. He really would spank her again.","Feng Wu pouted in frustration as Jun Linyuan carried her into his courtyard.","!!","When Jun Linyuan walked past Zuo Qingluan, her face turned pale.","She said, “Jun...”","However, Jun Linyuan brushed past her before she could finish saying his name. He acted as if she were grass by the side of the road.","Jun Linyuan entered his courtyard and closed the door with a thump.","The noise woke Shan Jingfei up.","She grabbed Zuo Qingluan’s arm. “Did you see that? I wasn’t dreaming, was I?”","Zuo Qingluan’s face was livid.","She clenched her fists and trembled.","Only then did Shan Jingfei realize something was wrong with Zuo Qingluan.","She remembered Zuo Qingluan said the crown prince was her fiance, not Feng Wu’s.","“Feng Wu is only a mistress!” Shan Jingfei said angrily.","“I can’t believe His Royal Highness will favor his new lover over you. How fickle!”","Zuo Qingluan’s expression became uglier as Shan Jingfei complained.","Shan Jingfei had golten close to Zuo Qingluan because the latter wasn’t only connected to the Zuo family and Firmament Palace, but also had a relationship with the crown prince.","Shan Jingfei was only willing to follow Zuo Qingluan because of the crown prince.","But now, this relationship was gone.","Shan Jingfei was even angrier than losing her own husband. She rushed forward!","“I’m going to ask the crown prince what he’s thinking. Does he want Feng Wu or you?”","Unable to stop Shan Jingfei, Zuo Qingluan panicked.","Pfft.","Someone laughed behind them.","They turned around and saw Feng Xun leaning against a tree.","Feng Xun looked Zuo Qingluan up and down and beamed at her. “Did you say you wanted to ask Boss Jun something? What do you want to ask him? I’m so curious.”","Zuo Qingluan had been trying her best to stay calm in front of Shan Jingfei, but when she saw Feng Xun, she couldn’t maintain her composure anymore.","Taking a deep breath, she held Shan Jingfei’s arm and spoke in a magnanimous tone, “Let’s go.”","However, Shan Jingfei wasn’t someone who would settle things peacefully.","She shook off Zuo Qingluan and stomped over to Feng Xun.","Shan Jingfei was used to being arrogant. Now that she had lost her temper, she wasn’t afraid of anyone.","“Fine. Since you’re the crown prince’s childhood friend, you can answer my question.” Shan Jingfei asked in a righteous tone, “Tell me, what’s wrong with the crown prince? What does he want?!”","Feng Xun and Xuan Yi exchanged a look before turning their gazes to Shan Jingfei.","“What did Boss Jun do?” Feng Xun was confused.","“Do you not know?” Shan Jingfei smirked. “What happened? He’s Qingluan’s fiance, so why is he so close to Feng Wu now? Is Feng Wu going to be an imperial concubine?”","The crown prince could have a wife, and his other women would all be concubines.","Zuo Qingluan felt her cheeks start to flush.","She wanted to drag Shan Jingfei away right now."]},{"number":3365,"title":"Chapter 3365 Fiancee","paragraphs":["3365 Fiancee","However, Shan Jingfei was as stubborn as a young calf. She wouldn’t leave.","“If you don’t want to leave, I will!” Zuo Qingluan wanted to escape.","However, Feng Xun and Xuan Yi blocked her way.","Feng Xun smiled at Zuo Qingluan. “I’ve always been wondering about something, so I can’t let Miss Zuo leave yet. We’d better straighten the facts now, so that Boss Jun won’t get angry when he hears about it. Not everyone can withstand his wrath.”","!!","Zuo Qingluan was embarrassed.","However, Shan Jingfei was intrigued. “You’re right. We have to be clear about such things.”","Feng Xun said, “Alright.”","He then asked Xuan Yi, “Did Boss Jun agree to marry the Zuo family’s daughter?”","Xuan Yi shook his head. “No.”","Shan Jingfei said, “That’s not right. I heard from Qingluan...”","“Yes?” Feng Xun seemed confused.","Shan Jingfei looked at Zuo Qingluan, who looked innocent and bewildered. “Qingluan, didn’t you tell me you’re engaged to His Royal Highness?”","Zuo Qingluan was screaming in her head.","Feng Xun and Xuan Yi looked at Zuo Qingluan in bewilderment as well.","Surrounded by the three people, Zuo Qingluan blushed. She gritted her teeth and glared at Shan Jingfei. “Are you done?!”","After that, she pushed Shan Jingfei out of the way and ran off.","Feng Xun shouted after her. “Hey, why are you running? I’m not done yet! Boss Jun has only ever been engaged to Feng Wu. When was he ever engaged to you? Who made up that story?”","Zuo Qingluan didn’t look back when Feng Xun shouted at her.","Shan Jingfei was speechless.","When Feng Xun turned around and saw Shan Jingfei there, he asked, “Where did the rumor start? When I find that person, I’ll kill them!”","Shan Jingfei was about to say it was Zuo Qingluan, but then she realized Zuo Qingluan never explicitly said anything. She only dropped hints.","When Shan Jingfei asked Zuo Qingluan if she was the crown prince’s fiancee, the latter didn’t deny it.","That was why Shan Jingfei had assumed Zuo Qingluan was the crown prince’s fiancée. She had been working for Zuo Qingluan, hoping that Zuo Qingluan would help her in the future so that she and the crown prince could get closer.","“Zuo Qingluan said so!” Shan Jingfei wasn’t easy to deal with either. Since Zuo Qingluan had given up her right to speak, Shan Jingfei would say whatever she wanted.","“Zuo Qingluan said it herself. She’s the crown prince’s fiancée. How else would I know?” Shan Jingfei snorted, worried that Feng Xun would ask her to testify. The next second, she ran away.","Shan Jingfei didn’t dare go to Zuo Qingluan now. If Zuo Qingluan got angry, she could even kill her.","Zuo Qingluan was furious.","She was the eldest daughter of the Zuo family, the sacred lady of Firmament Palace, and had the True Phoenix Blood... She used to be loved by everyone, but now, she was being ridiculed and reduced to such a sorry state.","She was filled with hatred.","In the depths of Dayless Woods, Zuo Qingluan smashed a tree with her fist.","“You shouldn’t be so unstable.”","A black-robed figure appeared behind her.","Zuo Qingluan gritted her teeth and glared at him.","The black-robed man handed Zuo Qingluan a bottle of medicinal liquid. “This can help you make a breakthrough quickly, but it’ll drain your life force.”"]},{"number":3366,"title":"Chapter 3366 Jun Linyuan’s Bad Temper","paragraphs":["3366 Jun Linyuan’s Bad Temper","Zuo Qingluan snatched the bottle away.","Written on it were the words “Semi-Divine Breakthrough Liquid.”","The black-robed man said, “If you’re lucky, you’ll be able to become a Level 6 Spiritual Lord.”","Zuo Qingluan’s grip on the bottle tightened.","!!","The black-robed man said, “Feng Wu used to be weaker than you, but she’s already become a Level 6 Spiritual Lord in such a short time. She’s a rare talent.”","Zuo Qingluan said, “Shut up! I know you’re trying to piss me off by praising her!”","The black-robed man chuckled and wasn’t angry.","Staring at the bottle, Zuo Qingluan took a deep breath.","“How much life force will it drain?” Zuo Qingluan’s pretty face twisted.","“With your current strength, you can live to 100 years old. After drinking this bottle of medicinal liquid, you’ll only have a quarter of your life left.”","In other words, she would only live until she was 25.","Zuo Qingluan stared at the man in black.","The black-robed man nodded seriously. “So think about it carefully.”","Zuo Qingluan took a deep breath. “At most, how far can I go?”","The black-robed man said, “Ordinary people can advance to Level 4 after losing three-quarters of their lives. With the True Phoenix Blood, you may be much stronger. It depends on whether you want to take the risk or not. If fate is on your side, you might directly become a Spiritual Overlord!”","Staring at the bottle again, Zuo Qingluan gritted her teeth and nodded. “Okay.”","The black-robed man said, “Then I’ll help guard the surroundings for you.”","Zuo Qingluan nodded.","She removed the cork and drained the bottle in one gulp.","Soon, she was surrounded by dense spiritual essence.","Meanwhile, in Jun Linyuan’s yard.","The crown prince kicked the door open and carried Feng Wu inside.","“Put me down! Jun Linyuan, you b*stard! Put me down!” Feng Wu kept kicking.","Anyway, there was no one else in the room. She wasn’t afraid of being seen.","Jun Linyua stood ramrod straight, and his face was grim. He let go at that moment.","Feng Wu slipped off his shoulder like a little monkey and stumbled back a few steps before she could steady herself. She stared at Jun Linyuan nervously, ready to fight back at any moment.","The crown prince gave Feng Wu an expressionless look before he walked past her into the basement.","There was a loud thump.","He slammed the door closed.","Feng Wu nearly jumped.","Why was Jun Linyuan so grumpy?","He wasn’t the only one who was angry!","Feng Wu wondered how many people had seen her like that on the way here. It was so embarrassing!","Seeing that Jun Linyuan had gone to the basement, Feng Wu glanced at the front door.","She stole a glance behind her and saw that the basement door was closed. She wondered what Jun Linyuan was doing.","Should she take the chance while she had it?","She made up her mind right away.","Feng Wu tiptoed forward and reached out, trying to open the door that led out of the yard.","Once she left this place, she would be able to do whatever she wanted. Jun Linyuan would never find her!","Feng Wu was a proud girl, but when she touched the doorknob...","D*mn it!","What was going on?","She couldn’t open the door!","It was a wooden door, but it seemed to weigh more than a million tons! Feng Wu couldn’t move it no matter how hard she tried!","How was that even possible?!","Feng Wu was a little anxious. She checked the door carefully, only to find that there was no inscription or formations on it.","Holy crap!","Feng Wu smacked her head and finally realized something."]},{"number":3367,"title":"Chapter 3367 Turn Away","paragraphs":["3367 Turn Away","Jun Linyuan must have set up a barrier around the front door.","Unless she could break Jun Linyuan’s barrier, she would never get out even if she reached the top level in inscriptions and formations.","D*mn it!","Feng Wu rested her hands on her waist and glared at the front door, as if she held a grudge against it.","She couldn’t get out.","Feng Wu had no choice but to step back and sit down on the steps. She put her elbows on her knees and rested her chin in her hands.","Jun Linyuan was mad. When was he going to let her out?","She had gotten something good from her trip to Dongsang Kingdom, and she wanted to give the sacred golden leg bone to Feng Xun. She also had to do experiments on the special blood, and she didn’t know if Mr. Xu would be able to handle the jets...","Feng Wu looked back at the basement door, but it was still closed.","She didn’t know Jun Linyuan was also staring at the door at that moment. He was so angry that his eyes were about to shoot daggers.","Feng Wu frowned. Why was Jun Linyuan so angry? She had only gone out once, and she had come back safe and sound. Why was he so angry? That was unbelievable!","However, Feng Wu knew she had made a mistake.","Her trip to Sun Castle had been really dangerous, and she had narrowly escaped death.","One slip, and she would have been finished.","Jun Linyuan was angry probably because he cared about her.","Feng Wu wondered if she should reciprocate.","Since she didn’t have anything better to do, she decided to make nice.","Feng Wu rose to her feet and tiptoed toward the basement door.","If the proud crown prince set up a barrier around the door to prevent Feng Wu from entering, she would have to give up.","However, the door opened at her touch.","Was he so angry that he forgot to lock the door?","Hearing the sound, Jun Linyuan, who had been fuming, shifted positions.","He had been facing the door, but now, he turned away from it.","There were no lights in the basement, so it was pitch-black.","Feng Wu was an expert with the fire elemental, so with a wave of her hand, a flame lit up the wall lamp.","The orange light illuminated the entire space.","Feng Wu walked down the stairs and soon saw the person with his back to her.","Jun Linyuan kept his back straight; he looked like he had been standing there since ancient times, like a lone peak or a sword that had been drawn out of its scabbard!","Feng Wu felt a little uneasy.","Jun Linyuan had a terrible temper and wasn’t easy to coax.","However, in order to get out, Feng Wu had to give it her all.","She walked over and sat down next to Jun Linyuan without saying anything. She stared at his chiseled face.","The crown prince kept a straight face and closed his eyes as if he were cultivating.","“Are you hungry?” Feng Wu asked casually.","She didn’t hear any reply.","“Do you want to eat anything? I’ll make it for you,” Feng Wu said awkwardly.","She still didn’t hear any reply.","“Hey, Jun Linyuan, I’ve already shown you enough respect by coming here to talk to you. Can you stop being so arrogant?” Feng Wu was a little annoyed that she didn’t get a response.","Just then, the crown prince stood up!","The orange-yellow candlelight made his face hazy.","He stared at Feng Wu with his sharp eyes. Then, he turned around expressionlessly and walked away, leaving Feng Wu behind.","Feng Wu was speechless."]},{"number":3368,"title":"Chapter 3368 Proud Jun Linyuan (1)","paragraphs":["3368 Proud Jun Linyuan (1)","That was very annoying because she had tried so hard.","Feng Wu scratched her head, amazed by Jun Linyuan’s grumpy temper.","What should she do when he left like that?","Feng Wu felt conflicted.","!!","She sat down cross-legged and racked her brain.","What was Jun Linyuan doing now?","Would he get even angrier?","She knew she made a mistake because she shouldn’t have snuck out after promising him not to. Although she had all kinds of reasons such as Bao Er not having much time left and the Immortal Spiritual Fruit had been about to ripen, they were still excuses and couldn’t change the fact that she had broken her promise.","“Ahem...”","A stifled cough came from inside the house.","Someone seemed to be coughing under the blanket after being seriously injured, but didn’t want anyone to know about it. Feng Wu felt so sorry for Jun Linyuan.","She suddenly remembered that Jun Linyuan had fought Xue Zhibei on a mental level.","Although they didn’t exchange any blows, fighting with mental powers was much more tiring.","Did he get injured just then but wouldn’t show it because of his ego? Had he been holding back his coughs until now?","Just then, she heard another fit of stifled coughs.","Jun Linyuan seemed to be suppressing his coughing but couldn’t hold it back anymore.","Feng Wu became anxious.","She immediately stood up and rushed toward Jun Linyuan’s room.","The door wasn’t locked, so she opened it right away.","As soon as she stuck her head in, she heard his unhappy voice. “Out.”","He added coldly, “I don’t want to see you right now!”","Feng Wu could imagine how proud Jun Linyuan’s expression must be.","Was she the type that would leave just because he said so?","She could be shameless when she wanted to be.","She walked into the room and closed the door behind her.","Seeing her coming in, Jun Linyuan turned around in bed so that he was facing away from Feng Wu.","“‘Pride’ must be his middle name,” thought Feng Wu.","However, she couldn’t say that out loud because Jun Linyuan would definitely explode.","He was still coughing under the blanket with his back hunched.","Feng Wu sighed.","Given his injury, what else could she do?","Feng Wu took off her shoes and got onto the bed. Looking at the bundle under the blanket, she was speechless.","Was he a child? Why was he sulking under the blanket?","She wanted to lift the blanket, but Jun Linyuan held it so tightly that she couldn’t do anything about it.","Feng Wu said, “Jun Linyuan, if you keep doing this, I’ll pour water on you and soak your blanket.”","Jun Linyuan snorted and eventually let go.","Feng Wu lifted the blanket.","It was hot underneath. Feng Wu felt Jun Linyuan’s temperature and found him warm. His face was flushed as well.","Jun Linyuan turned his back to Feng Wu and buried his face in the pillow.","Feng Wu felt like she was practicing how to look after a baby.","“Hey, Jun Linyuan?” Feng Wu sat cross-legged on the bed and poked Jun Linyuan’s back. “Are you mad?”","Jun Linyuan ignored her."]},{"number":3369,"title":"Chapter 3369 Proud Jun Linyuan (2)","paragraphs":["3369 Proud Jun Linyuan (2)","However, this time, he didn’t get up and leave, which was slightly better than before.","Feng Wu asked, “Are you really, really mad now?”","“Yes.” The voice was muffled by the pillow.","Feng Wu wanted to laugh, but she managed to stop herself.","!!","If she laughed, Jun Linyuan would be furious.","To someone as proud as Jun Linyuan, being right or wrong didn’t matter, but attitude did. That was a conclusion Feng Wu had reached recently.","She had to play along with him.","Forcing back her laughter, Feng Wu asked seriously, “Why are you mad?”","Jun Linyuan threw a dirty look at her and turned away from her again.","Feng Wu had some idea.","She tugged at Jun Linyuan’s sleeve and shook it a little. “Jun Linyuan, please don’t be angry.”","The crown prince snorted and remained unmoved.","Feng Wu said, “Um... I know I was wrong. I shouldn’t have gone out after promising you that I wouldn’t run around. Instead, I ended up at Sun Castle. It was my fault. I didn’t keep my promise...”","Only then did the crown prince relax a little.","Feng Wu saw that she had a chance.","Her gaze shifted, and her tone became gentler. “I know... I can give many reasons, but reasons are excuses. If I’m wrong, I should admit it. I’ll apologize to you, okay?”","Her tone was soft, and she kept tugging at his sleeve. That was the right attitude.","Feng Wu stole a glance at Jun Linyuan, wondering if he was happy now.","However, the crown prince was a little too angry this time, so he didn’t turn around.","Feng Wu rolled over and landed on the other side of Jun Linyuan so that she was facing him.","As petite as she was, she fit right into the space between Jun Linyuan and the wall.","She looked up and met Jun Linyuan’s bright eyes.","Jun Linyuan’s chin was at the level of her forehead.","She gently touched Jun Linyuan’s cheek as if she was caressing a cat.","Jun Linyuan glanced at her and looked away, refusing to meet her eyes.","But he didn’t tell her to stop either.","Feng Wu moved her hand upward and touched his hair. Jun Linyuan still didn’t stop her.","Feng Wu grew bolder. She took Jun Linyuan’s hand and said softly, “Brother Jun, I’m sorry. Please don’t be mad.”","Jun Linyuan remained unmoved.","Feng Wu gritted her teeth. “If you keep doing this, I’ll be mad too, and you won’t be able to make me happy!”","The crown prince clicked his tongue and looked down at Feng Wu. He kept a straight face and said in a low voice, “Do you know what you did wrong?”","Feng Wu was delighted to hear that. She smiled and looked like a dog wagging its tail.","“I know I was wrong. I’m sorry.”","Feng Wu snuggled into Jun Linyuan’s arms like a clingy kitten.","No matter how angry Jun Linyuan was, he couldn’t vent his anger on this girl.","He could only stare at Feng Wu and ask in the same way that Feng Wu was familiar with, “What did you do wrong?”","Feng Wu expected this. Hence, she nodded earnestly. “I was wrong. I shouldn’t have disobeyed you and snuck out. I almost died in the Sun Castle. I was so wrong!”","Feng Wu pursed her lips and put on a pitiful look."]},{"number":3370,"title":"Chapter 3370 Proud Jun Linyuan (3)","paragraphs":["3370 Proud Jun Linyuan (3)","She was so cute... The crown prince felt he could never get tired of her.","The crown prince, who was a Spiritual Saint and could fight on equal footing with Xue Zhibei, couldn’t do anything to the girl in front of him.","He gritted his teeth. “You admitted your mistake fast enough!”","“That’s right!”","Feng Wu wrapped her arms around his waist like a koala and nodded enthusiastically. She didn’t feel embarrassed at all.","There was nothing the crown prince could do about this shameless girl.","His raised hand finally landed on the top of her head.","This girl must have been sent by God to torture him. Otherwise, how could she affect his emotions like this? He used to be a calm person.","“So, are you still angry now?” In order to appease him, Feng Wu used all her means.","The crown prince grunted.","The girl poked his chest with a slender finger. “Then let’s not be mad now, okay?”","The crown prince darted a look at her and pretended to think.","If he could think, it meant that he wasn’t angry anymore, right?","“You’re not mad anymore, are you?” Feng Wu looked at him seriously.","The crown prince snorted, rolled over, and put his hands behind his head. He crossed his legs and looked very proud.","All he needed was a stalk of straw between his teeth.","Feng Wu rolled her eyes at him. Happy now?","“Since you’re not angry anymore, I can go now.” Feng Wu got out of bed and headed for the door.","“No!” The crown prince tugged at Feng Wu’s skirt.","Poor Feng Wu. She slipped and fell into Jun Linyuan’s arms.","Feng Wu kicked around and struggled to get up, but...","She didn’t know where Jun Linyuan was holding onto her, but she couldn’t turn over. She was like a little turtle lying on its back, and nothing she did worked.","Feng Wu was furious, and she shouted, “Jun Linyuan, stop! Let me get up!”","Maybe Jun Linyuan found the “turtle” so funny that he laughed out loud.","Feng Wu was so angry.","“Jun Linyuan, why are you laughing? Shut up!” Feng Wu yelled in frustration.","“You look like a chubby turtle!”","The crown prince couldn’t stop laughing now.","It was rare for Jun Linyuan, who usually only smiled a little, to laugh out loud.","Feng Wu didn’t understand why he called her a chubby turtle.","How could Feng Wu accept that?","Hence, the two of them struggled in bed.","By the time Feng Wu left the courtyard, it was getting late.","OMG!","Feng Wu smacked her forehead. She had been so angry with Jun Linyuan that she had forgotten something so important.","Feng Xun’s golden leg bone!","At that thought, Feng Wu hurried toward the colonels’ quarters where Feng Xun was.","Feng Xun was indeed there.","“Little Feng Wu? What’s wrong?” Feng Xun looked at Feng Wu in confusion.","Feng Wu said, “What do you mean? What’s wrong?”","Feng Xun said, “Your hair is a little messy. Were you fighting?”","Feng Wu said, “Well... Of course not. I wouldn’t do such a thing!”","Feng Xun looked at Feng Wu in suspicion. “It’s just a question. Why do you look so guilty?”","Feng Wu glared at Feng Xun. “I don’t. Don’t be ridiculous. I was about to give you a present. Do you want it or not?”","Feng Xun shrugged. “A present? I can have everything I want. Why would I care about a present? Hey, tell me, who did you fight with? Zuo Qingluan? Did you beat her up?”"]},{"number":3371,"title":"Chapter 3371 True Phoenix Blood","paragraphs":["3371 True Phoenix Blood","Feng Wu looked at Feng Xun in confusion. “Why would I beat her up?”","Feng Xun said, “Didn’t she pretend to be Boss Jun’s fiancée? Aren’t you angry?”","Feng Wu asked, “Why should I be angry?”","Feng Xun said, “You’re the real fiancée. How can you not be angry?”","!!","Feng Wu said, “Who said I’m the real fiancée? Don’t slander me!”","Feng Xun said, “Gosh, aren’t you going to admit it? We all saw Boss Jun carry you back to this room!”","He didn’t sound too happy because it seemed like his lovely sister had run off with a boy.","Feng Wu nudged him. “What are you talking about? Nothing happened between him and me!”","“Fine.” Feng Xun obviously didn’t believe her.","Feng Wu didn’t want to talk to him anymore and threw a box into his hand. “Do you want your present or not?”","Feng Xun was very unyielding. “I’m a dignified young lord. Why would I want some random gift...”","Feng Xun had only opened the box halfway, when he saw a complete leg bone inside.","“A sacred golden leg bone?!” Feng Xun’s eyes lit up!","Feng Wu nodded and was about to take the box away.","“Hey, hey, hey, what are you doing?” Feng Xun quickly held the box in his arms and turned away, staring at Feng Wu warily.","Feng Wu said, “I thought you didn’t need anything. Give it back.”","Feng Xun said, “What are you talking about? I’ll take it.”","Feng Wu said, “Didn’t you say you have everything?”","Feng Xun said, “Xiao Wu, you’re the cutest and the most amazing girl. You’re a fairy from heaven and you’re as beautiful as a flower. There are two kinds of adorable girls. One is smart, and the other is beautiful. You’re the smartest beautiful girl!”","“Alright, alright.” Feng Wu, who had her hands on her hips, waved at Feng Xun. “I know you can’t wait to fuse with the sacred golden leg bone. I’m off.”","“No problem!” Feng Xun answered quickly.","Feng Wu almost stumbled when she reached the threshold.","After leaving the house, Feng Wu walked through the dark colonels’ quarters.","Suddenly, she smacked her head. How could she have forgotten such an important thing?!","The Magical Equipment Division!","Feng Wu clearly remembered that she had told Master Wang and Aunt Qing that she would be back in three days.","Three days had passed.","Feng Wu looked up at the sky.","It was already close to midnight.","After midnight, it would be the fourth day, which meant that Feng Wu would have broken her promise.","At that thought, Feng Wu hurried toward the west mountain.","It would take someone else two hours to get to the Magical Equipment Division, but Feng Wu could get there in less than an hour if she was fast enough.","Feng Wu didn’t know Zuo Qingluan had also gone to the west mountain to cultivate.","There were very few people in the west mountain, unlike the Dayless Woods, which would expose Zuo Qingluan to everyone.","Zuo Qingluan had already taken the medicine, and her body was undergoing intense changes.","Level 3 Spiritual Lord.","Level 4 Spiritual Lord.","...","After two consecutive breakthroughs, Zuo Qingluan paused for a moment before she drank the poisonous potion again, entering the second wave of cultivation.","Level 5 Spiritual Lord.","Level 6 Spiritual Lord.","...","A satisfied smile appeared on the face of the black-robed man who had given her the instructions.","Zuo Qingluan was indeed of the True Phoenix Blood lineage."]},{"number":3372,"title":"Chapter 3372 The Spy (1)","paragraphs":["3372 The Spy (1)","It seemed Zuo Qingluan indeed had the precious True Phoenix Blood. She was making more breakthroughs than he had imagined.","Initially, he told her she could become a Level 6 Spiritual King, but that rarely happened.","After all, the special blood developed by the Dongsang Kingdom was still in the early stages, and its effects varied. If one wasn’t careful, one could easily explode and die.","The black-robed man stared at Zuo Qingluan and saw she was in extreme pain.","!!","Half of her body was on fire, and the other half felt like it was in an icehouse.","How did the black-robed man know?","It was quite obvious.","Zuo Qingluan looked like she was on fire on one side of her body, and her exposed skin was fiery red.","The other side of her body was covered in a layer of frost.","She gritted her teeth as her entire body trembled. She was clearly in extreme pain.","The black-robed man knew very well that if she could fuse the two sides, her capability would advance another step.","The possibility of the fire and water fusing was almost zero.","Because until now, no one in the Dongsang Kingdom had successfully done it.","To put it bluntly, this special blood potion was a catalyst that triggered an increase of spiritual essence by overdrawing one’s life essence. The Dongsang Kingdom naturally didn’t dare use it casually, but it could be used as a trump card for a final counterattack.","No one knew about this trump card yet.","Zuo Qingluan was just a test subject chosen by the black-robed man.","Moreover, she was the best test subject among the current ones. The black-robed man was overjoyed that he had found this test subject.","“Ah!”","Zuo Qingluan threw her head back and howled in pain.","Just then, Feng Wu appeared at the foot of the mountain.","Who was it? Who was screaming so late at night? Feng Wu was intrigued.","Driven by curiosity, she sped toward the source of the noise.","It took Feng Wu a long time to arrive at the most remote valley in the west mountain.","She looked down from above.","Under the faint moonlight and starlight, a woman sat cross-legged in the forest. She had her hands on her knees and had closed her eyes to cultivate.","One side of her was on fire, and the other side was as cold as ice.","Feng Wu’s eyes lit up!","She recognized Zuo Qingluan, but what surprised her, even more, was the aura that Zuo Qingluan was emitting.","While she was cultivating, she made a move, and a huge hole appeared in front of her.","Since when did Zuo Qingluan become so powerful?","Wasn’t she a Level 2 Spiritual King?","Just then, Feng Wu heard someone say, “Good. You’re already a Level 6 Spiritual King. You’ll be a Level 7 Spiritual King when you combine the ice and fire. Zuo Qingluan, you’re in pain right now, but it’s just physical pain.","“If you don’t succeed, Feng Wu will mock you, and that’ll be the greatest pain in the world, won’t it?","“So, Zuo Qingluan, you have to hold on. Once you kill Feng Wu, Jun Linyuan will be yours.”","The black-robed man didn’t realize there was someone on the hill not far from them, so he spoke without any scruples.","Feng Wu was speechless.","Who was this black-robed person? He was blocked by a huge tree, so she really hadn’t seen him clearly earlier.","Zuo Qingluan didn’t say anything, but Feng Wu could tell the pain on her face had lessened a little.","Feng Wu frowned.","Who was this black-robed man?","Plus...","Feng Wu looked at the bottle that Zuo Qingluan had tossed aside."]},{"number":3373,"title":"Chapter 3373 The Spy (2)","paragraphs":["3373 The Spy (2)","Feng Wu couldn’t see clearly in the moonlight, but it seemed to be a dark mass...","“Get out here!”","Just then, a cold gaze landed on Feng Wu.","It was the gaze of a superior cultivator.","!!","Feng Wu didn’t have time to turn around and run.","“Miss Feng Wu, I didn’t expect to run into you here.” The man in the black robe smiled at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu took a deep breath.","“Go find help.” Feng Wu let Little Phoenix out.","Little Phoenix panicked because the man in the black robe was much stronger than Feng Wu. He was obviously above the Spiritual Overlord stage, and looked like an enemy. If he attacked Feng Wu...","Little Phoenix wanted to stay here to help Feng Wu, but it had to get some help.","Seeing Feng Wu’s glare, the bird finally nodded and flew off.","Get some help!","The Magical Equipment Division was full of newbies, so Little Phoenix wouldn’t go looking for them. Therefore, its first goal was to find Jun Linyuan.","Little Phoenix didn’t want to talk to Jun Linyuan, but it had no choice but to ask for help.","After letting Little Phoenix go, Feng Wu looked at the black-robed man and smiled.","“I think I’ve seen you before,” Feng Wu said curiously.","She couldn’t beat him, so she needed to stall and wait for help to arrive.","The black-robed man was completely covered in black. He also had a black hood over his head. The black robe was loose, so no one could tell what his body type was.","His face was also hidden under the mask.","The mask was a ghost face drawn with black ink on a white mask.","That face could scare people to death even during the day, let alone in the wilderness at night.","“I really think I’ve seen you somewhere before.” The more Feng Wu looked at him, the more she found him familiar.","The black-robed man sneered.","The only part of him that was exposed was the pair of eyes peeking out through the eye sockets of the mask.","The openings were very small, so one could only see his black pupils, which was even more sinister.","“Haha!”","The man in the black robe smirked and didn’t answer Feng Wu. He looked back at Zuo Qingluan and saw that she was almost done with the fusion. His eyes lit up.","“I did want to kill you,” the black-robed man said bluntly. “Although you have immense talent, you haven’t cultivated for long, and you’re still too weak. It’s easy for me to kill you.”","Feng Wu said, “Should I thank you for sparing my life?”","The black-robed man didn’t reply. He just talked to himself.","“But now, I’ve changed my mind.” He sneered. “You’re still useful alive.”","Feng Wu knew this man was up to no good.","As expected, the black-robed man said, “Your Divine Phoenix Blood is quite valuable.”","Feng Wu’s face darkened. “Are you after my Divine Phoenix Blood?”","The black-robed man didn’t deny it. “That’s right.”","Feng Wu snorted. “Even if you take the Divine Phoenix Blood, it won’t help.”","The black-robed man smiled. “It’s useless to other people, but it’ll be perfect for her.”","The black-robed man was referring to Zuo Qingluan.","Feng Wu narrowed her eyes. “Her?”","The black-robed man nodded. “If you can fuse with the Divine Phoenix Blood, why can’t she?”","Feng Wu said, “That’s because...”","The man in the black robe stared at Feng Wu and smirked. “You’re able to fuse with the Divine Phoenix Blood because your True Phoenix Blood was crippled. Tell me, why can’t Zuo Qingluan do the same?”"]},{"number":3374,"title":"Chapter 3374 The Spy (3)","paragraphs":["3374 The Spy (3)","Feng Wu felt a chill run down her spine.","What the black-robed man wanted was insane.","He really was after her Divine Phoenix Blood.","Feng Wu smiled. “You’re from the Dongsang Kingdom.”","!!","She was very certain.","The black-robed man’s eyes were dark and ruthless. He didn’t say anything.","Feng Wu said, “You have the Dongsang Kingdom’s aura.”","The black-robed man smiled coldly again.","Suddenly, Feng Wu frowned. “I must have seen you somewhere before.”","In fact, Feng Wu had been trying to trick the man, but now, she really felt she had seen him somewhere before because he felt very familiar.","The man in the black robe stared at Feng Wu and sighed. “Tell me, do you want to die?”","Feng Wu asked, “What?”","The black-robed man said, “Why do you have to dig out my identity? You know too much. Shouldn’t you die?”","So, this man was indeed a member of Nest Fortress.","He was also a Spiritual Overlord.","Staring at the special blood on the ground and then at the man in black, Feng Wu clasped her hands behind her back and said calmly, “I think I know who you are.”","“Oh? Who am I?” The black-robed man seemed to be very curious.","Feng Wu looked up at the moon.","Where was her godfather?","Even if Little Phoenix couldn’t find her godfather, it could at least get Mr. Lu or Mr. Xu here.","Elder Helian or Elder Dongfang would do too.","Otherwise, she really would be killed today.","Feng Wu said, “You’re a Spiritual Overlord from Nest.”","Feng Wu could tell that the man in the black robe had stiffened a little, although he was still smirking and his expression didn’t change.","Feng Wu knew she was right.","Feng Wu said, “Not only are you a Spiritual Overlord in Nest, you’re also an elder.”","The man just snorted.","Feng Wu was trying her best to stall for time, so she spoke very slowly.","The black-robed man stared at Feng Wu. “Is that all?”","Feng Wu said, “No, that’s not all. I also know you’re an elder of the Military Academy.”","Sure enough, although the man didn’t move his eyes, Feng Wu could tell he was getting more and more aggressive.","He wanted to silence her.","He asked, “Anything else?”","Feng Wu said, “You’re not just any elder under Elder Dongfang. I’ve already figured out who you are.”","The black-robed man asked, “Really? Who am I?”","Feng Wu scolded, “Elder Dai, you’re a spy from the Dongsang Kingdom! How long are you going to keep it a secret?!”","The black-robed man stared at Feng Wu, and his eyes glowed.","The next moment, he reached out, trying to strangle Feng Wu to death!","“How did you recognize me?” The man wrapped his fingers around Feng Wu’s neck but wasn’t squeezing yet.","He could do it at any moment.","Feng Wu’s life was in his hands.","Feng Wu said, “So, I was right?”","The black-robed man snorted. “Were you bluffing?”","Feng Wu said, “Not exactly, but I couldn’t make up my mind between you and another elder. If you hadn’t lost your composure, I wouldn’t have figured out it was you.”","The black-robed man sneered. “Who knew you would die because you talk too much?”","Feng Wu asked, “Are you going to kill me?”","The man said, “Do you think I can keep you alive?”","Although Feng Wu was in danger of having her throat snapped at any moment, she remained calm and collected.","“I think it’s best if you don’t kill me.”"]},{"number":3375,"title":"Chapter 3375 So Embarrassing","paragraphs":["3375 So Embarrassing","Feng Wu said, “I’m much more valuable than you think.”","The black-robed man said nothing.","Feng Wu said seriously, “Do you want to know who stole the fighter jets?”","The black-robed man said, “It was you?!”","!!","Feng Wu nodded seriously. “So, Mr. Sakiya and your General Xue must be dying to kill me right now. If you can capture me alive, you’ll have done an unprecedented job.”","The black-robed man said, “I can achieve the same goal with your dead body.”","Feng Wu said, “If I die, you won’t be able to prove I was the one who stole the fighter jets and messed up Sun Castle. You’ll only have a chance if I’m alive.”","An exclamation came from behind the black-robed man. “What fighter jets?”","Zuo Qingluan was excluded from the high-ranking officials, so she had no access to confidential information. That was why she still didn’t know that Feng Wu had turned Sun Castle upside down.","The black-robed man smirked and stared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu couldn’t wait to buy as much time as possible. Hence, she told Zuo Qingluan how she single-handedly turned Sun Castle upside down. Mr. Sakiya was so angry that he almost vomited blood.","The black-robed man wanted to slap Feng Wu to death several times, and the blood vessels on his forehead were about to burst. However, he held back in the end.","Feng Wu was right. She was only valuable when she was alive. If she were dead, she wasn’t worth anything.","The moment Feng Wu saw Zuo Qingluan, she thought of the eleventh trial, which she had been stuck on for a long time.","She had to make Zuo Qingluan admit that Jun Linyuan was in love with Feng Wu.","An idea dawned on Feng Wu!","She didn’t know when she would see Zuo Qingluan next. She couldn’t follow Zuo Qingluan everywhere just to complete the trial. Feng Wu felt she would be wasting this opportunity that God had given her if she didn’t seize it.","Since she was trying to stall for time, she might as well go after Zuo Qingluan.","Hence, Feng Wu threw a haughty look at Zuo Qingluan. “I single-handedly caused so much damage to Sun Castle. How about that? I’m the only one who could have done it. Zuo Qingluan, you’ve been trying to compete with me but have achieved nothing. Do you think you can do what I’ve done?”","Zuo Qingluan’s face darkened.","If what Feng Wu said was true, Zuo Qingluan would kneel in front of her!","“Liar!” Zuo Qingluan didn’t want to waste her breath on Feng Wu.","However, the black-robed man stared at Zuo Qingluan and said, “She’s not lying.”","Zuo Qingluan stared at Feng Wu in shock.","Feng Wu was so pleased with herself that she would have wagged her tail if she had one. “Surprised, aren’t you? See how shocked you are – I knew it, you wouldn’t have been able to do what I did. Zuo Qingluan, how can you compare with me?”","Feng Wu finally got to the point.","Was that what she wanted to show off to Zuo Qingluan? Of course not.","It was Jun Linyuan whom she wanted to show off.","She needed to complete the eleventh trial of the 12 Trials of Love.","Feng Wu darted a smug look at Zuo Qingluan. “Do you know what Jun Linyuan thinks of me? By the way, you saw him carry me all the way back to his place, didn’t you?”","At that moment, the crown prince, who was being led by Little Phoenix, was about to step forward, but he stopped when he heard what Feng Wu said.","Little Phoenix, who was behind Jun Linyuan, heard what Feng Wu said as well. It felt so embarrassed for Feng Wu!","OMG!","How could she say that at a time like this? Shut up! It was so embarrassing!"]},{"number":3376,"title":"Chapter 3376 Do You Admit It? (1)","paragraphs":["3376 Do You Admit It? (1)","Little Phoenix wanted to warn Feng Wu, but Jun Linyuan was too terrifying. Just standing there, he emitted the aura of an emperor. Little Phoenix shuddered and immediately shut its mouth.","Little Phoenix was baffled. It had thought only God Mu was worthy of such respect, but Jun Linyuan had just become the second person.","The bird was a being that even dared to slap Chu Tianxiao’s face with its tail!","Little Phoenix was resentful, but things were different now. Worried that Jun Linyuan would crush it, it lowered its head and hoped Feng Wu could take care of herself.","But...","Feng Wu had no idea Jun Linyuan had arrived, and was still showing off.","Clasping her hands behind her back, she straightened her back and boasted, “You saw it with your own eyes. Jun Linyuan carried me back to the yard, but do you know what we were doing in the room? You’ll be scared to death if I tell you!”","Zuo Qingluan’s face darkened.","Feng Wu added, “I’m telling you, Brother Jun will always be mine! Admit it!”","Zuo Qingluan was furious.","Feng Wu wondered why Zuo Qingluan wouldn’t admit it. She already felt a little embarrassed at saying all those things.","Zuo Qingluan took a deep breath and smirked at Feng Wu. “You want me to admit the crown prince likes you? No way!”","Feng Wu was furious!","Why was she so difficult to deal with? She wouldn’t agree with anything! Feng Wu wondered if she had to beat Zuo Qingluan into submission.","“I can tell you what you want to hear, if you agree to my request!” Zuo Qingluan glared at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu said, “Do tell.”","Zuo Qingluan said, “Defeat me, and I’ll say it.”","Feng Wu frowned. “You’re so weak. Wouldn’t it make sense for me to beat you?”","Zuo Qingluan’s expression darkened!","She suddenly chuckled. “Do you think I’m the same person you used to know? Feng Wu, you’re too full of yourself!”","Looking at the spiritual essence around Zuo Qingluan, Feng Wu realized that she was no longer a Level 2 Spiritual King.","“You’re more than a Level 6 Spiritual King now?” Feng Wu narrowed her eyes.","“To be more precise, I’m a Level 7 Spiritual King now.” Zuo Qingluan looked indescribably pleased. “And you’re only at Level 6.”","Feng Wu stared at the blood bottle on the ground, then at the black-robed man. “Is this the special blood of the Dongsang Kingdom?”","Feng Wu’s face darkened.","If the special blood could help a person advance from Level 2 to Level 7, how would the Junwu Empire survive if the Dongsang Kingdom produced this special blood on a large scale?","The black-robed man smiled and nodded at Feng Wu. “You’re right, but you know too much.”","That was why he had to kill Feng Wu tonight.","Taking a deep breath, Feng Wu said to Zuo Qingluan, “Then I’ll beat you into submission!”","Zuo Qingluan was furious.","How dare a Level 6 Spiritual King say such a thing to a Level 7 Spiritual King? What a joke!","Before Feng Wu could say anything, Zuo Qingluan struck first!","Zuo Qingluan seemed to have the help of God!","She moved incredibly fast.","By the time Feng Wu realized what was going on, Zuo Qingluan was already a few meters away from her.","“Die!”","Zuo Qingluan had used all her strength in that attack!"]},{"number":3377,"title":"Chapter 3377 Do You Admit It? (2)","paragraphs":["3377 Do You Admit It? (2)","Zuo Qingluan was going to kill Feng Wu with one move.","Jun Linyuan narrowed his eyes.","He was going to help, but then he remembered what Feng Wu had said.","He remembered Feng Wu saying that killing Zuo Qingluan was her goal, and no one else was allowed to help.","!!","At that thought, the crown prince leaned against a peach tree with his hands on his sword.","The peach blossoms fell off the branches at the sword’s energy, but no one noticed the peerless youth who was watching the battle.","The black-robed man was watching the fight between Zuo Qingluan and Feng Wu.","However, after three moves, Zuo Qingluan still couldn’t take Feng Wu down. Feng Wu had been suppressed at first, but now, she was getting used to Zuo Qingluan’s moves. The man’s heart skipped a beat!","He felt a cold gaze on him in the darkness.","Feng Wu knew too many secrets; he couldn’t let her live.","He felt that Zuo Qingluan was useless. She was now a Level 7 Spiritual King, but she still couldn’t defeat a Level 6 one.","At that thought, the black-robed man decided to join the battle and help Zuo Qingluan take down Feng Wu as soon as possible.","However, before the black-robed man could step forward, he felt incredible pressure wrap around him!","It was as if an invisible person had grabbed him by his collar from behind. He was suddenly pulled back!","The black-robed man panicked!","What the hell?","Flying through the air, he saw that he was getting further and further away from the battlefield; behind him, it was as if a big mouth was ready to devour him.","He wanted to look back, but his body was stiff, and he couldn’t move.","Boom!","The black-robed man’s back hit the ground.","He wanted to jump up, but to his horror, he realized that most of the bones in his body seemed to have been broken. He couldn’t move at all.","He turned around and looked under the peach blossom tree.","There was a young man there.","The young man had a handsome face like peach blossoms. He was graceful and stood out like a light in the darkness.","When the black-robed man looked over, the young man glanced at him out of the corner of his eye. That one look frightened the black-robed man!","It was Jun Linyuan!","Without any other thoughts, the black-robed man turned around and wanted to escape!","However, before he could take another step, Jun Linyuan frowned and pointed at the ground. “Stay there!”","With a flick of Jun Linyuan’s finger, the man in the black robe knelt on the ground and remained in that position.","It was as if his body couldn’t move at all. Time seemed to have stopped.","Feng Wu and Zuo Qingluan were already halfway through the battle.","During the first half of the battle, Feng Wu focused on defense. However, as Feng Wu gradually figured out Zuo Qingluan’s moves, Zuo Qingluan had no choice but to switch to defense.","More importantly, Zuo Qingluan would use formations and inscriptions when she was fighting with others, which were very effective. However, Feng Wu had the upper hand when Zuo Qingluan tried to use the same techniques on her.","In terms of pure combat ability, Feng Wu was used to fighting above her level. Zuo Qingluan had just reached Level 7 and wasn’t familiar with using the spiritual essence yet.","The longer the battle went on, the more advantageous it would be for Feng Wu.","As a Level 6 Spiritual King, Feng Wu still managed to suppress Zuo Qingluan.","Boom!","Feng Wu punched Zuo Qingluan in the shoulder.","Zuo Qingluan had already been overwhelmed by Feng Wu, and now, Feng Wu took the opportunity to throw a punch at Zuo Qingluan, who had no choice but to take it!","Zuo Qingluan felt as if her left shoulder had collapsed.","The sound of bones breaking rang out in her ears.","Her beautiful shoulder blade was probably broken.","Zuo Qingluan glared at Feng Wu. “You must be so proud of yourself!”","Feng Wu smiled. “You’re a Level 7 Spiritual King, and I’m only a Level 6 one, but I’ve cornered you. Why shouldn’t I be proud of myself?”"]},{"number":3378,"title":"Chapter 3378 Do You Admit It? (3)","paragraphs":["3378 Do You Admit It? (3)","Zuo Qingluan was furious.","Just then, Feng Wu punched Zuo Qingluan in the face.","This time, it affected the bridge of her nose!","Zuo Qingluan had a pretty nose. It was delicate and straight, giving her face a well-defined look. However, Feng Wu’s punch almost broke her nose!","!!","Zuo Qingluan gasped.","That hurt!","Tears rolled down Zuo Qingluan’s cheeks.","Feng Wu stared at her. “Will you surrender?”","Zuo Qingluan said stubbornly, “I won’t!”","Not far away, the black-robed man was already feeling sorry for Zuo Qingluan. Young lady, what are you waiting for? Run for your life!","However, on second thought, with Jun Linyuan around, Zuo Qingluan wouldn’t be able to escape. The black-robed man fell into despair.","Meanwhile, Feng Wu and Zuo Qingluan were in the middle of their fight. Feng Wu was so focused on completing the eleventh trial, and Zuo Qingluan was so focused on defeating Feng Wu, that they didn’t notice what was happening around them.","Feng Wu said, “You said you would say those words!”","Zuo Qingluan said, “Over my dead body!”","Feng Wu was annoyed.","This woman was so stubborn. When would Feng Wu ever finish the eleventh trial?","The more Feng Wu thought about it, the angrier she got. She threw herself at Zuo Qingluan; before Zuo Qingluan could react, she was on the ground.","Zuo Qingluan was pinned to the ground, and Feng Wu sat on her stomach. She slapped Zuo Qingluan. “Are you going to yield or not?!”","Zuo Qingluan was dumbfounded.","She never thought she would be in such a situation one day.","Before Zuo Qingluan could react, Feng Wu slapped her again. “Answer me!”","Feng Wu had every right to be angry.","Back then, everything had gone well for Feng Wu in the imperial capital, but Zuo Qingluan had been jealous of her True Phoenix Blood, which was superior to hers, and had played a series of tricks on Feng Wu. As a result, Feng Wu’s beautiful master was still unconscious in her storage space, and she didn’t know when he would wake up.","As for Feng Wu’s family, they were forced to move to Northern Border City. Feng Wu’s cultivation was also delayed.","Because of Zuo Qingluan, Feng Wu’s progress had been delayed for five years!","If she hadn’t lost those five years, she might not be as strong as Jun Linyuan now, but her capability would at least be close to his!","The more Feng Wu thought about it, the angrier she got.","Zuo Qingluan, on the other hand, glared at Feng Wu. “You hit me? How dare you?!”","Feng Wu punched her. “So what? I’m going to kill you!”","Zuo Qingluan smirked at Feng Wu’s raised hand. “If you kill me, you’ll never know where your father is.”","Feng Wu said, “My father is sitting in the general’s mansion.”","Zuo Qingluan smirked. “I’m talking about your biological father.”","Feng Wu narrowed her eyes and looked at Zuo Qingluan with expressionless eyes.","Zuo Qingluan snorted. “Don’t you want to know where your biological father is?”","Feng Wu stared at her. “Tell me.”","Zuo Qingluan said, “I won’t tell you. I... Hm, what did you put in my mouth?!”","Zuo Qingluan stared at Feng Wu in horror.","Because Feng Wu had stuffed a pill into her mouth while she was talking.","She wanted to spit it out, but Feng Wu grabbed her by the throat and let the pill roll down her throat. The pill took effect instantly.","Zuo Qingluan’s head spun, and her vision got blurry."]},{"number":3379,"title":"Chapter 3379 Do You Admit It? (4)","paragraphs":["3379 Do You Admit It? (4)","“Truth pill... You!”","Zuo Qingluan struggled.","However, she realized Feng Wu was too strong!","Feng Wu’s hands were like iron clamps, and Zuo Qingluan couldn’t fight back at all!","!!","Zuo Qingluan was in despair.","“Feng Wu... I’m going to kill you!”","Zuo Qingluan also had medical knowledge, so she knew how terrifying the truth pill was. It was a pill that could pry out all her secrets!","Sitting on top of Zuo Qingluan, Feng Wu watched as the drug took effect. Only then did she get off Zuo Qingluan and sit down opposite her.","Zuo Qingluan had been resisting inwardly!","She told herself she couldn’t let the truth pill control her.","She had too many secrets.","Where was the black-robed man?","Wasn’t he very powerful? Why didn’t he come out? Did he run away?","Zuo Qingluan looked around, trying to find the man in the black robe while she could still think straight.","Soon, she saw the teenager under the peach blossom tree.","She saw his handsome face and imposing aura, as well as the black-robed man who knelt in front of him and didn’t dare to move.","Zuo Qingluan met Jun Linyuan’s eyes.","At that moment...","Zuo Qingluan’s mind went blank.","Feng Wu stared at her coldly. “Is my biological father still alive?”","Zuo Qingluan was stunned and didn’t respond.","Feng Wu stared at her and said in an unusually harsh tone, “Is my biological father still alive?!”","Zuo Qingluan seemed to slowly come back to her senses. She wanted to say nothing, but under the effect of the truth pill, she couldn’t control the words that came out of her throat.","She gritted her teeth. “He’s alive.”","Feng Wu was hugely relieved.","In fact, she had always had doubts in her heart all these years. How could her father disappear into thin air? Why had he never returned after so many years? Was he in trouble? Or was he already dead?","But Feng Wu never dared to say anything because her family had already agreed he was dead, and she didn’t have any leads. It would only hurt her family more if she suggested he was still alive.","“Where is he?” Feng Wu stared so hard that the muscles at the corners of her eyes twitched.","Zuo Qingluan didn’t want to say anything!","She was trying her best to restrain herself!","But in the end, she couldn’t help but tell Feng Wu, “He’s... on the... other side of the ocean...”","Feng Wu frowned. “The other side of the ocean?! You mean a country on the other side of the ocean?!”","Zuo Qingluan gritted her teeth. “Yes.”","Feng Wu asked, “How do you know?”","Zuo Qingluan said, “I’m not telling you... My master... I heard her talking to someone... about it...”","Feng Wu asked, “What else did your master say?”","Zuo Qingluan stared at Feng Wu. “Your father is in... that country... He... You won’t... want to know...”","Feng Wu narrowed her eyes. What did Zuo Qingluan mean by she wouldn’t want to know?","Zuo Qingluan’s willpower was beginning to return, and it wouldn’t be easy for Feng Wu to ask about her father again. Hence, Feng Wu suddenly said, “Zuo Qingluan, do you admit that Jun Linyuan likes me?!”","As soon as she said that, the young man under the peach blossom tree froze!","The fearless crown prince was getting nervous!","Feng Wu stared at Zuo Qingluan again. “Do you admit it or not?!”","Zuo Qingluan felt like her head was being pricked with needles. She didn’t want to admit it. She’d rather die than admit it!"]},{"number":3380,"title":"Chapter 3380 The Crown Prince’s Girl (1)","paragraphs":["3380 The Crown Prince’s Girl (1)","But Zuo Qingluan couldn’t control her mind.","She stared at Feng Wu, her eyes bulging.","In the end, she finally nodded. “Yes, he... likes... you...”","As soon as Zuo Qingluan said that, Feng Wu heard a scream in her head.","!!","“Argh —”","It was the fairy, who had been silent for a long time.","The fairy jumped up and down excitedly. “She admitted it! She admitted it! She admitted it!","“She really admitted it! Our difficult eleventh trial is finally going to be completed!”","Feng Wu was very nervous.","In the end, it wasn’t the fairy who decided that the trial had been completed, but the system.","Sure enough, a few seconds later, the system informed Feng Wu that the eleventh trial of the 12 Trials of Love had been completed.","Wow!","Feng Wu almost burst into tears.","Zuo Qingluan was such a stubborn girl. She just wouldn’t admit it until right now. Feng Wu had been stuck on this trial for so long and almost couldn’t complete it.","Feng Wu rolled her eyes at Zuo Qingluan. “You’ve finally said it.”","Meanwhile, Zuo Qingluan was gradually regaining her senses.","She was mentally strong, so she still remembered what Feng Wu had asked her.","Especially the last sentence.","Zuo Qingluan gave Feng Wu a suspicious look. “Why do you care so much about what I think?”","Feng Wu asked, “What?”","Zuo Qingluan said, “Do you have to get my approval whether the crown prince likes you or not? It’s as if he can’t like you without my permission.”","Feng Wu was speechless.","Who would have known the 12 Trials of Love would be so troublesome?","Zuo Qingluan said, “I won’t admit it now! The crown prince doesn’t even like you!”","Feng Wu looked at Zuo Qingluan as if the latter had lost her mind. “It’s none of my business whether you want to admit it or not. You’re taking yourself too seriously.”","The eleventh trial had been completed, and Feng Wu wasn’t going to indulge Zuo Qingluan anymore.","She smiled. “A conspiracy with the Dongsang Kingdom? Zuo Qingluan, you’re quite bold. How dare you collude with the enemy?”","“I didn’t!” Zuo Qingluan denied it.","Feng Wu was speechless. “Do you think you can still deny it?”","Zuo Qingluan said, “I didn’t! You’re slandering me!”","Feng Wu waved the Spiritual Fossil Stone in her hand. “Don’t you know I have a Spiritual Fossil Stone? I recorded everything that happened between you and the black-robed man.”","Zuo Qingluan’s face went pale. She gritted her teeth and stared at Feng Wu. “Feng Wu, I didn’t know you were like this!”","Feng Wu said, “Why? Did you think I would be the same Feng Wu who didn’t dare say anything after the Zuo family destroyed my True Phoenix Blood?”","Zuo Qingluan took a deep breath. “What do you want?”","Feng Wu said, “I’ll expose your crimes in front of everyone. You’ll tell the world what you did to me back then.”","Zuo Qingluan shook her head. “That’s impossible.”","Feng Wu said, “You have to.”","Zuo Qingluan looked at Feng Wu and smiled. “That’s impossible.”","With that, Zuo Qingluan slowly backed away.","Feng Wu said, “This is the west mountain. Where can you go?”","As soon as she said that, there was an explosion!","White light surrounded Zuo Qingluan.","A thick white mist covered dozens of square meters around Zuo Qingluan.","Feng Wu took a deep breath; the air was so spicy that she almost burst into tears.","It was an escape bomb; only a Spiritual Saint could produce one with their spiritual essence. How could Zuo Qingluan have one?"]},{"number":3381,"title":"Chapter 3381 The Crown Prince’s Girl (2)","paragraphs":["3381 The Crown Prince’s Girl (2)","However, the next second —","There was a loud thump.","Zuo Qingluan, who was flying in the air, was dragged back by a huge force, just like what happened to the black-robed man from before.","Zuo Qingluan was in the air, and she wanted to rush forward, but she felt as if someone was pulling her back. She couldn’t resist!","!!","Boom!","Like the black-robed man, Zuo Qingluan landed on her back and smashed a hole in the ground.","Feng Wu finally saw the teenager under the peach blossom tree.","His face was like a peach blossom as he leaned in a relaxed manner against the tree trunk. He held his sword in his arms and looked carefree.","Amidst the falling petals, the teenager raised his eyebrows and looked into Feng Wu’s eyes. His eyes were like deep pools.","It felt like there were a thousand words in his mind, but he didn’t know where to begin.","Their eyes met, and time seemed to stop at that moment.","Feng Wu was dumbfounded.","Jun Linyuan?","Jun Linuyuan?!","When did he arrive?","What did he hear?","Feng Wu looked at Little Phoenix, who was standing not far behind Jun Linyuan.","Little Phoenix covered its face with its wings and only dared to peek at Feng Wu through them.","Seeing the look on Little Phoenix’s face, Feng Wu knew exactly what had happened. Jun Linyuan must have heard it!","She wanted to roll over the ground with her hands over her head.","How embarrassing!","Feng Wu flushed and couldn’t look Jun Linyuan in the eye. She wanted to turn around and leave!","In fact, that was exactly what she did.","“You don’t want this person anymore?”","Seeing how shy she was, the crown prince was in a good mood.","Zuo Qingluan had never seen Jun Linyuan like this before! Also, what did he mean by “this person”? Didn’t she have a name?! Zuo Qingluan didn’t want to get up again.","One of Feng Wu’s biggest strengths was her thick skin.","After the initial awkwardness, she quickly convinced herself it was fine.","In any case, she hadn’t been speaking her mind. She had tricked Zuo Qingluan in order to complete the eleventh trial. So what if Jun Linyuan heard it?","After mentally preparing herself, although she was still a little embarrassed, she felt much better.","Feng Wu ran up to Jun Linyuan and said in a sweet voice, “Your Royal Highness, you’re here.”","Jun Linyuan looked at the girl in front of him. Seeing that her fair and slender neck was red, he was very satisfied. She must be abashed.","However, the more satisfied Jun Linyuan was, the more serious his expression became. Hence, he nodded and hummed faintly.","Feng Wu looked past Zuo Qingluan and saw the black-robed man kneeling on the ground. She was instantly enlightened. “This man is a spy from Dongsang! He was lying in ambush in Nest! I suspect that he’s Elder Dai!”","She looked up with a serious look in her eyes. “I saw him give Zuo Qingluan special blood. The special blood allowed Zuo Qingluan to advance from a Level 2 to a Level 7 Spiritual King. That’s a terrifying breakthrough!”","Jun Linyuan didn’t care at first, but he frowned when he heard what Feng Wu said.","Level 2 to Level 7? If the Dongsang Kingdom used special blood to mass produce Level 7 Spiritual King warriors, the consequences would be serious.","Because of the commotion, many people were coming this way.","The general wasn’t here, and Mr. Lu was recuperating, so Mr. Xu, who was in charge of the Magical Equipment Division, and Elder Dongfang came."]},{"number":3382,"title":"Chapter 3382 The Crown Prince’s Girl (3)","paragraphs":["3382 The Crown Prince’s Girl (3)","In addition, Elder Qing, the person in charge of the West Mountain Magical Equipment Division, Elder Yin, the head of the Armed Forces Department, Elder Wu, the other head of the department, and Elder Wang, the newly promoted Level-9 inscription master, all came out.","Elder Wang was none other than Master Wang, whom Feng Wu had known before.","Everyone gathered together and surrounded this place.","“Who is making a racket here?” Elder Qing shouted when he arrived!","Mr. Xu was talking to Jun Linyuan when he heard that. Frowning, he retorted, “Qing Mu, you’re finally here.”","Qing Mu was Mr. Xu’s direct subordinate.","Hence, when he heard Mr. Xu’s words, he quickly knelt on one knee with a terrified expression.","“Greet the crown prince.” Mr. Xu said solemnly.","The crown prince? The legendary invincible Jun Linyuan?","Elder Qing had always been in charge of the Magical Equipment Division and had never been outside. That was why he had never met Jun Linyuan before. Hearing Mr. Xu’s words, Elder Qing immediately knelt down and bowed to the future emperor.","Jun Linyuan frowned and gave him a stern look.","With just a glance, Elder Qing felt his scalp tingle. His entire body stiffened, and a chill ran down his spine!","The crown prince wasn’t angry when he gave out that energy, but he was even more dignified than His Majesty before he took the throne. It was really terrifying. Sweat covered Elder Qing’s forehead.","When Qing Mu knelt long enough, the crown prince said calmly, “Qing Mu, is it?”","“Yes, yes...” Elder Qing was ranked first in the Magical Equipment Division, but he didn’t dare raise his head in front of Jun Linyuan.","Jun Linyuan continued his conversation with Mr. Xu.","The more Mr. Xu listened, the more he frowned. “Really? If there’s really a spy from Dongsang who has such a high position and we haven’t found out yet, I’m afraid a lot of our internal information has been stolen.”","Jun Linyuan’s face darkened.","He wasn’t worried about anything else. The only thing he cared about was if the Dongsang Kingdom found out it was Feng Wu who was causing trouble, they would target her in the future, which could be very troublesome.","There was nothing in this world that he couldn’t lose, except her.","Standing right in front of Mr. Xu, Feng Wu said solemnly, “He’s Elder Dai. I’m sure of it!”","As she spoke, Feng Wu pointed at the black-robed man, who was still kneeling before Jun Linyuan.","Everyone had been paying attention to Jun Linyuan, but when Feng Wu said that, they all turned to look at her.","Mr. Xu and Elder Dongfang were fine, but the people from the Magical Equipment Division were as shocked as if they had seen a ghost when they saw Feng Wu.","Her?","Master Wang was the first to recognize Feng Wu. He couldn’t believe his eyes.","How dare this girl point at an honorable elder!","The combative elders were at least Spiritual Overlords.","“How dare you! ” Elder Yin of the Magical Equipment Division snapped at Feng Wu.","Before Feng Wu could react, the crown prince glared at Elder Yin.","Ssss!","Elder Yin felt his vision go dark, and he fell to his knees. He didn’t know what had happened.","“Your Royal Highness, please spare his life.” Mr. Xu pleaded to Jun Linyuan.","“Hmph!” The crown prince snorted arrogantly.","Elder Yin, who had reprimanded Feng Wu, felt a chill run down his spine. It was as if he had just walked out of death’s door and crawled out of a mountain of corpses. He was dumbfounded.","However, he didn’t dare say anything else. Even the way he looked at Feng Wu had changed."]},{"number":3383,"title":"Chapter 3383 The Crown Prince’s Girl (4)","paragraphs":["3383 The Crown Prince’s Girl (4)","Mr. Xu suggested, “This matter can’t be resolved anytime soon. It’s late at night outside, and the fog is thick. Why don’t we go to the Magical Equipment Division and deal with it there?”","Jun Linyuan wasn’t interested in such things. He grabbed Feng Wu and was about to leave.","However, Feng Wu tugged at Jun Linyuan’s sleeve and looked at him with her bright black eyes.","After spending so much time with Feng Wu, the crown prince understood everything. The girl wanted to get involved.","Well...","The crown prince, who had never cared about anyone else’s feelings, now had someone to indulge.","Seeing the mist on the girl’s hair, Jun Linyuan asked in resignation, “Why do you like to meddle with other people’s matters?”","Feng Wu stomped her foot in frustration. “I’m not meddling! He’s an elder and a spy!”","However, in Jun Linyuan’s eyes, he was just an elder.","He could easily finish a Spiritual Overlord with one strike.","Feng Wu was so anxious that her forehead was covered in sweat ,and she was even stomping her feet in anger. Seeing this, the crown prince was amused. “Alright. If you want to watch the show, I’ll let you stay.”","After that, he turned to look at Mr. Xu. His expression changed instantly, and he said with a grim look in his eyes, “Go to the Magical Equipment Division.”","Mr. Xu was already used to the crown prince treating him differently. He rubbed his nose and didn’t feel offended.","Elder Dongfang’s attention was on the black-robed man. If he was really Elder Dai... She tended to think that wasn’t the case.","Elder Dongfang said, “I’ll go get Elder Dai.”","After saying that, Elder Dongfang disappeared on the spot.","The ones who were truly shocked were the people from the Magical Equipment Division.","Many people in the division had met Feng Wu before.","Elder Yin, Elder Wu, and Master Wang had all met Feng Wu. Elder Qing, was the only exception because he had been cultivating.","The three people who had met Feng Wu were all shocked.","When Aunt Qing tried to let Feng Wu join Master Duanmu, Elder Wu turned them down.","Master Wang had become a Level-9 inscription master under Feng Wu’s guidance, but he had never dreamed Feng Wu would be so close to the crown prince!","For a moment, everyone had mixed feelings, but no one let their emotions show.","As renowned masters, they had to maintain their calm appearance.","Elder Yin went to move the black-robed man, while Zuo Qingluan...","Elder Qing called for Aunt Qing, who carried Zuo Qingluan inside.","Aunt Qing was surprised to see Feng Wu. Her eyes lit up. “Xiao Wu, are you alright?”","After that, Aunt Qing winked at Feng Wu. She had kept it a secret for the past three days, and no one knew Feng Wu had gone out.","Seeing that Aunt Qing was talking to Feng Wu as if the latter were a neighbor, Elder Qing broke out in a sweat.","He didn’t want to be scolded by the crown prince like what happened to Elder Yin!","Therefore, Elder Qing pulled Aunt Qing hard, telling her to shut up and not cause trouble for him.","Feng Wu didn’t see what Elder Qing was doing behind her back. She greeted Aunt Qing with a sweet smile. “I’m fine. Thank you, Aunt Qing.”","Aunt Qing said, “That’s good.”","After that, Aunt Qing walked up to Feng Wu and carried Zuo Qingluan over her shoulder as she chatted with Feng Wu.","The poor crown prince was pushed aside by Aunt Qing and left behind.","The surrounding people looked at Elder Qing in horror!","They gestured for him to look at the crown prince’s face.","Elder Qing saw the look on the crown prince’s face. It was really ugly."]},{"number":3384,"title":"Chapter 3384 The Crown Prince’s Maid (1)","paragraphs":["3384 The Crown Prince’s Maid (1)","Elder Qing hurried over and dragged Aunt Qing away. “Watch where you’re going. Don’t you know His Royal Highness is here?”","His Royal Highness?","Aunt Qing turned around and saw the handsome teenager walking next to Feng Wu. Her eyes lit up. “Is this our crown prince?”","Elder Qing quickly covered her mouth. “Shut up!”","The group of people quickly walked to the Magical Equipment Division.","The hall was brightly lit.","Master Duanmu was studying the inscription propeller. When he heard his disciple Ji Ying’s report, he didn’t want to join in the fun.","However, Ji Ying was very excited. “Master! The crown prince! The crown prince is here!”","His Royal Highness?","That unparalleled youth?","As proud as Master Duanmu was, he knew he had no right to be arrogant in front of a genius like Jun Linyuan. He put down the inscription propeller, changed his clothes, straightened them, and hurried out.","In the spacious hall, the crown prince sat down with Feng Wu next to him.","On the crown prince’s left were Mr. Xu, Elder Yin and Elder Wu, who led the inscription masters.","On the crown prince’s left were Elder Qing, Aunt Qing and Master Wang.","The black-robed man and Zuo Qingluan knelt in the center.","The black-robed man was immobilized by the crown prince.","However, Zuo Qingluan could move.","She was kneeling on the ground with her head lowered. She wished she could bury herself in the ground.","This was so humiliating!","She was the sacred lady of Firmament Palace and the most prestigious woman in the empire. No other woman in the world was more honorable than her, but now, she was kneeling here like a stray dog.","The humiliation!","“Feng Wu, I’ll make you pay for everything I went through today!” Zuo Qingluan screamed in her head.","At that moment, Master Duanmu and his disciple, Ji Ying, were running toward the crowd.","Master Duanmu looked at the lineup and immediately stood silently on the left.","Ji Ying followed closely behind his master.","He raised his head and secretly looked at the young man at the top. With just one glance, Ji Ying realized how terrifying the crown prince was. Even from so far away, Ji Ying didn’t dare look at Jun Linyuan a second time.","Because he respected Jun Linyuan so much, Ji Ying didn’t notice the girl in the red dress standing next to the crown prince.","Master Wang’s disciples also arrived.","They were Wang Zhiheng, Mo Ziming, Yue Ban, Dong Chen and Li Erchen.","Wang Zhiheng had told his junior brothers that they were only allowed to listen from afar and to not make a single sound. Hence, they all lowered their heads and stole one glance at Jun Linyuan from the corner of their eyes before looking down at the two people kneeling in the middle of the hall.","The huge hall was brightly lit, and there were many people, but it was so silent that one would be able to hear a pin drop.","No one spoke at first.","Feng Wu cleared her throat and said, “I’m the witness. Let me go first. I saw this black-robed man with Zuo Qingluan, and he gave her special blood for her cultivation. Zuo Qingluan was only a Level 2 Spiritual King at first.”","Mr. Xu nodded. “I can vouch for that.”","Mr. Xu had always thought Zuo Qingluan was a genius, so he had been paying attention to her.","Feng Wu nodded. “But now you can see how strong Zuo Qingluan is.”","“She’s a Level 7 Spiritual King,” Elder Qing said quickly.","Feng Wu nodded. “Zuo Qingluan went from Level 2 to Level 7 overnight. Aren’t you curious about that?”"]},{"number":3385,"title":"Chapter 3385 The Crown Prince’s Maid (2)","paragraphs":["3385 The Crown Prince’s Maid (2)","Everyone looked at Feng Wu curiously. Of course, they were intrigued!","A few people in the crowd were shocked!","Among them, Ji Ying and Wang Zhiheng were the most astonished.","Ji Ying had taken a fancy to Feng Wu and wanted to make her one of his concubines.","!!","Wang Zhiheng liked Feng Wu too and wanted to marry her.","When they saw the lively girl in a red dress standing next to the proud crown prince, they thought she was the crown prince’s maid.","Ji Ying’s heart skipped a beat. He was so good at inscriptions. If he could work with his master and get some credit for the research of the fighter jets, he could beg the crown prince for permission to marry the crown prince’s maid.","Wang Zhiheng had the same plan.","Feng Wu didn’t care about them at all. She was only looking at Zuo Qingluan, who was kneeling in the middle of the room, with a mocking look in her eyes.","Seeing Zuo Qingluan lower her head and flush in humiliation, Feng Wu smirked.","Did she feel humiliated now?","Six years ago, after Feng Wu’s True Phoenix Blood was crippled, she had fallen from heaven to hell. She had suffered more than this.","Jun Linyuan’s subordinates were all influential figures in the outside world.","Feng Wu was only a Level 6 Spiritual King.","However, Feng Wu didn’t show any fear in front of these big shots.","“It was because of this.” Feng Wu handed over the porcelain bottle. “This is the latest special blood developed by the Dongsang Kingdom. The blood can instantly modify and improve one’s cultivation.”","Many people looked at Feng Wu in confusion. Why should they believe her?","However, Jun Linyuan and Mr. Xu believed Feng Wu.","Feng Wu had proven to them that she was a Semi-Divine medicine refiner.","Someone stepped forward from the crowd. It was Master Wang.","Master Wang gave Feng Wu a brooding look. “Why don’t I take a look? I’m a Supreme Level medicine refiner.”","After Master Wang’s beloved woman was poisoned to death, he had studied medicine diligently and gradually became a Supreme Level medicine refiner. It was just that many people didn’t know about it.","They didn’t know he was so talented.","Feng Wu nodded. “Of course.”","Master Wang took the potion.","There was still some medicinal liquid left in the bottle.","The medicinal liquid was a faint golden color, and it gave off a feeling of boundless power. Master Wang carefully took a drop of the medicine and poured it on his palm. After careful observation, he found that the spiritual essence particles inside seemed to be exploding.","Master Wang could feel it, but he couldn’t describe the feeling.","He recounted his observation and added his own opinion. “I think Miss Feng Wu is right. The golden liquid might increase one’s spiritual essence in a short period of time, but there would probably be repercussions.”","Master Wang had mixed feelings when he saw Feng Wu.","Who would have thought this girl had such a powerful patron? That was the crown prince! With His Royal Highness around, no one in the world could bully her.","Master Wang had done Feng Wu a favor, but someone in the crowd frowned.","Master Duanmu had always regarded Master Wang as a thorn in his side. Seeing that Master Wang had become a Level 9 inscription master, he couldn’t hold back his anger anymore. Now, he saw the crown prince nod at Master Wang as if he agreed with the latter. How could Master Duanmu stand it?!"]},{"number":3386,"title":"Chapter 3386 The Crown Prince’s Maid (3)","paragraphs":["3386 The Crown Prince’s Maid (3)","Master Duanmu felt that if he didn’t defeat his junior brother for good, the latter might really replace him in the future. In terms of talent, Master Wang was just as good as Master Duanmu.","Thinking this, Master Duanmu immediately stood up and said to Master Wang in a reprimanding tone, “Junior Brother, is your old habit acting up again?! You’re jumping to conclusions without any evidence. What did our master teach you back then? Don’t be arrogant!”","Master Wang didn’t know what to say.","Master Duanmu was the senior brother. It was only right for him to reprimand his junior brother. No one could say anything about it.","However, their master used to reprimand Duanmu all the time back then for his arrogance. It had never been Master Wang.","However, Master Wang wasn’t good with words. When reprimanded by Master Duanmu, he stood there stiffly, his face flushed red, but he couldn’t say anything in return.","This was the disadvantage of an honest person not knowing how to quarrel.","Feng Wu frowned when she saw Master Duanmu’s reaction. She darted a look at him and said in a displeased tone, “Why don’t you try it?”","Master Duanmu didn’t think much of Feng Wu.","She was just a maid who served the crown prince. She didn’t have the right to express her feelings. Master Duanmu was a Level 9 inscription master who was about to develop a fighter jet! Even a hundred maids like her couldn’t compare with him!","The arrogant Master Duanmu walked up and snatched the medicine from Feng Wu’s hand.","Master Wang noticed how the crown prince’s face darkened.","Elder Yin wanted to remind Master Duanmu to watch his attitude toward Feng Wu. However, Master Duanmu was so immersed in the elation of his impending invention that he couldn’t take the hint.","Master Duanmu’s talent in medicine was also inferior to Master Wang’s, so his perception of the medicinal liquid was slightly worse than Master Wang’s.","Master Wang could sense the explosion inside the spiritual essence particles, but Master Duanmu couldn’t.","“There’s nothing special about this liquid. You’re just spouting nonsense.” Master Duanmu rejected Master Wang’s deduction and said to Jun Linyuan with cupped fists, “Your Royal Highness, my junior brother has always been arrogant and full of lies since he was young. It’s our fault for not teaching him well enough, and he makes a fool of himself.”","The crown prince stared at Master Duanmu with a brooding expression, which chilled Master Duanmu. He felt that the crown prince’s eyes were as sharp as knives and could see the truth in the darkness, which made Master Duanmu feel guilty.","Master Duanmu didn’t dare meet the crown prince’s eyes again. He lowered his head.","For a moment, everyone fell silent, waiting for Jun Linyuan’s decision.","However, the crown prince didn’t say anything, which was a terrifying thing.","Feng Wu smiled. “Actually, what’s there to argue about? Aunt Qing, can you go to the kitchen and fetch a hen and a rabbit?”","Aunt Qing quickly agreed.","Soon, Aunt Qing returned. Apart from the hen and rabbit, she also brought three other types of wild animals.","Everyone knew Feng Wu was going to do an experiment in front of everyone.","Master Wang frowned. “There isn’t enough medicinal liquid.”","Feng Wu said, “There’s not enough medicine, but there’s enough blood. Don’t you think so, Miss Zuo?”","Zuo Qingluan cursed inwardly and stared at Feng Wu with hatred in her eyes. She would make Feng Wu pay a thousand times for what she had done today! Zuo Qingluan swore a blood oath!","“That’s right! That’s a good idea!” Master Wang agreed with Feng Wu right away. “As long as these creatures grow stronger, it means the special blood does exist, and Miss Zuo did drink it.”"]},{"number":3387,"title":"Chapter 3387 The Crown Prince’s Maid (4)","paragraphs":["3387 The Crown Prince’s Maid (4)","How could Zuo Qingluan say no?","Now that she was a prisoner, she had no ability to resist at all, and could only let Aunt Qing take her blood.","Aunt Qing fed the five portions of blood to the five animals.","The hen exploded and died on the spot.","The rabbit paused for a few seconds before exploding and dying.","After that, the hound also exploded.","The cheetah swayed and bled from its mouth, but it remained standing.","The leopard rolled around in pain. In the end, its strength really increased by a lot.","Zuo Qingluan’s face was ashen, and she had nothing else to say.","Master Wang heaved a sigh of relief. “That shows that this special blood can indeed increase one’s strength in a short period of time. It really is a terrifying thing.”","But how could Master Duanmu admit it?","Admitting it would mean he had lost.","His accusation of Master Wang would make him look like an idiot.","Hence, Master Duanmu smirked. “How dare you say that when you’ve only experimented on animals? How dare you make such a joke in front of the crown prince? What if the crown prince wasn’t here? Wouldn’t you look more ridiculous than you already do?!”","Feng Wu looked at Master Duanmu as if he were an idiot.","Since Master Duanmu wouldn’t stop when he still could, Feng Wu didn’t mind slapping him in the face.","Master Wang was once again infuriated by how Master Duanmu distorted the truth.","However, the honest Master Wang could only tremble in anger. His face was ashen, but he couldn’t say anything in retort.","Feng Wu sighed on Master Wang’s behalf and said calmly, “Actually, we can try Zuo Qingluan’s blood on humans.”","Master Wang’s eyes lit up. That was right!","“Yes, we can try it on humans! That’s a great idea!”","“No, it’s not!”","Zuo Qingluan was furious. What did they think her blood was?!","She had such precious blood, yet they were using it whenever they wanted. It was unbelievable!","However, Feng Wu didn’t even look at her, and gave Aunt Qing instructions once again.","Aunt Qing was so happy that Feng Wu paid so much attention to her. This way, she was able to stand out in front of so many big shots. Aunt Qing was elated. This was something she could brag about for the rest of her life!","Hence, Aunt Qing quickly walked out. When she returned, there were five people behind her.","Aunt Qing said to Feng Wu, “We don’t have any Spiritual Kings here, and these are all Spiritual Lords. They range from Level 1 to Level 5. I wonder if that’ll work.”","Aunt Qing hadn’t received much education, but she was the street-smart type. She could tell that the crown prince was the most important person present; even Mr. Xu had to show him respect.","But the crown prince didn’t reciprocate, and he was only nice to Feng Wu. Aunt Qing immediately knew what was going on.","Feng Wu nodded. “Sure. Give them five more portions of blood. Don’t let them have too much.”","Aunt Qing nodded and immediately went to carry out the order.","Elder Yin looked at Elder Qing strangely.","Elder Qing couldn’t begin to describe how he felt.","He had thought Aunt Qing, who was like a bumpkin, would be useless to him, but to his surprise, she had caught the eye of the crown prince’s sweetheart. Did he have to cozy up to his wife now?","These five Spiritual Lords sat in a row on the ground.","Soon, they really made a breakthrough.","However..."]},{"number":3388,"title":"Chapter 3388 Proof (1)","paragraphs":["3388 Proof (1)","The five of them sat in a row on the ground and began to cultivate.","All eyes were on them.","Would they be able to make a breakthrough?","If they really did, didn’t that mean they had found a shortcut?","No one’s expression changed, but they all had their own plans.","Rumble...","Someone made a breakthrough!","Everyone looked at the first person!","That person was the strongest, and his breakthrough speed was also the fastest. Therefore, he broke through by one level in an instant!","Many people’s eyes lit up.","Aunt Qing covered her mouth and sighed. “Gosh! He really did it!”","Soon, that person made another breakthrough!","Everyone’s hearts skipped a beat.","They were so envious!","In such a short period of time, this Level 5 Spiritual Lord had made two consecutive breakthroughs!","He was a Level 7 Spiritual Lord now!","It was as if he were on a rocket ride!","“Gosh! I didn’t know that was possible!”","The people standing on the right were relatively calm. However, those on the left were from the Military Academy, and they were already discussing excitedly.","Master Duanmu’s eyes turned red!","He had never had the energy to cultivate, so his cultivation level had never been as high as the others. If this method worked, even if this medicinal liquid was very expensive, he had to get it!","Master Duanmu’s disciple, Ji Ying, had the same plan.","With a buzz, the Level 7 Spiritual Lord broke through again.","Even Elder Qing couldn’t remain calm anymore.","He was excited. “Yes! We can make breakthroughs with this liquid! The Junwu Empire can create as many masters as we want! Oh my god, this is unbelievable!”","He wasn’t the only one who was excited. Many people were as thrilled as he was.","Zuo Qingluan’s face was ashen.","These people stared at her like hungry wolves, as if they couldn’t wait to rush up and bleed her dry!","She was the sacred lady of Firmament Palace!","She was a phoenix, but these people were treating her like a common hen!","But Feng Wu only frowned.","She said, “Something’s wrong.”","Jun Linyuan glanced at her.","Feng Wu said in a serious tone, “In this world, a person’s ability should grow in an orderly manner. If one can make breakthroughs at an unlimited speed, they’ll have to pay a terrible price, probably with their life.”","Master Duanmu glanced at her disdainfully and reprimanded her. “Nonsense!”","However, that was all he had time to say.","Boom!","The first test subject, who was about to reach Level 9, exploded!","The explosion of spiritual essence inside a cultivator’s body was a terrifying thing.","Not only would his meridians be destroyed, it would also affect his surroundings.","Fortunately, Mr. Xu had long realized something was wrong, and had set up a thin protective shield around the first cultivator.","Right after the protective shield was formed, the first cultivator exploded.","His entire body was a bloody mess, and his meridians were broken...","Master Wang went up in a hurry to check his breathing. In the end, he looked up and shook his head at Jun Linyuan. “He’s... dead.”","Dead?!","Did he explode and die because he made breakthroughs too quickly?","Aunt Qing rubbed her chest. “Fortunately, Miss Feng Wu told me beforehand that he might explode and die. That’s why the five people I brought here are all on death row.”"]},{"number":3389,"title":"Chapter 3389 Proof (2)","paragraphs":["3389 Proof (2)","Feng Wu looked at Aunt Qing curiously. She didn’t know there were prisoners on death row here.","Aunt Qing nodded and told Feng Wu in a low voice that Nest’s prison was nearby.","The first test subject exploded and died, instantly making everyone calm down a little.","Soon, the second Spiritual King began his cultivation.","!!","His potential was even stronger than the first one. He broke through four times in one go, but in the end, he also exploded and died.","Thankfully, Mr. Xu had learned his lesson. Each test subject was wrapped in a protective shield, so the explosion of their spiritual essence wouldn’t affect the people around them.","The third... the fourth... the fifth...","Apart from the last person who broke through two levels in one go and injured his foundation, the other four people all exploded and died. This success rate...","Even Zuo Qingluan’s hair stood on end, let alone the others.","She turned around and stared angrily at the black-robed man!","If not for her good luck, she would have exploded and died!","She would have been dead by now!","The crown prince frowned at the mess.","Aunt Qing reacted quickly. She called for someone to clean up. In just a short while, the ground was already clean and spotless, as if nothing had happened.","No one made a sound.","The change from ecstasy to disappointment was so drastic that everyone had yet to recover from it.","Feng Wu stepped forward and stared at Zuo Qingluan. “Do those four people prove that Zuo Qingluan drank the special blood? Does this prove that Zuo Qingluan has a close relationship with Dongsang?”","Zuo Qingluan smirked. “Why should that prove anything? Yes, I did take some special blood, but who can prove that it came from the Dongsang Kingdom?! Feng Wu, you can’t frame me!”","Feng Wu smiled and looked at Mr. Xu. “Why would I frame you? Mr. Xu, why don’t you check her spiritual essence?”","Master Duanmu sneered inwardly. Mr. Xu was an important figure. Why would he listen to a maid?","However...","Mr. Xu did as Feng Wu said, although he still didn’t agree with Feng Wu out loud in public.","Mr. Xu had been dealing with the Dongsang Kingdom for so many years that he knew the energy of the Dongsang Kingdom very well.","Zuo Qingluan had hidden her energy well, but it was basically useless in front of a master like Mr. Xu. She couldn’t hide anything from him.","Mr. Xu not only examined Zuo Qingluan, but also the fifth test subject.","At the same time, he also thoroughly examined the black-robed man!","In the end, Mr. Xu took a deep breath. When he opened his eyes, his gaze was as sharp as a blade!","“All three of them carry the scent of the Dongsang Kingdom. It’s very faint, but I’m sure of it.” Mr. Xu frowned and stared at Feng Wu. “Why is that?”","Feng Wu sighed. “The fifth test subject has it because of Zuo Qingluan’s blood, so he can be ruled out. However, Zuo Qingluan and this black-robed man are definitely spies of the Dongsang Kingdom.","“The only thing we need to prove now is the identity of this black-robed man. First of all, let me tell you my guess,” Feng Wu said. “I suspect this black-robed man is Elder Dai, the one in charge of the Disciplinary Hall in the Council of Elders of the Military Academy.”"]},{"number":3390,"title":"Chapter 3390 Proof (3)","paragraphs":["3390 Proof (3)","“That’s impossible.” Mr. Xu was the first to deny Feng Wu’s suggestion as he said bluntly, “Elder Dai is from the Junwu Empire. I reviewed his file and checked his energy myself. There’s no mistake!”","With Jun Linyuan in the middle, the people on the left were mostly from the Imperial College or had remained neutral, while the people on the left were from the Military Academy.","Hence, when Feng Wu said that the black-robed man was an elder of the Military Academy, they were displeased. She was defaming the Military Academy!","Hence, they all stood up and agreed with Mr. Xu!","!!","Elder Yin was more reserved. “Your Royal Highness, Miss Feng Wu is making wild guesses and slandering the Military Academy. That’s not a good idea, is it?”","Elder Wu was infuriated. “Your Royal Highness, everyone in the Military Academy has fought bravely to protect our country. Miss Feng Wu is humiliating us by saying those things!”","Master Duanmu took a look and decided to join them.","Besides, he was a Level 9 inscription master and held a high position, so Master Duanmu believed the crown prince would show him some respect.","Hence, Master Duanmu stepped forward and bowed to Jun Linyuan with a pained look on his face. “Your Royal Highness, this troublesome girl is like a demon. She’s trying to confuse the public and destroy all the glory of the Military Academy.","“So many heroes in the Military Academy have sacrificed their lives for this honor!","“Your Royal Highness, if word of this gets out, the soldiers will be terrified. Your Royal Highness, please kill this demon to appease the anger of the heroic spirits in the Military Academy!”","With that said, Master Duanmu knelt down and banged his forehead on the ground.","Master Duanmu was trying to use the crown prince to do his dirty work.","Master Duanmu finally found out that Feng Wu was the reason why Master Wang had become a Level 9 inscription master.","So, how could Master Duanmu not hate Feng Wu?","Now that he had such a good opportunity, of course, he would make good use of it.","Mr. Xu was dumbfounded.","To be honest, he was just used to opposing Feng Wu. Deep down, he admired Feng Wu a little.","But why did Master Duanmu suddenly want to kill Feng Wu?","Feng Wu, who was standing next to Jun Linyuan, was dumbfounded. What Master Duanmu said was so hilarious! How could he compare her to a demon?","Feng Wu walked away from Jun Linyuan, walked up to Master Duanmu, and stared at him.","Master Duanmu held his head high and puffed out his chest. He wasn’t afraid!","Feng Wu suddenly smiled. “Master Duanmu, you’ve found out Master Wang became a Level 9 inscription master because of my advice, haven’t you?”","Master Duanmu snorted arrogantly and remained silent.","Feng Wu said, “So, you hate me and want to use this as an excuse to get Jun Linyuan to kill me, right?”","Jun Linyuan?","Master Duanmu couldn’t believe a maid had called the crown prince by his full name.","Feng Wu gave Master Duanmu a mocking look and smirked. “But I’ll prove to you how stupid you are!”","Feng Wu had two options now.","The first option was simple. She could go up to Jun Linyuan right now, sit down on his lap, and give him a kiss in front of everyone. That would ensure that Master Duanmu would fall to the ground in fear and stop acting like a clown."]},{"number":3391,"title":"Chapter 3391 Proof (4)","paragraphs":["3391 Proof (4)","The second option was to prove that the black-robed man was Elder Dai, and slap everyone in the face with the truth.","Without a doubt, Feng Wu chose the second option.","She walked up to the black-robed man and waved her hand!","The mask on the black-robed man’s face cracked!","!!","Mr. Xu and the others looked at the black-robed man!","Was the black-robed man really Elder Dai?!","However, when they saw his face...","Mr. Xu heaved a sigh of relief, and so did Master Duanmu and the others.","Master Duanmu stared at Feng Wu and smirked. “Is that Elder Dai’s face? Why doesn’t it look like him?”","Elder Yin shook his head. “It’s not Elder Dai. I’m familiar with him. He doesn’t look like that.”","Elder Wu also said, “It’s not Elder Dai.”","Master Duanmu stared at Feng Wu again. “You keep saying the black-robed man is Elder Dai and that he’s a spy from the Dongsang Kingdom. You have the proof now. He’s not Elder Dai!","“Feng Wu, just because you work for the crown prince doesn’t mean you can do whatever you want! You can’t slander Elder Dai like this!","“What are you going to do about this?”","Master Wang and the others were worried about Feng Wu.","If he wasn’t Elder Dai, what was Feng Wu going to do now? She had insisted Elder Dai was a traitor.","Many people felt embarrassed for Feng Wu.","Aunt Qing was worried about what would happen.","Right now, Feng Wu wasn’t as embarrassed as everyone thought. She stared at the man in the black robe and smiled.","“You’re so proud of yourself now, aren’t you?” Feng Wu smiled at him. “Do you think you’ve fooled everyone? Do you think I’ve lost this game?","“But have you forgotten? I’m also an expert in disguise.","“Your little tricks may work on others, but do you think you can fool me?”","The black-robed man looked smug at first, but his expression changed a little.","However, he soon calmed down and didn’t respond to Feng Wu’s words at all.","Feng Wu smiled. Before anyone could react, she raised her hand.","She ripped the human skin mask off of Elder Dai’s face.","Seeing the mask in Feng Wu’s hand, everyone became tense.","Those standing on Jun Linyuan’s left were happy for Feng Wu, but those from the Military Academy frowned.","Apart from wearing a strange mask, this black-robed man also had a human skin mask stuck to his face. He was really careful.","So, was he really Elder Dai?!","Just then, hasty footsteps came from outside.","Everyone turned around and saw Elder Dongfang walking toward them. Behind her was a tall, burly middle-aged man.","Everyone immediately recognized that man.","“Elder Dai!”","“Elder Dongfang is here with Elder Dai!”","“Since the real Elder Dai is here, who’s the one kneeling there?”","Everyone was shocked.","When they looked at Feng Wu again, their eyes were full of pride and arrogance.","Elder Dongfang went up to Jun Linyuan and said, “Your Royal Highness, Elder Dai is here.”","Jun Linyuan stared at Elder Dai, whom Elder Dongfang had brought with him. His expression didn’t change. He gave the newcomer a meaningful look before turning to Feng Wu. “What do you think?”"]},{"number":3392,"title":"Chapter 3392 The Real One (1)","paragraphs":["3392 The Real One (1)","“What’s the point of that question? Feng Wu is obviously wrong!” Many people thought so.","The crown prince had obviously taken Feng Wu’s side.","Before Feng Wu could say anything, Master Duanmu stepped forward. “Wasn’t Miss Feng Wu very decisive when she tore off the human skin mask? Come on. Turn that black-robed man around and let us see if he’s Elder Dai.”","The black-robed man turned around on his own.","!!","Everyone was surprised to see his face.","He looked like Elder Dai from behind, but his face looked nothing like the real one.","Master Duanmu laughed out loud. “Elder Dai? Don’t make me laugh!”","Everyone saw the black-robed man’s face. Although they didn’t laugh as loudly as Master Duanmu, they still had their own thoughts.","Feng Wu had claimed that the black-robed man was Elder Dai, but it turned out the real Elder Dai was standing right in front of them. The black-robed man’s mask had been torn off, and he wasn’t Elder Dai at all.","Feng Wu was deep in thought.","Could it be that the black-robed man wasn’t Elder Dai? No, something was wrong.","Feng Wu turned to look at Elder Dai, who was standing next to Elder Dongfang. Elder Dai smiled at Feng Wu and stood still.","Feng Wu whispered in Jun Linyuan’s ear.","Jun Linyuan shook his head at her.","Feng Wu immediately knew what she had to do.","She walked away from Jun Linyuan with her hands behind her back and circled around Elder Dai, rubbing her chin as she walked.","Elder Dai smirked and let Feng Wu size him up.","Master Duanmu sneered at Feng Wu. “No matter how stubborn you are, you have to accept the truth. It’s been proven that Elder Dai isn’t...”","With a loud bang, Feng Wu made her move!","No one knew how Feng Wu did it. All they saw was Feng Wu hitting Elder Dai from behind!","Elder Dai was caught off guard and was forced to take a step forward. His blood surged, and he almost spat out a mouthful of blood!","“You!”","Before Elder Dai could say anything, Feng Wu pounced on him and attacked him.","Feng Wu was suddenly all over the place.","She hit Elder Dai over ten times in the chest before moving away from him.","Elder Dai’s blood surged, and he spat out a mouthful of blood that splattered all over the ground.","Everyone was astonished!","Master Duanmu stared at Feng Wu. “How dare you attack Elder Dai?!”","Ten meters away, Feng Wu smiled at “Elder Dai.” “Isn’t Elder Dai a Spiritual Overlord? If I remember correctly, he’s an intermediate one. I’m just a Level 6 Spiritual King, so how could I injure Elder Dai? That should be impossible.”","Hearing Feng Wu’s words, everyone looked at Elder Dai in bewilderment.","She was right.","Feng Wu was only a Level 6 Spiritual King. How could she have beaten up Elder Dai until he vomited blood? That didn’t make sense.","“Elder Dai” reacted quickly. He wiped the blood from the corner of his mouth and slowly said, “I’m already seriously injured, and you caught me off guard. I wasn’t careful enough.”","Feng Wu smiled. “Elder Dai was seriously injured? How did that happen? Which medicine refiner treated him?”"]},{"number":3393,"title":"Chapter 3393 The Real One (2)","paragraphs":["3393 The Real One (2)","“Elder Dai” was dumbfounded by Feng Wu’s questions.","In the end, he could only stammer, “I, I was Injured... injured in the chest and abdomen...”","Feng Wu smiled and asked Master Wang to examine him.","Master Wang was a decent medicine refiner.","!!","However, “Elder Dai” refused to be inspected.","The others didn’t notice anything unusual at first, but after seeing the interaction between Feng Wu and “Elder Dai,” they could tell something was off.","Something wasn’t right about this “Elder Dai.”","As the person in charge of the Disciplinary Hall, Elder Dai had always been stern, fierce and ruthless. However, why was this Elder Dai a little too cowardly?","Standing next to the black-robed man, Feng Wu smiled at him. “What do you think? Are you worried? Your twin brother isn’t that good an actor. He’s full of flaws and can’t stop making mistakes. That won’t do.”","The black-robed man didn’t even look at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu looked at the black-robed man and sighed. “Elder Dai, I didn’t expect you to be able to put two layers of human skin on your face. That’s a rare disguise.","“I can’t believe how careful you are, but I still got you.” Feng Wu looked at Elder Dai. “Do you want to do it yourself, or should I?”","Feng Wu didn’t try to hide anything, so everyone heard what she said.","What?","Twin brothers?","Elder Dai had two layers of a human skin mask?","What was all this?","Why did it sound so surreal?","It didn’t take long for everyone to understand what Feng Wu meant. With another wave of her hand, Feng Wu removed the last human skin mask on Elder Dai’s face and revealed his true appearance.","It was indeed Elder Dai’s face.","Human skin masks still had a thickness to them, so there was a limit to how many layers a person could wear.","It was already very difficult for Elder Dai to wear two layers, and Feng Wu didn’t believe that he could wear a third one.","Hence, two Elder Dais appeared in front of everyone.","“What...” Master Duanmu was the first to be shocked. “There are really two Elder Dais? Isn’t this too...”","Elder Dongfang and Mr. Xu were also stunned!","Why were there two Elder Dais? Were they really twins, as Feng Wu had said?","A strange sneer appeared on Elder Dai’s face.","In the next second, Feng Wu pinched his chin, and a pill slipped out of his mouth.","Master Wang rushed forward to pick it up. After taking a closer look, he exclaimed, “This is Semi-Divine Butterfly Poison. Once you bite it, the venom will flow into your throat. There’s no antidote. Even the gods wouldn’t be able to save you!”","Now, there was enough evidence to prove that Elder Dai was the greatest suspect.","Master Duanmu’s face instantly turned pale...","At that moment, Mr. Xu’s expression was indescribably ugly.","There was actually a spy among the higher-ups of the Military Academy. He was even an elder!","How much information had he given to the Dongsang Kingdom over the years? How many people had he instigated?!","Mr. Xu turned to look at Feng Wu with a grim face. “I’m going to take Elder Dai away for an interrogation.”","There was no give in his tone.","Feng Wu nodded. “But don’t kill him. I’ll need him to prove something later.”","Mr. Xu nodded. He held Elder Dai in his left hand and the twin brother in his right. Soon, they disappeared from everyone’s sight."]},{"number":3394,"title":"Chapter 3394 The Real One (3)","paragraphs":["3394 The Real One (3)","Everyone knew now that Mr. Xu was angry, Elder Dai would probably suffer.","However, it was still shocking to learn that Elder Dai was a spy.","Feng Wu looked at Elder Yin.","She noticed that Elder Yin was wiping his sweat.","!!","Feng Wu nodded at him with a smile. “Elder Yin, why are you sweating?”","Feng Wu’s words immediately made Elder Yin the target of public attention.","Everyone turned to look at Elder Yin when they heard what Feng Wu said.","Elder Yin hadn’t expected Feng Wu to pick him out, and he was so shocked that his face turned pale.","However, he soon noticed that everyone was staring at him, and he immediately returned to normal. He even forced a smile and said to Feng Wu, “Miss Feng Wu, you must be joking. I... I’m not sweating...”","However, Feng Wu pointed out Elder Yin all of a sudden, which was a strange reaction.","Feng Wu said, “Elder Yin, didn’t you treat me with disdain before? Why are you sucking up to me now? Are you feeling guilty?”","Elder Yin was infuriated. What was wrong with Feng Wu? Why was she picking on him?","Did she see something, or was she bluffing?","It was all Elder Yin could do to stay calm. He continued to smile at Feng Wu. “You’re with the crown prince. How can I not respect you?”","Feng Wu was about to say something, but after some thought, she said, “I’m sure you know what you’ve done.”","Elder Yin gave a perfectly guileless look.","The others were at a loss. They didn’t understand what Feng Wu and Elder Yin were talking about, so they looked at each other in confusion.","Seeing how arrogant Feng Wu was, Master Duanmu couldn’t take it anymore.","“Your Royal Highness, I have something to say,” Master Duanmu stepped forward and said respectfully.","A Level 9 inscription master was indeed qualified to speak to the crown prince in that way.","Jun Linyuan stared at Master Duanmu expressionlessly.","No one knew what the crown prince was thinking.","Master Duanmu met Jun Linyuan’s gaze before he lowered his head, not daring to look at Jun Linyuan again.","The crown prince was even more dignified than His Majesty. When he ascended to the throne in the future, he would be incredible.","The more he thought about it, the more Master Duanmu wanted to curry favor with the crown prince. He thought he would be able to cozy up to the crown prince and climb up the ranks. At this thought, Master Duanmu became even more excited!","“Your Royal Highness, I’ve developed a fighter jet,” Master Duanmu said loudly.","WHAT?!","Instantly, everyone’s eyes fell on Master Duanmu!","A fighter jet?","That was something that could greatly improve the military strength of the Junwu Empire!","The Junwu Empire was far inferior to the Dongsang Kingdom in terms of technology. Not only did the Junwu Empire have fighter jets, they also bombarded Nest Fortress with them.","Until now, the Junwu Empire didn’t have a single fighter jet of its own!","Therefore, when Master Duanmu said that he had developed a fighter jet, everyone was excited.","However, only two people remained calm.","One was the crown prince.","The other was Feng Wu.","Feng Wu glanced at Master Duanmu and asked casually, “A fighter jet? You, Master Duanmu, developed a fighter jet? Who are you kidding?!”","Feng Wu’s scornful attitude offended Master Duanmu, and his face turned livid."]},{"number":3395,"title":"Chapter 3395 The Real One (4)","paragraphs":["3395 The Real One (4)","It not only agitated Master Duanmu, but also Master Duanmu’s disciple, Ji Ying.","Ji Ying stood up and scolded Feng Wu. “Feng Wu, stop it.”","The crown prince, who had been sitting lazily in the chair, immediately straightened his back!","He then turned his sharp eyes on Feng Wu and Ji Ying.","!!","Ji Ying felt a chill run down his spine when Jun Linyuan glared at him.","But he didn’t know what was happening.","He reprimanded Feng Wu in a low voice. “This is my master. Show some respect!”","Feng Wu almost laughed.","“He’s your master, not mine. Why should I show some respect? Who the hell are you?”","Ji Ying said, “Xiao Wu, have you forgotten? I said that I would marry you!”","No one noticed that blue veins were already popping on the crown prince’s forehead.","Feng Wu looked at Ji Ying as if he were a retard. “Who are you? Who gave you the right to talk to me? Get lost! I’m talking to your master!”","Feng Wu was doing it on purpose. She wanted to humiliate Ji Ying and make him angry.","If a person didn’t get emotional, they wouldn’t show anything.","One would only show their true emotions when they couldn’t control them.","Both Master Duanmu and Ji Ying had to pay the price for what they did.","Master Duanmu didn’t know why Feng Wu was doing this. What he needed to do now was convince the crown prince that he could make a fighter jet.","He took out a stack of drawings from his pocket and presented them with both hands respectfully. “These are the drawings that I’ve been working on for many years. They’re all about fighter jets. Please take a look, Your Royal Highness.”","Feng Wu glanced at the drawings. Why did they look so familiar?","When Master Wang saw this, his eyes widened!","They were exactly the same as the analytical drawings that Feng Wu had given him before.","Feng Wu looked at Master Wang in confusion.","Master Wang’s heart lurched. He had a bad feeling.","Feng Wu asked in bewilderment, “What happened?”","Master Wang subconsciously reached into his chest pocket.","He had always carried these blueprints with him. They were wrapped in oil paper and were placed close to his chest. Even when he was sleeping, he wouldn’t take them out. He would always hug his chest and curl up to sleep. No one could take the drawings away.","Moreover, he hadn’t taken a shower recently, so it was impossible for someone to steal them.","Feng Wu asked, “Master Wang, what’s going on?”","Master Wang touched his chest pocket. It felt like a stack of paper was there, and there was no change in the thickness. It should be fine, right?","However, Master Wang was still worried. He turned around, quietly took out the blueprints wrapped in oil paper, and carefully unfolded them.","Master Wang’s expression changed with just one look.","It wasn’t the ones that Feng Wu had drawn!","These blueprints were crudely drawn with crooked lines, and were just random inscription blueprints.","Feng Wu and Master Wang exchanged surprised looks.","Beads of sweat rolled down Master Wang’s forehead.","“This, this... What’s going on? I’ve been carrying them with me...” Master Wang was a little anxious. “How could they be swapped? Who swapped them? Where did the real blueprints go? I, I...”","Master Wang was extremely anxious. “I took them out to study last night. They can’t have been lost!”","Feng Wu sighed. She knew what had happened."]},{"number":3396,"title":"Chapter 3396 I Drew Them (1)","paragraphs":["3396 I Drew Them (1)","Feng Wu sighed. She knew what had happened.","The blueprints of the fighter jet that she had left for Master Wang had been stolen.","Feng Wu looked at Master Wang, who was both angry and flustered. Pointing at the blueprints in Jun Linyuan’s hand, he said to Feng Wu, “It must be those. It must be!”","Feng Wu asked, “Are you sure?”","!!","Master Wang: “The inscriptions and formations in your blueprints are extremely profound. It’s not something that others can copy just because they want to. Previously, I tried to copy them, but I couldn’t. My hand couldn’t keep up with my brain, so I don’t believe Duanmu can do it either.”","Feng Wu nodded and walked up to the stage.","Master Duanmu frowned when he saw this.","He had indeed asked someone to steal these drawings from Master Wang. He really didn’t expect his junior brother to actually have such astonishing talent and research fighter jets to such an extent in such a short period of time.","Master Duanmu naturally wouldn’t let Master Wang get stronger like this. This time, he had to beat his junior brother.","Standing next to Jun Linyuan, Feng Wu turned to look at the drawings.","They really were the blueprints she had drawn.","Master Duanmu had just brought them back to her.","She almost didn’t know what to say.","Master Duanmu had asked around and heard that Master Linghu had given Feng Wu the Phoenix Pen. Master Duanmu had been on guard since then.","He didn’t think Feng Wu was very good at inscriptions and formations. After all, she was so young. How good could she be?","Master Duanmu was alarmed because he didn’t believe it was Feng Wu who had taught Master Wang. The instructions had to have come from Master Linghu.","The more Master Duanmu thought about it, the more guarded he became. He couldn’t lose his title as Nest’s number one inscription master!","Master Duanmu stared at Feng Wu and thought to himself, “It seems that I’ll have to suppress both Feng Wu and Junior Brother Wang.”","He believed the crown prince would side with the number one inscription master of Nest instead of a maid.","Meanwhile, Feng Wu looked at the drawings in Jun Linyuan’s hand and asked, “What do you think of the drawings?”","Jun Linyuan nodded. “They’re good.”","Feng Wu’s eyes lit up. “Do you think so?”","Jun Linyuan said, “Yes.”","Feng Wu said smugly, “Of course they’re good! I drew them!”","Everyone looked at Feng Wu in shock.","Was the crown prince’s maid out of her mind? Master Duanmu had been working on this for years. How could she say that she was the one who drew them?","Elder Wu frowned. “Master Duanmu just presented these blueprints to His Royal Highness. Miss Feng Wu, please don’t overdo it.”","After saying that, Elder Wu gave Elder Yin a look, hinting for the latter to chime in.","However, Elder Yin had been frightened by Feng Wu before, and he was now in a state of panic. He didn’t dare provoke this girl. He lowered his head and pretended that he didn’t exist, which pissed Elder Wu off.","However, Master Duanmu stepped forward himself.","He glared at Feng Wu. “I was the one who submitted the blueprints for the fighter jet!”"]},{"number":3397,"title":"Chapter 3397 I Drew Them (2)","paragraphs":["3397 I Drew Them (2)","Master Duanmu said, “How dare you say that in front of so many people? It’s obvious how arrogant and domineering you are!","“Your Royal Highness!” Master Duanmu cupped his fists at Jun Linyuan and said righteously, “Your Royal Highness, you’re our future emperor! This maid of yours has a bad character and ridiculous behavior. She’ll tarnish your reputation. I implore you to punish her!”","With that said, Master Duanmu knelt on the ground and bowed.","Ji Ying suddenly had an idea.","!!","If the crown prince punished Feng Wu, she wouldn’t be so arrogant anymore. He would take the chance to comfort her, and she might accept him.","At that thought, Ji Ying knelt down as well. “Your Royal Highness, please punish Feng Wu!”","Seeing that the other people from the Military Academy were about to kneel down, Elder Dongfang hurriedly said, “What nonsense are you saying? Shut up!”","Elder Dongfang glared fiercely at the people on her side!","Did they all want to die? Didn’t they know how protective the crown prince was? How dare they ask him to punish her? They would be punished first! What a bunch of idiots!","Elder Wu believed he was just as respectable as Elder Dongfang, so he wouldn’t listen to Elder Dongfang’s advice at all. He knelt down and repeated Master Duanmu’s words.","Jun Linyuan was really angry now.","His eyes were dark and bottomless, as if a boundless storm was brewing.","The crown prince stood up, ready to kill, but Feng Wu stopped him.","Feng Wu knew very well that Jun Linyuan couldn’t hold back his temper at all. He really would kill Master Duanmu with one strike.","However, that would make people think he was a violent man who killed people like flies. Feng Wu didn’t want Jun Linyuan to bear such a bad reputation when justice was on her side.","“I’ll take care of it, okay?” Feng Wu lowered her voice and coaxed the crown prince, who was about to explode.","However, Jun Linyuan’s expression didn’t change.","He was about to stand up again.","Feng Wu cupped her fists under her chin and blinked. She looked very cute. “Please?”","What was that tone? The crown prince looked at Feng Wu.","Feng Wu lowered her voice so that only the two of them could hear her. “I’m begging you, okay? If I can’t handle it, you can kill Master Duanmu if you want. I won’t stop you.”","The crown prince snorted and said haughtily, “Fine. I was only trying to help you!”","Feng Wu said, “It’s not that I don’t appreciate it. I’m just worried that you’ll be accused of murder.”","Jun Linyuan’s cold expression faltered for a moment. Staring at Feng Wu, he seemed expectant. He asked gingerly, “Are you... worried about me?”","She really cared about him, huh? Hearing the concern in her voice, the crown prince calmed down in an instant, and he was delighted. That was really...","“Ahem.” The crown prince gave Feng Wu a stern look. “You can do whatever you want.”","The two of them were whispering together, and they were in the highest position. Did they think everyone was blind?","Although the others couldn’t hear what they were saying, their demeanor was self-explanatory.","When Master Duanmu saw this, he was a little confused...","It seemed he had guessed wrong."]},{"number":3398,"title":"Chapter 3398 What a Joke","paragraphs":["3398 What a Joke","The idea crossed Master Duanmu’s mind.","But he soon deemed it impossible. He was a dignified Level 9 inscription master, the number one inscription master in Nest! No other cultivator was as important as he was.","The crown prince was a man, and in Master Duanmu’s eyes, men should find women as disposable as clothes. The only thing that mattered to a man was a great career.","Hence, Master Duanmu despised Feng Wu and thought that he was the best.","!!","By then, Feng Wu had turned around and was staring at Master Duanmu. “The drawings are pretty good. You’re halfway through building a fighter jet. Is there more?”","Master Duanmu smirked arrogantly, as if he couldn’t be bothered to talk to Feng Wu.","The crown prince flared up again.","However, he remembered his agreement with Feng Wu and frowned at Master Duanmu. “Speak!”","Master Duanmu’s heart lurched. Was the crown prince a little upset?","Master Duanmu hurriedly said, “I’ve already drawn half of the drawings. They’re the result of my hard work over the years. I don’t have anything else.”","Jun Linyuan frowned. “Nothing else?”","Master Duanmu said, “No... But I can guarantee that in less than a year, I will give Your Royal Highness the other half of the design.”","The crown prince’s eyes darkened.","Sensing the coldness in Jun Linyuan’s eyes, Master Duanmu shivered and said in a hurry, “It won’t take that long. Six months. I’ll finish it in six months!”","Jun Linyuan didn’t say anything, and only smirked.","Master Duanmu smiled bitterly. “Your Royal Highness, half a year is really tight. We can’t work faster than that.”","The crown prince smirked a little and looked at Feng Wu. “What do you think?”","Feng Wu said, “I don’t need half a year. I can write the rest of the inscriptions right now.”","The corner of Master Duanmu’s mouth twitched. He had seen people brag, but he had never seen anyone brag like this. How arrogant was this girl?","Master Duanmu wasn’t the only one who was speechless.","Everyone else stared at Feng Wu in shock.","How could she brag like this? If His Royal Highness asked her to finish the drawings immediately, would she really be able to do it?","As expected!","Master Duanmu sneered.","“Miss Feng Wu... I don’t understand what you’re saying.”","Feng Wu said, “Master Duanmu, you don’t understand what I mean?”","Master Duanmu said, “Does Miss Feng Wu think this design...”","Feng Wu said, “That’s right. I was the one who gave Master Wang the drawings. I don’t know what you did, but you stole it from Master Wang, and now you’re giving it to the crown prince.”","Feng Wu had always been hinting at it, but she didn’t make it so explicit at first so that she wouldn’t embarrass Master Duanmu right away.","But now, Feng Wu was practically accusing Master Duanmu of being a thief. Master Duanmu couldn’t take it anymore.","He sneered with disdain and mockery on his face!","“So, you’re saying that you drew the blueprints which I gave to the crown prince.”","Feng Wu looked at Master Duanmu in resignation. “I’ve been talking about it for so long, and you’ve only just figured it out.”","Master Duanmu burst out laughing.","He wasn’t the only one who laughed. The people on his side, be it Elder Wu or Elder Yin, also laughed.","“This is the funniest joke I’ve ever heard. Miss Feng Wu, can you not be so unreasonable?” Elder Wu looked at Feng Wu and sighed."]},{"number":3399,"title":"Chapter 3399 Who’s the Traitor?","paragraphs":["3399 Who’s the Traitor?","Elder Wu had never seen a girl more proud than Feng Wu. How could she be so ridiculous?","“Don’t you know who Master Duanmu is? How dare you say that?” Elder Wu looked at Feng Wu and sighed. “He’s the best inscription master in Nest. He’s second only to Master Linghu in the Junwu Empire!","“Do you know how many years we’ve been working on the research of fighter jets? We’ve been researching it even before you were born! It’s only now that we’ve made a little progress!","“The drawings in your hand were drawn by our Master Duanmu with all his heart and soul. In the end, you’re saying it’s your work. Does that mean it’s yours?","!!","“There are inscriptions and numbers all over it. Do you understand? How dare you boast that it’s yours? Little girl, this world is much bigger than you think. Your good looks won’t work all the time. In our line of work, knowledge is the most important thing!”","The more Elder Wu spoke, the more serious he became. The surrounding people also nodded.","Elder Qing nodded as well. He looked at Feng Wu accusingly.","“Elder Wu is right. In the field of inscriptions, knowledge is indeed essential. If you understand, you understand. If you don’t, you don’t. No one can skip a step. Everyone has to learn the knowledge bit by bit from the beginning to the end. No one can steal other people’s achievements!”","Aunt Qing pinched Elder Qing’s arm.","Elder Qing frowned in pain and looked at her in confusion.","Aunt Qing whispered, “You don’t know Miss Wu at all. What right do you have to say that? In my opinion, Master Duanmu might have stolen the blueprints from Master Wang!”","Although Aunt Qing lowered her voice, everyone here was a capable cultivator. How could they not hear her?","Master Duanmu turned to stare at Aunt Qing.","Aunt Qing didn’t back down. “Why are you staring at me? Am I wrong? Before dawn this morning, I saw one of Master Wang’s disciples running toward you. He ran into Master Duanmu’s room. You can’t deny that!”","To be more precise, she was talking about the time between three to five in the morning.","What was Master Wang’s disciple doing in Master Duanmu’s room at that hour?","Well...","Master Wang exclaimed, “The design of my fighter jet was still there last night. I hugged it in my arms to sleep, but it’s gone now. It’s been replaced with a pile of waste paper!”","As he spoke, Master Wang took out the oil paper bag from his pocket and showed it to everyone!","Everyone looked at him in confusion. Could it really be...","At this moment, Master Duanmu wished he could slap himself to death.","Why did he have to provoke Aunt Qing? It wasn’t like he didn’t know that she had a big mouth and always spoke her mind!","Master Duanmu gave Elder Qing a warning glance.","Normally, Elder Qing would side with Master Duanmu, but Feng Wu obviously had the crown prince’s support now. Master Duanmu was protected by his status as a Level 9 inscription master, but Elder Qing wasn’t.","Therefore, Elder Qing lowered his head and pretended not to notice Master Duanmu’s gaze.","Master Duanmu was furious.","Meanwhile, Master Wang rushed to Aunt Qing’s side. “Who was it? Which of my disciples entered Duanmu’s room?”"]},{"number":3400,"title":"Chapter 3400 Where’s the Proof?","paragraphs":["3400 Where’s the Proof?","Master Wang had a total of five disciples. They were Wang Zhiheng, Mo Ziming, Yue Banban, Dong Chen and Li Chen.","At this moment, the five disciples looked at each other in disbelief. “There’s actually a traitor among us?!”","Master Wang chased after Aunt Qing and asked, “Who was it? Who did you see?”","The others were also curious. “Who was it?!”","Master Duanmu sneered. “There’s no such thing! Elder Qing, control your wife!”","Seeing his warning gaze, Elder Qing couldn’t play dumb anymore.","He tugged at Aunt Qing and glared at her.","Aunt Qing shook off Elder Qing and turned to look at Master Duanmu. “I really saw it with my own eyes. I even knew who that person is. I was just curious at first, but since you care so much, Master Duanmu, it means there’s really something going on!”","Master Duanmu was furious. Why did this woman like to ruin his plans?!","Master Duanmu snickered. “Mrs. Qing, you’re really doing everything to curry favor with Miss Feng Wu. You even fabricated a lie that is easily seen through.”","Aunt Qing was furious. “I’m telling the truth!”","Master Duanmu asked, “Where’s the evidence?”","Aunt Qing said, “I saw it with my own eyes!”","Master Duanmu asked, “Where’s the evidence?”","Aunt Qing was speechless. She really didn’t have any evidence. If she did, it would be so satisfying to throw the evidence in Master Duanmu’s face.","However, she couldn’t. She was so angry that her face turned pale. The corners of her mouth trembled, and she grew anxious, but there was nothing she could do.","Master Duanmu was very pleased with himself. So what if she saw it? She had no evidence!","Feng Wu sighed.","Immediately, everyone’s attention returned to her.","Feng Wu looked at Master Duanmu and smiled. “I see you’re very pleased with yourself, Master Duanmu.”","Master Duanmu placed his hands behind his back and straightened his back. He said proudly, “I’m just telling the truth.”","Feng Wu said, “What a truth.”","Master Duanmu sneered.","So what if Miss Feng Wu was favored by the crown prince? He believed he was the only one who could design a fighter jet! Everyone had to respect him!","Feng Wu stared at Master Duanmu. “Master Duanmu, you’ll need another six months to come up with the rest of the design, won’t you?”","Master Duanmu nodded.","Feng Wu said, “You drew the design yourself, right?”","Master Duanmu nodded again.","The next moment!","Whoosh!","Unexpectedly, Feng Wu tore up all the design drafts in her hands!","Moreover, she threw it into water. Instantly, the words on the paper turned blurry, and the paper turned to paste.","Everyone present was shocked!","Everything happened too quickly for them to react!","By the time they finally reacted, the paper had already been torn apart and turned to paste.","No one was more shocked than Master Duanmu!","His eyes were bloodshot as he stared at Feng Wu, and they almost popped out!","He rushed up in a few steps, only to see the blueprints had been destroyed.","“What are you doing?!","“Do you know what you did?","“Do you know what you destroyed?!","“That was the design draft of a fighter jet! I studied it for several years!","“How could you destroy it?! How dare you?!”"]}]);
